,'%sAAAAAAAAA(%s)AA %sA(%s)AAAAAAA'),(235,'Sweeper (%s) was picked up by %s (%s).'),(236,'AAA(%s)A %sA(%s)AAAAAAAA'),(237,'%sA(%s)AAAA(%s)AAAAAA'),(238,'Center'),(239,'Caligo Dungeon %dF is free to enter from %d:00 to %d:00.'),(240,'Free entry to Caligo Dungeon has ended.'),(241,'Players who have not paid will be sent to %s in one minute. Thank you.'),(242,'War applications are not open yet.'),(243,'Only Slayers on the quest may enter.'),(244,'Only Vampires on the quest may enter.'),(245,'Only Ousters on the quest may enter.'),(246,'Ore Crystal'),(247,'Your partner\'s name is %s'),(248,'You are not married.'),(249,'Free'),(250,'Rei'),(251,'Geld'),(252,' Zard'),(253,'No entry'),(254,'Slayer Common'),(255,'Vampire Common'),(256,'Ousters Common'),(257,'Unoccupied castle'),(258,'Clan'),(259,'Clan'),(260,'Castle'),(261,'Regen Zone Tower'),(262,'Hello! Your monthly plan is valid until %d-%d-%d. Today is %d-%d-%d.'),(263,'Hello! You are on a points plan with %d points remaining.'),(264,'Hello! Your monthly plan has ended; your account is now a standard account with %d points left.'),(265,'Hello! Your account has been switched to a monthly plan.'),(266,'Hello! You have %d points remaining.'),(267,'Underground Waterway'),(268,'Eslania Northwest'),(269,'Eslania Northeast'),(270,'Eslania Southwest'),(271,'Eslania Dungeon'),(272,'Drobeta Southwest'),(273,'Drobeta Southeast'),(274,'Timore Southwest'),(275,'Timore Southeast'),(276,'Laom Dungeon 2F'),(277,'Bathory Dungeon B2F'),(278,'Limbo Castle Southeast'),(279,'Limbo Castle Northeast'),(280,'Limbo Castle Northwest'),(281,'Timore Northeast'),(282,'Mount Rodin Southwest'),(283,'Mount Rodin Southeast'),(284,'Icen Dungeon 1F'),(285,'Icen Dungeon 2F'),(286,'Adam\'s Holy Land East'),(287,'Hanial Dungeon B1F'),(288,'Hanial Dungeon B2F'),(289,'Castalo Northeast'),(290,'Ghorgova Tunnel'),(291,'Drobeta Northeast'),(292,'Drobeta Northwest'),(293,'Mount Rodin Northeast'),(294,'Mount Rodin Northwest'),(295,'Rasen Dungeon 2F'),(296,'Laom Dungeon 2F'),(297,'Eslania Southwest'),(298,'Limbo Castle Northeast'),(299,'Castalo Northeast'),(300,'Eslania Northwest'),(301,'Eslania Dungeon'),(302,'Drobeta Southeast'),(303,'Timore Southeast'),(304,'Laom Dungeon 2F'),(305,'Limbo Castle Southeast'),(306,'Limbo Castle Northwest'),(307,'Drobeta Southwest'),(308,'Icen Dungeon 1F'),(309,'Icen Dungeon 2F'),(310,'Castalo Northeast'),(311,'Drobeta Northwest'),(312,'Mount Rodin Southwest'),(313,'Timore Southeast'),(314,'Laom Dungeon 1F'),(315,'Yellow Zimott'),(316,'Green Zimott'),(317,'Blue Zimott'),(318,'Red Zimott'),(319,'Black Zimott'),(320,'Yellow Zircon'),(321,'Green Zircon'),(322,'Blue Zircon'),(323,'Red Zircon'),(324,'Black Zircon'),(325,'Elite Infected / Elite Alcan'),(326,'Man-Eater / xx Monster / Golemer'),(327,'Elite Hell Wizard / Elite Dark Screamer / Elite Chaos Guardian'),(328,'Lord Chaos / Elite Ghoul Crag / Elite Dark Haze'),(329,'Elite Mum Rimmon / Elite Reaper / Elite Dark Berith / Elite Necromancer'),(330,'This feature is not supported yet.'),(331,'No wonder it\'s so noisy outside?? Did you get through those horrible traps to arrive here?'),(332,'Please don\'t be mistaken. Although I have settled here, I\'m not clear the origin of those traps.'),(333,'I\'m also obssessed by the traps?? it\'s a mystery who created them.'),(334,'Wait, there must be something to appear. Is it you guys who do this? Do you guys want to hurt me?'),(335,'Don\'t you do that? Anyway, you are all strong warriors.'),(336,'You guys make me think about a girl named Jendaluke'),(337,'Her power is the greatest. I was getting to respect her when she visited me for saving her nation.'),(338,'She is so young to be here for saving the nation.'),(339,'Why are you guys visiting me? You should know that it\'s very dangerous here.'),(340,'Now I\'m so headache that I cannot help you for the moment.'),(341,'Well, you should not have ejected these guests who were asking for help. It\'s so rude.'),(342,'Please don\'t blame me. The old make such mistakes sometimes. After a while, watch the ballon go up,hahaha!'),(343,'Great, wonderful! Let me see.'),(344,'I really cannot stand the fragrance from your guys.'),(345,'It\'s a humiliation that I\'m defeated by you guys.'),(346,'It\'s dangerous here. Get out of here?? Oh, I can\'t hold on.'),(347,'Well! I felt so bad?? You guys\' expressions are so ridiculous. I\'d like to play more tricks on you more.'),(348,'Stop! Stop attack! I didn\'t mean to. Well?? I thought everything was well, but evilness still exists, cannot get rid of.'),(349,'Things which have happened cannot be redeemed. Do you want to make a compromise with me now ?'),(350,'The power which Jendaluke wanted to have?? Don\'t you want to know? '),(351,'Then, Jendaluke refused my request. However, I believe you will not absolutely.'),(352,'Then, I gave her the power she wanted at the expense of her flesh and blood. I don\'t think the requirement is high.'),(353,'I was hurt badly so I decided to cut off all connections with outside. That\'s why I designed all of these traps.'),(354,'I abandoned all my own glories!'),(355,'Look! I created lives with my power. You all can get renascence.'),(356,'Ah? What\'s wrong? Is it not enough? If no human child\'s blood, perfect life cannot be created!'),(357,'Once we had Jendaluke\'s blood?? By the way, try some of your blood, although it\'s not that pure.'),(358,'I will creat perfect life. Your blood is flowing in my body, you guys should be feel proud.'),(359,'The blood of like you guys??. You don\'t need to feel sorry. I\'ll take care of everything. '),(360,'I really don\'t understand, why are you feeling so hopeful for life? Anyway, everybody will die, turning to dust'),(361,'Ask her who she is.'),(362,'You\'d better go back. It\'s good for you.'),(363,'I warned you, it\'s a dangerous place. Now, I\'m?? Ah??'),(364,'Ahaha, the shell is finally removed.'),(365,'Magic was used for bringing you memorable things. But now, it seems no useful.'),(366,'Have you guys ever seen that? This is a real masterwork. Look at yourselves who are fighting with illusions, so poor.'),(367,'How\'s your feeling? Is it great to be tricked?'),(368,'No, please, please let me go!'),(369,'From now on, nothing is illusion.'),(370,'OK, follow me!'),(371,'I\'m tired of people who play double characters or things like just waiting for food.'),(372,'Only the defending side\'s alliance can use this.'),(373,'Agreed to leave the alliance.'),(374,'Refused to leave the alliance.'),(375,'Agreed to leave the alliance.'),(376,'Refused to leave the alliance.'),(377,'Expelled from the alliance.'),(378,'The guild has joined the alliance.'),(379,'The alliance has been disbanded.');

