TRUNCATE TABLE `SSStringPool`;
INSERT INTO `SSStringPool` VALUES (0,'Your team registration request has been approved.'),(1,'Your team registration has been approved. From now on you are under your leader\'s command'),(2,'Your clan registration request has been approved.'),(3,'Your clan registration has been approved. From now on you are under your leader\'s command'),(4,'Your team membership has been approved.'),(5,'Your clan membership has been approved.'),(6,'The team has been disbanded.'),(7,'The clan has been disbanded.'),(8,'The team has been canceled. Your registration fee has been refunded.'),(9,'The clan has been canceled. Your registration fee has been refunded.');

TRUNCATE TABLE `Script`;
INSERT INTO `Script` VALUES (100,'Gruber','These accessories of mine will build up your basic strength. I am sure they will be a great help when you fight the vampires. Take a look.','Yes. May I see your wares?\n\t\t **Would you be interested in buying something from me? I have goods to sell.\n\t\t **I am here about the Centauro (pet) quest.\n\t\t **There is nothing I particularly need right now.\n\t\t'),(101,'Gruber','Did you know there are ciphers hidden in the Bible? Everyone in this line of work knows it.',''),(102,'Gruber','If you think every cipher and secret can be broken, you are mistaken.',''),(103,'Gruber','There was a time when no cipher could hold out against me. These days the computers do it all, though...',''),(104,'Gruber','Conan saved my life. I have never seen a finer slayer than that man.',''),(105,'Gruber','The Blue Drops I carry will improve your items further. But the basics are what matter in a person. Train hard, always.',''),(106,'Gruber','Work out exactly which of your strengths is lacking. Making up the difference with items is one way to go about it.',''),(110,'Gruber','Well now, you are no customer... I turn down work that does not pay, but this business is rather interesting. So then, I take it you come qualified?','What is the Centauro quest?\n\t\t**I have completed the Centauro quest. My reward?'),(111,'Gruber','So you have finally gained the skill to pilot a Centauro. Congratulations. The Centauro is enormously useful, but it is a delicate machine. It is fresh off the line, not even on the market yet. E.V.E. headquarters asked us to test it, and we are issuing it in strictly limited numbers. Piloting one demands very fine control. The battlefield is a chaotic place, as you know. So I will give you your chance now. Think of it as a test of the machine. Given your abilities, %(MonsterName) suits you best. Bring down 80 of them within one hour and you pass. Shall we begin the test?','I will do it.\n\t\t**No, I will take you up on it another time.'),(200,'Smirovich','Welcome back. What is giving you trouble this time? Let me see it. Hmm... plenty of work to do here. To let it get into this state before coming to me... you are hardly a fit owner. I will have it fixed shortly, so leave it over there, would you?','Yes. Please repair this quickly.\n\t**Smirovich, would you silver-plate this weapon for me?\n\t**I would like to trade a Full Moon Card for an item.\n\t**I would like to trade a New Moon Card for an item.\n\t**I have come to trade a Lucky Pouch for an item.\n\t**I will come by the next time I need a repair.'),(201,'Smirovich','Believe it or not, I worked as a slayer myself once. You would never guess it.',''),(202,'Smirovich','Everyone takes me for late twenties. Late twenties, early thirties, what is the difference anyway.',''),(203,'Smirovich','One of these days they will all be calling me the hand of God. Ha ha!',''),(204,'Smirovich','Of course I would love to repair things for free, but materials are not cheap, you know. And my funds are hardly generous.',''),(205,'Smirovich','Did you know most of the funding E.V.E. receives goes on buying weapons and paying for treatment?',''),(206,'Smirovich','I am afraid the gifts cannot be handed out to everyone. This one was made especially for the players who paid to enjoy the game. If you are not entitled to one, my apologies, but you had best be on your way.','I am entitled to a gift.\r\n**Yes, understood. I will be on my way.'),(207,'Smirovich','The gift is a necklace, a bracelet or a ring, a rare accessory carrying two options. Remember that the higher the sum of your stats, the better the grade and the options you will get. And the gift is handed out once only.','Yes. Understood. Please give me the gift.\r\n**I will come back another time.'),(300,'Johan','Are you hurt anywhere? Let me have a look. You know you need a vaccine at once if a vampire has bitten you, I trust?','I am in your hands. Treat me gently, please.\r\n**I would like to buy some treatment ampoules and the like.\r\n**I would like to sell what I am carrying.\r\n**Set resurrection point\r\n**No. I have no time for treatment right now. I had better go.'),(301,'Johan','When my wife and daughter were dying, books were no help at all.',''),(302,'Johan','It is not just because he is my son, but Griffin really is a fine young man.',''),(303,'Johan','Headquarters covers treatment costs in full, so you need not pay a thing. Ha ha.',''),(304,'Johan','Sometimes... I see that day\'s nightmare play out again in front of me. Ah...',''),(305,'Johan','There is nothing to say you will never find yourself in a place desperate enough to need faith.',''),(400,'Yoshihara','Always wear gloves and boots to protect your hands and feet from the vampires\' deadly poisons and acids. Would you like to see the list?','Yoshihara. Has anything worthwhile come in?\r\n**I would like to sell these goods.\r\n**I will stop by another time.'),(401,'Yoshihara','Hacking is a lonely fight, really. It is not for everyone.',''),(402,'Yoshihara','My mother is Japanese. Not that I take after her much, do I?',''),(403,'Yoshihara','It seems there are vampires behind the true owners of most of the multinationals.',''),(404,'Yoshihara','Come to me if you need gloves or boots.',''),(405,'Yoshihara','For helmets and armour, go and speak to Sandra.',''),(406,'Yoshihara','If a vampire\'s poison touches your skin, wash it off with chemicals immediately.',''),(500,'Chris','My name is Christopher Klein. Everyone calls me Chris. I grew up right here in Eslanian City. If you have bulky things you will not be needing for a while, tell me. It costs a little, but you pay once and it is free from then on. I think it is pricey myself, but the rate is not mine to set... Care to give it a try?','Fine. I will store some things. Here is a hundred thousand dollars.\n\t\t**I would like to see my storage... show me, would you.\n\t\t**I have some questions about the monster hunting quest.\n\t\t**I have finished the monster hunting quest. I would like my reward.\n\t\t**The monster hunting quest looks too hard for me.\n\t\t**Hmm... let me think about it. Keep up the good work.'),(501,'Chris','In this business, trust is everything. Not once has anything been mixed up or stolen.',''),(502,'Chris','If you have something to store, just say the word.',''),(503,'Chris','I want to get out there and fight the vampires too!',''),(504,'Chris','I miss my sweetheart...',''),(505,'Chris','Hello there.',''),(506,'Chris','Have you seen what Gruber sells up on the second floor? Accessories that raise your stats. For someone as green as me, they would be a real help.',''),(507,'Chris','It is a relief not to have to travel far for Blue Drops any more. Where does Gruber find it all, I wonder?',''),(508,'Chris','The best part of a quest is the quest item you get at the end, I think. Even if you only get to use it for a short while.',''),(509,'Chris','I still have a lot to learn, but I have studied up on the quests. If there is anything you do not know, ask me and I will help.',''),(510,'Chris','Every monster you have hunted so far will be forfeited. Do you really want to abandon the quest?','Yes.\r\n**No. I will carry on.\r\n'),(511,'Chris','You have no quest in progress. Unless my list is wrong, that is.','Goodbye, then.\r\n'),(512,'Chris','If something urgent has come up, there is nothing for it. Come and try again whenever you like.','Goodbye, then.\r\n'),(600,'Sandra','New helmets, armour and belts have come in. The new armour is quite sturdy. Would you like to look?','Yes. Show me whether you have anything worth buying.\r\n**There are a few things of mine I would like to sell.\r\n**I will come by again next time. Goodbye.'),(601,'Sandra','Mossad really is the finest intelligence service in the world.',''),(602,'Sandra','I wonder how Hannibal is keeping these days. It has been a while since I saw him...',''),(603,'Sandra','If you need armour, come to me. I will recommend something good.',''),(604,'Sandra','Without a helmet, a single blow from a vampire can cost you your life.',''),(605,'Sandra','For gloves and boots and the like, go and see Yoshihara.',''),(700,'Hasbro','If you have come to buy a shield, you have made an excellent choice. A shield is essential if you fight with a sword. Would you like to see what I have made? I think you will be more than satisfied.','I need a shield myself... would you recommend a good one?\r\n**Hasbro, I would like to sell these. What do you say?\r\n**Would you silver-plate this weapon for me?\r\n**I do not need a shield just yet. Keep up the good work.'),(701,'Hasbro','My family were blacksmiths in Greece for generations. As am I.',''),(702,'Hasbro','To fight a vampire, you need a weapon made specially for it.',''),(703,'Hasbro','An ordinary sword or blade will barely scratch a vampire.',''),(704,'Hasbro','Hello there. Hasbro Haberman, at your service.',''),(705,'Hasbro','Weapons forged from silver blessed by a priest slow a vampire\'s regeneration.',''),(800,'Nuwa','The blade, you see, is not something you master by strength alone. Strength matters, but before that you must learn restraint. Take a good look at yourself. If you believe you are ready to learn the blade, I will pass on everything I know.','Nuwa, teach me your techniques.\r\n**I would like to buy a blade. May I see them?\r\n**I would like to sell what I am carrying.\r\n**I will see you next time. Farewell.'),(801,'Nuwa','What I killed were not people. They were vampires. That is all there is to it.',''),(802,'Nuwa','Even now I do not think I can restrain myself.',''),(803,'Nuwa','Compared to a sword, a blade is heavy and slow. Keep that in mind.',''),(804,'Nuwa','When you meet a vampire, take both arms off first. The head comes after.',''),(805,'Nuwa','Go to Hasbro or Smirovich and have them silver-plate your weapon.',''),(806,'Nuwa','Sword or blade, what matters is how you use it.',''),(900,'Han','You. Do you wish to learn the sword? The sword is this: before you use it, you must always still your mind and put yourself in order. A scattered spirit makes for a scattered blade. So mastering yourself comes before wielding the sword. Are you ready to take one up?','Mister Han. Pass on a new technique to me.\r\n**Rather than training, I would like to see your new swords.\r\n**I would like to sell the swords I have collected.\r\n**I will stop by again when I get the chance.'),(901,'Han','Fools call me a sword master. I have a long way to go yet.',''),(902,'Han','Handle a sword well enough and you will have no need of a shield. The sword is the shield.',''),(903,'Han','The sword was born to kill, but there are swords that save lives too.',''),(904,'Han','To have a sword silver-plated, speak to Smirovich or Hasbro.',''),(905,'Han','To improve your swordsmanship you must swing at least ten thousand times a day.',''),(906,'Han','Say the word whenever you wish to learn swordsmanship. Only come with the basics in hand.',''),(1000,'Conan','Headquarters is tearing its hair out over the mess you have made. I can take care of it for you. Well? Shall I? It will cost you what it is worth, mind. The money you donate funds E.V.E.\'s work... a good thing, no?','I will donate 10,000 dollars.\n**I will donate 50,000 dollars.\n**I will donate 100,000 dollars.\n**I will donate 500,000 dollars.\n**I will donate 1,000,000 dollars.\n**I would like information about the Rare Master.\n**I will trade my gemstone for an item.\n**I have no money and no intention of donating. Keep up the good work.'),(1001,'Conan','It seems nobody in the world today has any real chivalry left in them... what do you think?',''),(1002,'Conan','Perhaps the vampires are the angels of the apocalypse, sent by God to destroy an impious mankind.',''),(1003,'Conan','Were it not for the duty laid on me, I would go out and fight the vampires myself this instant...',''),(1004,'Conan','Do you think I am old too? Nonsense. I am still in my prime. Retirement... I might consider it past eighty.',''),(1005,'Conan','Do you happen to know how Gruber is getting on these days? I saved his life once, you know.',''),(1006,'Conan','Now and then, even among the slayers, you find the sort who make money the whole point of their lives... or who relish the thrill of killing a vampire. The end times, I tell you.',''),(1007,'Conan','I still consider myself too young to stand back and watch. And you... even when you are as old as I am, do not forget to think of yourself as young.',''),(1008,'Conan','In swordsmanship I do not believe anyone matches Han. To my eye he is the finest there is, though he does not seem to think so. A humble man.',''),(1009,'Conan','Taking pride in your work matters. It is the engine that will pick you up every time things get hard.',''),(1010,'Conan','Never show your back to the enemy.',''),(1011,'Conan','Sooner than kneel to those creatures, I would take my own life.',''),(1100,'Jack','When I fought the vampires, my beloved Thunderbird was always at my side... I miss those days. I am past doing the fighting myself now, so ride one of my bikes and fight in my place. It will serve you well out there. Let me show you what I have.','Pick me out a decent motorcycle.\r\n**I would like to sell what I am carrying.\r\n**I would like to know where my motorcycle is.\r\n**I would like to collect my bike.\r\n**I will buy one next time. Keep up the good work, Jack.'),(1101,'Jack','Would you believe I was once the leader of a pretty famous biker gang?',''),(1102,'Jack','This bike is my one true friend, I reckon. Would you not say so?',''),(1103,'Jack','Ride a motorcycle at 150 kph with no helmet and you will understand how I feel.',''),(1104,'Jack','Is there a bike you fancy? Just say the word.',''),(1105,'Jack','The people of Kansas used to tremble at the name Red-Haired Jack. Ha ha.',''),(1200,'David','Oh... you are here? Hmm... I am a little busy... heh heh... I was just thinking of something incredible. Well, it cannot be helped. What can I do for you?','Please repair my equipment, David.\n\t\t**I would like to go to the Caligo Dungeon (the level-based war zone).\n\t\t**No. Carry on. Sorry to interrupt.'),(1201,'David','Er... I think this goes like this... hmm...',''),(1202,'David','Heh heh... good... ah. Never mind. Talking to myself.',''),(1203,'David','Whatever else I may be, when it comes to repairing firearms I am probably second to none. Heh heh.',''),(1204,'David','If you have something you want fixed, bring it over.',''),(1205,'David','Heh heh. Hello there.',''),(1300,'Kevin','Fighting vampires all the time must be hard on you. Take care in everything you do. Nothing matters more than staying alive. Leave your valuables with me and put every scrap of your attention into the fight.','I would like to buy storage.\r\n**May I see my things?\r\n**Keep up the good work, Kevin.'),(1301,'Kevin','There is no telling a person\'s future. When and where the next disaster falls...',''),(1302,'Kevin','Sometimes I want to run across an open field, or swim in a deep river.',''),(1303,'Kevin','Rather than killing one more vampire, work at protecting yourself.',''),(1304,'Kevin','Another hard day. Take care of yourself.',''),(1305,'Kevin','If you have something to store, come and tell me any time.',''),(1400,'Salamander','If a vampire bites you, you had better come running to me at once. Charge in trusting your own strength and you will get hurt easily enough. Not that a scratch will kill you... shall I take a look?','I would like treatment right now.\r\n**Could I buy some treatment ampoules?\r\n**I would like to sell what I am carrying.\r\n**Set resurrection point\r\n**I would like to go to the beginner hunting ground (the Temerie holy ground).\r\n**Keep up the good work, Salamander.'),(1401,'Salamander','If you find a decent man somewhere, introduce me.',''),(1402,'Salamander','What do you make of the fact that human and vampire DNA are structured differently? Fascinating, is it not?',''),(1403,'Salamander','I need more vampire tissue... hmm.',''),(1404,'Salamander','Might vampire magic not arise out of the structure of vampire DNA?',''),(1405,'Salamander','I keep plenty of treatment ampoules in stock, so just say the word.',''),(1406,'Salamander','If you are always short on stamina, or looking for something that genuinely helps in a fight, take a look at the accessories on the second floor.',''),(1500,'Sonya','If you need body armour, a belt or a helmet, tell me. Not that I sell this because I want to, but duty is duty.','Yes. I need some decent armour.\r\n**Ah. I have come to sell something this time.\r\n**Sonya. Keep up the good work. Your suspension will be lifted soon, so do not worry.'),(1501,'Sonya','Today of all days I miss him... the man I lost...',''),(1502,'Sonya','My sweetheart was the leader of that famous SWAT team.',''),(1503,'Sonya','Everything that happened to me is down to those vampires. Damn them.',''),(1504,'Sonya','I was trying to do the job well... did they really have to suspend me for it?',''),(1505,'Sonya','I had far more freedom back when I hunted vampires alone.',''),(1506,'Sonya','I want to be back in the fight now...',''),(1600,'Crow','Now and then you see people who do nothing but chase after superior weapons and armour, and it is exactly that sort who die early. A true warrior can turn anything around them into a weapon, whatever the situation. Not that I am telling you to carry nothing. Only that the basics are enough. Take a look.','If you have decent equipment, I would like to buy some.\r\n**I would like to sell what I do not need.\r\n**I will come back another time.'),(1601,'Crow','Bear in mind that only those grounded in the basics survive to the end.',''),(1602,'Crow','Build your experience in real fights, not in practice.',''),(1603,'Crow','Please do not ask me about my past.',''),(1604,'Crow','Just call me Crow. As in the bird.',''),(1605,'Crow','Tell me what you need and I will have it ready by tomorrow.',''),(1700,'Kreif','Are my earrings not splendid? These are only imitations, of course... ah, but the accessories here are all genuine. You could empty the Vatican\'s vaults and not find better. And they are genuinely useful in a fight. Ha ha.','Please show me your accessories.\n\t\t **I would like to sell some of my things.\n\t\t **Kreif, hard at work again today. See you next time, then.\n\t\t'),(1701,'Kreif','Kreif Hempel, that is. Hempel. An unusual name, is it not?',''),(1702,'Kreif','If you want a shotgun or a rifle, look for a one-eyed man named Drake.',''),(1703,'Kreif','The accessories I sell are the sort you can put to real use in a fight.',''),(1704,'Kreif','If you need other accessories, try the other guilds as well. Each of them sells slightly different things.',''),(1800,'Drake','If there is a firearm you want, fill out a request on this form. It should be flown in within the week, so the sooner you ask, the better. Of course, a few good pieces have already come in, so have a look around.','I will see whether you have a decent gun.\r\n**I would like to sell some goods.\r\n**Something else has come up, so I will be on my way.'),(1801,'Drake','For taking a vampire\'s head off in one shot, nothing beats a shotgun.',''),(1802,'Drake','People handling a gun for the first time usually get excited, and that ruins their accuracy.',''),(1803,'Drake','Do not assume that shooting first always wins. It can give your position away.',''),(1804,'Drake','I may have lost an eye, but I would guess I still shoot better than you do.',''),(1805,'Drake','Looking for an SMG? Go and see that stubborn fool Spartan.',''),(1900,'Spartan','In a fight you must be able to protect yourself. There is no time to look over your shoulder. Face forward and fight. Your comrades have your back. If you cannot manage that, give up the mercenary life as soon as you can.','Thank you for the advice. But I came to buy an SMG.\r\n**I would like to sell what I am carrying, Spartan.\r\n**Understood.'),(1901,'Spartan','Hah. A raw recruit, are you not?',''),(1902,'Spartan','People call me mad, but I am perfectly sane.',''),(1903,'Spartan','Watching vampires blown to pieces by a bomb I built is a real thrill, I tell you.',''),(1904,'Spartan','Need an SMG? Come over here, friend.',''),(1905,'Spartan','Building bombs is easier than you would think. Get it wrong and dying is just as easy. Ha ha ha.',''),(1906,'Spartan','If you are after a rifle or a shotgun, go and see Drake.',''),(2000,'Jean','Do you know what it feels like to aim for the enemy\'s heart and squeeze the trigger? And if the target happens to be a comrade you were close to, the mind reels... those few seconds between slipping past their eyes, taking aim at the heart and pulling the trigger, they drain the blood right out of you. That is the kind of thrill my work carries. So, shall I teach you?','Jean, I came to learn a new technique today.\r\n**The thrill sounds fine, but I was hoping to buy a new rifle.\r\n**I would like to sell these.\r\n**No. I will learn another time.'),(2001,'Jean','The most important thing in sniping is your own breathing.',''),(2002,'Jean','Vampires have to have their hearts blown out in one shot.',''),(2003,'Jean','A rose is a truly beautiful and beguiling thing. That is what I think.',''),(2004,'Jean','Sniping is harder work than it looks. It only looks glamorous in films.',''),(2005,'Jean','People sometimes call me "the Rose Sniper", but to be honest I do not care for the nickname.',''),(2006,'Jean','If you want a submachine gun, go looking for a man called Spartan.',''),(2100,'Smith','Have you come to have the red marks wiped off your record? You know the form and the procedure, I trust? So... how much do you want wiped?','I will donate 10,000 dollars.\n\t**I will donate 50,000 dollars.\n\t**I will donate 100,000 dollars.\n\t**I will donate 500,000 dollars.\n\t**I will donate 1,000,000 dollars.\n\t**I would like to exchange stars for an item.\n\t**I would like to exchange stars for money.\n\t**I have come about a team.\n**I would like to receive the test server gift.\n**I have no money and no intention of donating. Keep up the good work.'),(2101,'Smith','I am Alfred Emmanuel Smith, leader of TEAM TWO, E.V.E.\'s Second Corps. Just call me Smith.',''),(2102,'Smith','For now we are using this building as E.V.E.\'s temporary base.',''),(2103,'Smith','Above all else comes killing the vampire masters, the leaders of the vampires.',''),(2104,'Smith','Start with the low-grade vampires that have got inside the village.',''),(2105,'Smith','Have you met Commander Kaiser? Was he keeping well?',''),(2106,'Smith','I hold the post of acting commander for now, so report anything important to me.',''),(2107,'Smith','Rising high too quickly at too young an age is not much of a blessing... the weight of responsibility comes with it...',''),(2108,'Smith','You must not grow weak. Lose the fight with yourself and you will amount to nothing here but blood for them.',''),(2109,'Smith','When things are hard, call up your family\'s faces. If there is something you must protect, and you want to protect it, then fight hard and win.',''),(2110,'Smith','If you want them gone, feed your hatred of them. Bear in mind that is what will make you stronger.',''),(2111,'Smith','Never forget that you are a soldier!',''),(2121,'Smith','If it is about a team, what exactly do you want?','I have come to register a team.\n\t**I would like to view the pending team list.\n\t**I would like to view the team list.\n\t**I would like to leave my team.\n\t**Farewell.'),(2122,'Smith','Leaving, you say? If you have thought it over carefully I will accept your withdrawal, but understand this. After leaving a team you will not be taken in by another straight away. Even to join elsewhere, a full week of real time must pass. Do you still want to leave the team?','Understood, but I would like to leave.\n\t**In that case I will think it over again.'),(2200,'Frederick','Eslania here is a very dangerous place. Crossing all that ground on foot to carry out a job is nothing short of reckless. It only leaves you exposed for longer... if you like, I can supply one of the motorcycles I have modified. Would you care to see?','Frederick. Show me your new bikes.\r\n**I would like to sell what I am carrying.\r\n**I would like to know where my motorcycle is.\r\n**I would like to collect the motorcycle I left with you.\r\n**No. I am not looking to buy a bike yet. I will come by another time.'),(2201,'Frederick','Have you heard the vampires run legitimate companies? Tch.',''),(2202,'Frederick','Leave the bike modifications to me. It is no help in a fight, but a job like this is nothing...',''),(2203,'Frederick','The castle I grew up in was truly beautiful. If I ever take it back one day...',''),(2204,'Frederick','E.V.E. strikes me as a rather slack organisation. TEAM TWO is different, of course.',''),(2205,'Frederick','If you want body armour or a helmet, go and see Sonya.',''),(2300,'Christine','Leave your goods to me and put your mind on the fighting. Do you have anything to store right now?','\n\t\tChristine, I would like to buy a new storage box.\n\t\t**Show me my storage, please.\n\t\t**I have come to collect what I bought in the Darden Market. Please show me my basket.\n\t\t**I would like to see my pet storage.\n\t\t**There is nothing much to store right now. Until next time.'),(2301,'Christine','I am on stores duty for now, but I will be back in the fight before long.',''),(2302,'Christine','Have you not heard that I spent eight years as a mercenary?',''),(2303,'Christine','Who would ever have imagined the things you only see in novels and films were real?',''),(2304,'Christine','My son too... to the vampires... oh...',''),(2305,'Christine','I cannot forgive them. That is why I became a mercenary again.',''),(2306,'Christine','Leave the goods to me and put your mind on the fighting.',''),(2310,'Christine','Anything you buy in the Darden Market or receive as a gift is held in this basket. You collect those from me too. You knew that, I trust? Unlike storage, the basket only holds gifts and purchases for you; it will not keep your own belongings the way storage does. And if not everything you bought is showing in the basket, it has not been lost. It will appear once you collect what is in there now, so do not worry. Shall we take a look at your basket, then?','Yes, I would like to check my basket.\n\t\t**No. I will check it another time.'),(2400,'Griffin','Hello. What can I do for you this time? Do tell me if you have anything to repair.','Hello, Griffin. Repair this for me, please.\r\n**Yes. I will be sure to say so next time. Keep up the good work.'),(2401,'Griffin','Do tell my father I am well. I am so busy I hardly get to see him these days.',''),(2402,'Griffin','Hmm... now that is a rather good theory... yes... that is it...',''),(2403,'Griffin','My field of interest is biochemistry. Only at an elementary level so far, though...',''),(2404,'Griffin','Biochemistry is a genuinely fascinating field. Do study it.',''),(2500,'Singh','Fighting every day must leave you worn out. Come to me quickly if you are hurt anywhere. I will do everything I can for you.','Singh, I am hurt here. Treat me, please.\n\t\t **I would like to buy some treatment ampoules and the like.\n\t\t **Would you buy these from me?\n\t\t **Set resurrection point\n\t\t **I can still bear it. I will come by another time.'),(2501,'Singh','Well? Nothing hurting now?',''),(2502,'Singh','Take even a small wound lightly and it may be the death of you.',''),(2503,'Singh','Never forget how to give first aid. It is bound to help.',''),(2504,'Singh','It is better for you if you never have to come to me at all. Ha ha.',''),(2505,'Singh','When you use an ampoule, take care not to let air into the blood.',''),(2506,'Singh','Hm? I had better request more injectables and sedatives. We are badly short.',''),(2507,'Singh','Did you know? I hear Yevgeny sells things that protect against vampire magic. Go up to the second floor if you are interested.',''),(2600,'Yevgeny','The war with the vampires must be raging out there. I pray for you all in here every day. Well... if there are accessories you need, tell me. I will get hold of whatever I can... the items I sell protect you against vampire magic. Would you like to see?','Yevgeny, show me the accessories that have just come in.\n\t\t **I was hoping to sell these. What do you say?\n\t\t **I have come about couple registration.\n\t\t **I will be going. Keep up the good work, Yevgeny.'),(2601,'Yevgeny','Everyone tells me I have a handsome forehead. Heh heh.',''),(2602,'Yevgeny','I love Hannibal, my father that is, very much.',''),(2603,'Yevgeny','Let us pray together for the souls of the departed...',''),(2604,'Yevgeny','I have rings and necklaces and bracelets ready here.',''),(2605,'Yevgeny','Hello. My name is Yevgeny.',''),(2606,'Yevgeny','If what I have is not enough for you, try the second floor of the warrior guild or the soldier guild. They may have what you are after.',''),(2607,'Yevgeny','I may still be young, but I know very well how sacred and important a thing love is. Do not worry.',''),(2608,'Yevgeny','Always treasure the one you love. They are the person you will share your life with.',''),(2610,'Yevgeny','Love takes up a great part of a life. To find someone you can trust and share it with is a great blessing. Sometimes a wrong choice leaves you both wounded and you part. For your own sake, and for the one you love, choose carefully. ','I have found someone I love. I would like to register as a couple.\n\t\t**I accept the couple registration.\n\t\t**There is no meaning left in our relationship. I want to break it off.\n\t\t**I agree to the separation.\n\t\t**I have forgotten my partner\'s name. Would you tell me?\n\t\t**I would like to ask you something else.'),(2611,'Yevgeny','If you wish to part, there are two ways. A separation by mutual agreement, and a one-sided separation without it. Bear in mind that if you choose the one-sided separation, your alignment will drop.','I will separate by mutual agreement.\n\t\t**I will separate one-sidedly, without agreement.'),(2700,'Nikolai','Sitting and praying does not solve the problem... I believe it is time to act. I will supply the finest equipment for the fight, so will you take on the vampires?','Understood, Nikolai. Show me the finest equipment, then.\r\n**I would like to sell the equipment I am carrying.\r\n**I will be on my way.'),(2701,'Nikolai','I cannot forgive those who bring shame on my Russia!',''),(2702,'Nikolai','My only interest is sweeping away the vampires that defile my homeland... that is all.',''),(2703,'Nikolai','Capitalism is superior, is it? Then what about the American children starving to death?',''),(2704,'Nikolai','This is no time for such talk. Right. Everyone get ready and move out.',''),(2800,'Richardson','Travelling here and there, it seems to me the vampires have grown more active of late. It cannot be left much longer... put your backs into it. Here are things I picked up on my travels. Care to look?','Show me whether you have anything I need.\r\n**Let me show you what I have gathered.\r\n**I will see you next time, Richardson.'),(2801,'Richardson','Of all the places I have been, China was the most beautiful.',''),(2802,'Richardson','I suppose I have a touch of wanderlust in me. Ho ho ho.',''),(2803,'Richardson','There is nowhere on this earth my feet have not taken me. Ho ho.',''),(2804,'Richardson','From what I hear, the vampire masters are gathering one after another.',''),(2805,'Richardson','There is a rumour that every necropolis in the world stands empty.',''),(2900,'Hannibal','May the grace of the Lord be with you... everyone carries a fear inside them, but fear is not always something to be without. Sometimes it guards you, and sometimes it can be raised into great strength. At the last moment, though, fear must not be allowed to sully faith. If you can spare the time today, I would like to pass true faith on to you... what do you say?','Hannibal, teach me a new blessing spell.\n\t\t**I hear you have a fine mace. I would like to see it.\n\t\t**I stopped by to sell some things this time.\n\t\t**I will be going. Bless me, Hannibal.'),(2901,'Hannibal','Fiat Dei voluntas',''),(2902,'Hannibal','Crede Deo',''),(2903,'Hannibal','Crux mihi ancora',''),(2904,'Hannibal','Dii approbent!',''),(2905,'Hannibal','Usque ad aras',''),(2906,'Hannibal','Sursum corda',''),(2907,'Hannibal','Sol lucet omnibus',''),(2908,'Hannibal','Ita me Dii ament, ubi sim nescio',''),(2909,'Hannibal','Fortuna sequatur',''),(2920,'Hannibal','Thanks to your efforts we have been able to gather far more material. I have long been studying the legends of the Ousters. If they were to return, something grave would follow. They are a primitive people who worship nature rather than the Lord, yet it is said they draw a fearsome power from the idols they call spirits. If so, it can hardly be a righteous power. Do you not agree?','Yes, that may well be so.'),(2921,'Hannibal','In my younger days I would have run all the way to meet the Ousters myself... honestly, even if they are creatures set against the Lord\'s will, I would like to see the legend with my own eyes and speak with them. Take care if you meet them. They may be victims of vampire bites, but they are also a people who shunned all contact with humans. It is no more than instinct, but I think it very likely they are dangerous.','I will take care, as you say.'),(2922,'Hannibal','The Ousters are creatures that cannot exist without the vampires. You might well call them a by-product of evil. Yet somehow they are said to have succeeded in breeding. The second-generation Ousters born that way have no sex, but they lay something like eggs, called germen. Hm... whether to call it an egg or a half-formed infant... in any case, lay a germen, place it beside another, and it becomes an Ouster child.','An astonishing story.'),(2923,'Hannibal','Hm... you had better hear about them from Kaiser first. There will be a chance to talk it over in detail later. More to the point, I am worried your faith is weakening. There is a fine story about faith in the Lord. What do you say, will you hear it?','No. I have urgent business, so...'),(2924,'Hannibal','Hm, I see. That comes first for now. Deciphering the legend of the relics the Ousters left behind, we found they lie scattered through a certain underground cavern known to us. Your task is to gather the fragments of the ancient texts they left and bring them back as one. I believe you are more than equal to it. Well? Can you do it?','Of course. Just tell me exactly where.'),(2925,'Hannibal','Good. Deciphering the ancient texts you brought us confirmed that a map exists marking the site of the village where they once lived. The Ousters did not want such a map left behind, of course, but it was passed down by the explorer Lord Rose. Lord Rose met a mysterious death after completing it, yet the accepted account is that the map survived somewhere and was handed on. Can you find this map?','Fetching a map is hardly difficult. Rather a let-down, if anything.'),(2926,'Hannibal','Yes, yes... very well. According to Lord Rose\'s map, the Ousters\' village lay past the western pass that connects from north-west Drobeta. Get there quickly and investigate. The last secret of the Ousters is not far off now. May the Lord\'s protection be with you always.','Yes, thank you.'),(2927,'Hannibal','I think it is still too early for you to take a task from me. Kaiser will be outside the guild building. Go to him first.','You mean Captain Kaiser. Understood.'),(2928,'Hannibal','Do you not have a task still unfinished?','So I do. I got ahead of myself.'),(2929,'Hannibal','Congratulations on finishing the task. Would it not be best to settle the reward before taking on the next one?','Understood. That would be the order of things.'),(2930,'Hannibal','Remarkable. To gather every fragment of the ancient text so quickly. There, you see. Is it not proof that the Lord watches over you and keeps you? So, will you take the reward for the task, or press on to the next one? Either suits me. Whichever you choose is the path the Lord is leading you down.','It seems the Lord would have me carry on with the task.\r\n**I need some rest. I would like the reward.'),(2931,'Hannibal','Oh... oh... so this is the map Lord Rose left. Yes... this is where they were living. Good heavens... but how could it have gone undiscovered until now? Ah, forgive me. I was quite overcome... yes, you must have your reward. But listen. It could hardly be called an official E.V.E. assignment, yet I have a favour to ask of you personally. Now that even the Ousters\' location has been found, would you not want to go on investigating them? What do you say, take the reward and be done, or hear my request first?','It would be improper to refuse a request from you, Hannibal.\r\n**I have had no reward at all so far, and now a personal favour... I am afraid not. The reward, please.'),(2932,'Hannibal','What on earth are these meant to signify? I really cannot say.','There seems to have been a mistake. My apologies.'),(2933,'Hannibal','Hm... if that is truly your wish... but the Lord will not see it that way. Do you really mean to give up?','I trust the Lord will understand.\r\n**If that is the Lord\'s will, I will take up the challenge once more.'),(2934,'Hannibal','What task was it I gave you? My memory these days is quite... I keep forgetting things.','No. Come to think of it, I was mistaken.'),(2935,'Hannibal','The man who carried out the task so splendidly now says he is giving up? I cannot make out what you are saying. It grows harder and harder to talk to young people these days...','Ha ha, it was only a joke.'),(2936,'Hannibal','Then make your way to %(QuestZone). Bear in mind that the monsters holding the place may already have taken it... good luck to you.','Do not worry.\r\n**I will need a little preparation. I will be back shortly.'),(2937,'Hannibal','It is not quite so simple. The map is known to have passed out of human hands into the keeping of a monster of great power. They are very black in colour, so finding them should not be too hard. Recover the map from the black %(QuestMonster) near %(QuestZone).','So it was not so easy after all. No matter.\r\n**I will need a little preparation. I will be back shortly.'),(2938,'Hannibal','What reward would that be? What a tiresome fellow... if this is a joke, drop it.','Ha ha, I was only teasing. My apologies.'),(3000,'Chamor','Those who like a bit of sparkle will take anything, but what matters is wearing what suits you. Only then do you see the true effect. These will help a man who wants to build his strength, though whether they help his faith is another question. Ha ha ha.','Chamor, do you have a decent accessory?\n\t\t **Would you buy these from me?\n\t\t **I will see you next time.'),(3001,'Chamor','Does God really exist? Does the question never occur to you?',''),(3002,'Chamor','The higher-ups keep pressing faith on us, but this may be a fraud that has been running for thousands of years.',''),(3003,'Chamor','O Lord. Strike this faithless wretch with lightning! Amen.',''),(3004,'Chamor','That this magnificent body should be standing here selling rings... tsk.',''),(3005,'Chamor','Do not force yourself into something that does not fit you just because it protects you. Not that you could wear it anyway.',''),(3006,'Chamor','If I have sold out of what you want, go and see Yevgeny on the second floor. The lad sells the same things I do.',''),(3100,'Rachmaninov','The spirit of a man without faith is a feeble thing. Once he reaches for temptation, he may fall onto a road there is no coming back from. Rest for those who have strayed onto the wrong path... now raise the cross of judgement. I will give you the holy power of healing.','Rachmaninov, teach me healing magic.\r\n**I would like to acquire a new cross.\r\n**I would like to sell these...\r\n**Sorry to disturb you. Farewell.'),(3101,'Rachmaninov','People tell me to smile more, but I have my reasons.',''),(3102,'Rachmaninov','Hannibal, the greatest exorcist? That title belongs in the Vatican...',''),(3103,'Rachmaninov','I will pray that you are not led into temptation. Amen.',''),(3104,'Rachmaninov','If you wish to work the miracle of healing, follow me.',''),(3105,'Rachmaninov','Even at my age I pray ten hours a day. And you?',''),(3106,'Rachmaninov','Amen...',''),(3200,'Stoyanov','If there are red marks on your record... a small donation to E.V.E.\'s operating funds will wipe them off. The amount varies with your record, mind. And quite apart from the red marks, we have prepared something special this time called a "balance ring". It carries a property that converts one of your stats into a stat of your choosing. Now then, what is your business?','I will donate 10,000 lei.\n**I will donate 50,000 lei.\n**I will donate 100,000 lei.\n**I will donate 500,000 lei.\n**I will donate 1,000,000 lei.\n**I would like to buy a counter balance ring.\n**I would like to exchange stars for money.\n**I would like to receive the test server gift.\n**I have no money and no intention of donating. Keep up the good work.'),(3201,'Stoyanov','Do take care of yourself. And do not push too far to the front.',''),(3202,'Stoyanov','I am nearly ninety now. It will soon be time for me to go.',''),(3203,'Stoyanov','Andrei Dmitrievich Stoyanov. Rather hard to remember, I am afraid.',''),(3204,'Stoyanov','Nothing matters more than your health.',''),(3205,'Stoyanov','I came here wanting to spend my last years in the Vatican. This place is like a mother to me.',''),(3206,'Stoyanov','Whether I can serve well at his side... I long to see him soon. Before long I shall be able to go to him.',''),(3207,'Stoyanov','Have you been to Romania? It is a truly beautiful place. The kingdom of God must look something like that...',''),(3208,'Stoyanov','The "balance ring"... a genuinely convenient thing, is it not? To be able to redistribute your own stats freely whenever you wish.',''),(3209,'Stoyanov','Ho ho... I made this ring myself, I know, but it really is a splendid thing. The crystallised wisdom of this old man.',''),(3300,'Karl','Hmm... one moment, please... have you come to buy a motorcycle? Or to have one repaired?','Yes. Recommend me a decent motorcycle.\r\n**I would like to sell what I am carrying.\r\n**I would like to know where my motorcycle is.\r\n**I would like to collect the motorcycle I left with you.\r\n**Ah. I only came to browse. Keep up the good work, Karl.'),(3301,'Karl','Canada is a truly beautiful country. Have you been?',''),(3302,'Karl','If it were not for Richardson, I would be in the next world by now.',''),(3303,'Karl','How do you like my goggles? Fine colour, is it not? Ha ha.',''),(3304,'Karl','The motorcycle is a marvellous invention. No four-wheeled car comes close.',''),(3305,'Karl','Hello there.',''),(3306,'Karl','One moment... I thought I heard something...',''),(3400,'Vrykolakas','What is it you wish to learn from me? If you want powerful magic... then you did well to come to me. The magic I pass on will make you stronger still... heh heh heh... crave the blood to your heart\'s content... that is the wellspring of your strength. Well? Will you study under me?','Yes. I will be your disciple. Teach me magic.\n**Vrykolakas, it is not techniques I came about... I want to discuss managing my stats.\n**I would like to receive the Blood War event item.\n**I will come to you again once I have practised more, great mage Vrykolakas.'),(3401,'Vrykolakas','What is it you wish to learn from me? If you want powerful magic... then you did well to come to me. The magic I pass on will make you stronger still... heh heh heh... crave the blood to your heart\'s content... that is the wellspring of your strength. Well? Will you study under me?','Yes. I will be your disciple. Teach me magic.\n\t\t**Vrykolakas, it is not techniques I came about... I want to discuss managing my stats.\n\t\t**I would like information about the master lairs.\n\t\t**Set resurrection point\n\t\t**I want to go to the Perona highway.\n\t\t**I want to go to the free duel zone.\n\t\t**I will trade my gemstone for an item.\n\t\t**I will come to you again once I have practised more, great mage Vrykolakas.'),(3402,'Vrykolakas','The free duel zone has "Oltenia", for duels within your own kind, and "Banatul", where you can duel freely regardless of kind. Take your pick.','I want to go to Oltenia.\r\n**I want to go to Banatul.\r\n**I will think it over and decide.'),(3409,'Vrykolakas','A matter of stats, is it? If you think your stats are unbalanced... tell me which of STR, DEX and INT you consider surplus. Then I will lower that stat and convert it back into the bonus point it was before you spent it. It will cost you %(RedistGold) geld, mind. Well? Shall we? (1 stat point converts to 1 bonus point.)','I will convert 1 point of STR into a bonus point.\n**I will convert 1 point of DEX into a bonus point.\n**I will convert 1 point of INT into a bonus point.\n**I cannot afford it. Another time.'),(3410,'Vrykolakas','Have you made up your mind? No regrets?','Yes, I will convert 1 point of STR into a bonus point.\n**Give me a chance to think again.'),(3411,'Vrykolakas','Have you made up your mind? No regrets?','Yes, I will convert 1 point of DEX into a bonus point.\n**Give me a chance to think again.'),(3412,'Vrykolakas','Have you made up your mind? No regrets?','Yes, I will convert 1 point of INT into a bonus point.\n**Give me a chance to think again.'),(3451,'Vrykolakas','Never forget that your power comes from Bathory\'s blood. Death to traitors!',''),(3452,'Vrykolakas','To whoever brings me the head of Vlad the Impaler, I will pass on the greatest magical knowledge there is.',''),(3453,'Vrykolakas','Carpatini... do you think I cannot see through you... you worthless, worm-like swine...',''),(3454,'Vrykolakas','Know that all vampire magic springs from blood.',''),(3455,'Vrykolakas','Countess of Blood... have you still not recovered your strength... ah...',''),(3456,'Vrykolakas','Friends of the darkness... you must not long for the sun any longer.',''),(3457,'Vrykolakas','The time has come to carry out the blood oath. Ah ha ha ha...',''),(3458,'Vrykolakas','They say the ancient passage my brethren lost has been found. Ha ha ha, the hour has come at last.',''),(3500,'Carpatini','Might I have the honour of holding your noble possessions? Merely to keep your belongings is an honour to this Carpatini. Heh heh heh. Buy whatever you need for the fight from me.','I want to buy a storage box... how much?\n\t\t **I want to see whether my things are all in order.\n\t\t **I want to buy some serum and seals and the like.\n\t\t **I would like to sell what I am carrying...\n\t\t **I want to see my pet storage.\n\t\t **I have something to ask about the monster hunting quest.\n\t\t **I have finished the monster hunting quest. My payment?\n\t\t **I want to cancel the monster hunting quest.\n\t\t **I have come about the Sturge (pet) quest.\n\t\t **I will leave something with you next time.'),(3501,'Carpatini','You will know this, I am sure, but choose your quest with your present ability in mind. Only one quest at a time is possible.',''),(3502,'Carpatini','Complete a quest properly and I will see you rewarded for it. Quite exceptional things.',''),(3503,'Carpatini','My name is Carpatini Blasis Grendel.',''),(3504,'Carpatini','If you wish to store something, speak to this lowly Carpatini...',''),(3505,'Carpatini','The goods I sell are only the sort that are genuinely useful on the battlefield.',''),(3506,'Carpatini','Serums, seals and transformation items can make a splendid asset, depending on how you use them.',''),(3507,'Carpatini','If you want to raise the power of your belongings, why not buy an item from Seth?',''),(3508,'Carpatini','Every monster you have hunted so far will be forfeited. Do you still want to cancel the quest?','Yes.\r\n**No. I will carry on with the quest.'),(3510,'Carpatini','Too much for you after all? Come and try again when you get the chance.','Hm. Until next time, then.'),(3511,'Carpatini','You have no quest in progress. Tell me if you would like to take one on.','My mistake. Until next time.'),(3520,'Carpatini','Ho... now I look at you, you carry yourself with quite the vampire\'s dignity. As for a Sturge, I do happen to have one... heh heh heh, and I think you have need of it.','What is the Sturge quest?\n**I have completed the Sturge quest. My reward?'),(3521,'Carpatini','So you have reached the required level at last. Congratulations. Do you know the Sturge? The beast that has been at our side through ages beyond counting. Hm... they have grown very rare these days... now I will give you the chance to own one. You have no idea what it cost me to find it. So show me something worth the reward. %(MonsterName) gave me the most trouble of all while I was out catching Sturges. Bring me 80 of them within one hour and I will acknowledge you. Will you do it?','Shall I go hunting, then?\n\t\t**No, I will rest for now.'),(3600,'Valerie','Which garment shall I show you? You have only to say. I have prepared any number of outfits for you, beautiful... splendid... things I think you will like. And I have weapons and beads to match your resolve. Would you care to see what I have?','Fine. Let me see them, Valerie.\n\t\t**I want to sell these.\n\t\t**I want to go to the beginner hunting ground (the Temerie holy ground)...\n\t\t**I want to go to the Caligo Dungeon (the level-based war zone).\n\t\t**Would you lend me the token of the Blood Bible?\n\t\t**I will return the token of the Blood Bible.\n\t\t**No. I will see them another time.'),(3601,'Valerie','Be careful of Carpatini. There is no telling what he will do.',''),(3602,'Valerie','Lady Bathory is the great one destined to rule over every vampire master.',''),(3603,'Valerie','Beautiful and splendid garments are ready for you.',''),(3604,'Valerie','The weapons and beads are rather late, are they not? I tried to be quick, but they were hard to come by.',''),(3605,'Valerie','There are so many people around us in need.',''),(3606,'Valerie','May those less fortunate than us receive a warmer hand...',''),(3610,'Valerie','There are still many around us in need who are waiting for a kind hand. We are collecting donations so that your love can reach them. Would you care to join the collection too, %(UserName)?','I will give as an individual.\n\t\t**I will give on behalf of my clan.'),(3611,'Valerie','Thank you for your warm hand. The amount you have given will be posted on the homepage. The precious donation you have made today, %(UserName), will be put to good use where it is truly needed, where a kind hand is wanted.','I will make a donation.\n\t\t**I will see you next time.'),(3612,'Valerie','I am sorry. You are not currently in a clan, %(UserName), or you are not yet a full member. If you are not in a clan, please give as an individual.','I would like to give as an individual, then.\n\t\t**I will see you next time.'),(3613,'Valerie','Thank you. As a member of %(GuildName), you are donating in the name of %(GuildName), %(UserName). The amount you have given will be posted on the homepage under the clan\'s name. Posted amounts are shown as a running total. The precious donations gathered in the name of %(GuildName) will be put to good use where they are truly needed, where a kind hand is wanted.','I will make a donation.\n\t\t**I will see you again next time.'),(3700,'Seth','What I have, you see, is worth several times what you are carrying. What I have... there is nothing else like it in this world. That is how costly and how precious it is. It can raise your basic abilities. Well? Care to look? To see what I have...','Fine. Let me see.\n\t\t **I want to sell these... they are rather good, mind.\n\t\t **I wish to check what I bought in the Darden Market. Show me the basket.\n\t\t **I will see you later.'),(3701,'Seth','Lady Bathory is the one who truly deserves the name Countess of Blood.',''),(3702,'Seth','The fact is that men are more beautiful than women. Did you know that?',''),(3703,'Seth','Damn it all... a fake stone... I will kill whoever sold me this at once!',''),(3704,'Seth','I had better go and see my pretty things shortly. Heh heh.',''),(3705,'Seth','Here. Well? My clothes. They suit me rather well, do they not?',''),(3706,'Seth','The Blue Drop is what genuinely helps you. It makes good items more useful still.',''),(3707,'Seth','Selling things this precious at this price is only natural. If it does not suit you, go elsewhere. Heh heh. You will have trouble finding it... heh heh heh.',''),(3710,'Seth','Anything you buy or receive as a gift is held in this basket. And what is held there, you collect through me! You knew that, I trust? Unlike storage, the basket only holds gifts and purchases; it will not keep your own belongings the way storage does. And if not everything you bought is showing in the basket, it has not been lost. It will appear once you collect what is in there now, so spare yourself the worry. Well, shall you check the basket now?','Yes, I will check the basket.\n\t\t**No, I will do it another time.'),(3800,'Kakon','Bring me anything that needs fixing. The moment my hands touch it, snap! Good as new... come on, then.','There is something I would like to know.\n\t**I have come about a clan.\n\t**Right. Fix this for me.\n\t**Do you have anything that might interest me?\n\t**I would like to sell this. Well?\n\t**Keep up the good work, Kakon.'),(3801,'Kakon','Do you know what the Limbo in Limbo Castle means? Purgatory, that is what. Well? A fitting name, is it not?',''),(3802,'Kakon','......\t',''),(3803,'Kakon','If you have anything to fix, come and tell me.',''),(3804,'Kakon','Lord Vrykolakas\' hidden power is probably greater than Lady Bathory\'s.',''),(3805,'Kakon','Do you know what Vlad Tepes did to our Lady Bathory?',''),(3820,'Kakon','What is it you want to know from me? Let us hear it, then.','What did you do when you were human?\n\t**How did you meet Lady Bathory?\n\t**How did you learn black magic?\n\t**I should be on my way.'),(3821,'Kakon','Look at me and you can guess what I was, can you not? I held the place of shaman to my tribe, an Indian who wanted eternal life. Rather unusual, would you say? People are usually much taken with the world after death, but I have no interest in a life that comes after dying.','How did you meet Lady Bathory?\n\t**How did you learn black magic?\n\t**I should be on my way.'),(3822,'Kakon','Hm... Lady Bathory is the one who helped me become a vampire. How did I meet her? I followed Lord Vrykolakas, and there she was. I offered her my blood... and I was granted eternal life. After that I made myself her servant of my own accord.','What did you do when you were human?\n\t**How did you learn black magic?\n\t**I should be on my way.'),(3823,'Kakon','I believe what matters is the time you are alive. So all I wanted was to lengthen my own life a little. Then it occurred to me that black magic might let me have what I wanted. So I travelled from place to place, studying black magic. And then... I met Lord Vrykolakas. To this day I count meeting him my good fortune. Anyone who studies magic will have heard at least once that he is a famous black mage. When I told him what I wanted, he asked: "If you obtain what you want, you will never see the sun again. Are you content with that?" I said I was ready to sell my very soul. At that he took me somewhere, and this is what I became.','What did you do when you were human?\n\t**How did you meet Lady Bathory?\n\t**I should be on my way.'),(3824,'Kakon','Go... and drink the blood of every living thing. Ha ha ha.','Farewell.'),(3825,'Kakon','About a clan... what exactly is it you want?','I have come to register a clan. \n\t**I would like to view the pending clan list.\n\t**I would like to view the clan list.\n\t**I would like to leave my clan.\n\t**It seems I have no business here.'),(3826,'Kakon','Leaving your clan, you say? Have you thought it over carefully? Hm... I will accept your withdrawal, but understand this. Once you leave, another clan will not readily take you in. You broke the oath with your own hands... so even to go elsewhere, a full week of real time must pass.','Understood, but I would like to leave.\n\t**In that case I will think it over again.'),(4000,'Kaiser','Well met, recruit. The situation is urgent, so I will keep this brief. Listen carefully. My name is Kaiser Heinrich, commander of E.V.E.\'s Second Mercenary Corps and in overall charge of this operation. The operation you are joining will most likely be the final and a very fierce war against them. Now, I will begin with a short briefing.','Forgive me, but may I ask a question?\n\t\t**Yes. Begin the briefing, please.\n\t\t**I came to learn sword skills, Commander!\n\t\t**I came to learn blade skills, Commander!\n\t\t**I would like to take on the Sealing of the Barrier quest.\n\t\t**I would like the reward for the Sealing of the Barrier quest.\n\t\t**I would like to abandon the Sealing of the Barrier quest.\n\t\t**I have already been told the situation. Farewell.'),(4002,'Kaiser','If you have not heard the briefing, you had best hear it before you go. Given the situation, you must know it thoroughly before you enter combat. There is no telling how many vampires their numbers grow by in a single day. Your part in this matters more than ever... if you have questions, I will answer those within what you need to know. What do you wish to know?','Who are you?\n**Forgive me, but what sort of organisation is E.V.E.?\n**Exactly what region is this?\n**I will hear the briefing first.\n**Farewell.'),(4003,'Kaiser','As I said before, I am Kaiser Heinrich, commander of E.V.E.\'s Second Mercenary Corps and in charge of this operation. First go to Tanya for information on weapons, then draw the weapon you will use from Jacques. Bear in mind that once you leave here nobody can give you a weapon, and your weapon is your life. Do not leave without it! Any other questions?','What sort of organisation is E.V.E.?\n**Where is this?\n**I will hear the briefing.\n**I will set out, then.'),(4004,'Kaiser','Hm... you will have heard of it, no doubt... our E.V.E. is an anti-vampire unit backed by the European Union and the Holy See. Outsiders take us for a counter-terrorist force under EU command. The unit itself is not yet a year old, of course. In fact each European state ran its own special unit for dealing with vampires, and last year\'s "Bloody Monday" gave the impetus for a full merger, out of which our unit was born. For more detail, Smith of TEAM TWO, deployed in Eslanian City, can tell you. Any other questions?','Forgive me, but who are you?\n**Exactly what region is this?\n**Begin the briefing, please.\n**I will be on my way.'),(4005,'Kaiser','The virtual training ground is for those receiving their first instruction. It uses a wide stretch of forest, and in forest combat danger will be everywhere. Checking your information and level from time to time during an engagement will help. Ctrl + I opens the information window, Ctrl + K the level window. At level 5 you can learn skills from the instructors on the third floor of each guild in Eslanian City. Any other questions?','Who are you?\n**What sort of organisation is E.V.E.?\n**I will hear the briefing first.\n**I will set out, then.'),(4006,'Kaiser','Come back from the training safely. And go to Cain on the second floor of the priest guild for material on the vampires. You need to know the basics about what you are facing... good luck to you, recruit.','Understood.'),(4007,'Kaiser','Vampire movements have been detected here in Eslanian. According to our informants they are searching for something, and unfortunately they move about wholly unaffected by sunlight. Whether it is coincidence or not, the vampire masters scattered across the world are said to be gathering in this region too. Their appearance has us on edge. The Eslanian government could not meet these creatures with the firepower of its regular army. Having learned they were vampires, it has placed the region and the press under control. The Eslanian premier asked the Pope for help, and the Pope has asked us. Our command, already uneasy at the masters\' movements, had sent a few agents in secret, but contact with them has been lost. So this time every slayer we can muster will be committed to the operation. With the press and the region sealed off, conditions for us are good. I consider this an excellent chance to show what we can do. I expect great things of you.','Yes. Understood, Commander!'),(4008,'Kaiser','Then we will begin the area briefing. The operation will take place in Helea, in Eslania, renowned for its rugged mountains and scenery but so deep in the interior that few people pass through. Most of the inhabitants live off slash-and-burn farming rather than tourist income. Education levels are low, and living standards are the poorest in Eslania. Helea covers a wide area but has almost no plains, so it holds only five settlements, barely large enough to be called towns. It appears the vampires have surfaced around these settlements. They lie no more than 200 km from the capital, but the terrain is harsh and the roads poor, and that isolation is presumably what made sealing the region and the press so easy. There are five villages in all, each about 10 km apart, laid out around Eslanian City.','Ideal conditions for an operation, by the sound of it. Tell me more.'),(4009,'Kaiser','Putting together everything we have, the masters are said to be slipping into that region one after another. They rest in lairs prepared by their servants and set those servants searching for something. Their lairs are arranged so as to encircle the villages. The problem is that all twelve are gathering. In all our records there is not a single instance of all twelve masters assembling. We do not know what they are looking for, but it is clearly important, and it seems to be what allows the vampires there to move about by day. If so, it must be something enormous, for them and for us alike. Your task is to seize whatever the masters are seeking, and to eliminate the masters themselves if you can.','I understand my task. Any further orders?'),(4010,'Kaiser','The slayers\' assembly point at present is the government building in town. Every weapon and piece of equipment you will use is issued there first. Avoid acting alone and move in groups wherever possible. A great many locals have already fallen to the vampires. And many more still cannot get out because of the cordon. Do not forget that their safety is part of your duty too. See to it that no more people lose their homes and families to the vampires. This operation does not mean facing one or two vampires but a great many, so take particular care. And should a vampire bite you, take your own life as our code requires... good luck.','Understood. I will be on my way, then.'),(4011,'Kaiser','Bear in mind that nothing matters more than your own life.',''),(4012,'Kaiser','Recruit! Go to Jacques, who handles the weapons, and be sure to draw yours.',''),(4013,'Kaiser','I am Kaiser Heinrich. Have you ever heard of Kaiser\'s Law? Ha ha.',''),(4014,'Kaiser','I believe E.V.E.\'s Second Mercenary Corps is the strongest of all eleven.',''),(4015,'Kaiser','Go to Cain on the second floor of the priest guild and you will find all manner of books on the vampires.',''),(4016,'Kaiser','You there, when you have the time, be sure to read Noam Chomsky\'s writings. You may come to realise something.',''),(4017,'Kaiser','I hear there is a grimoire of Albertus that can break any barrier. Have you heard anything of it?',''),(4018,'Kaiser','Are we really so short of troops with the wit to break an Ousters\' barrier?',''),(4019,'Kaiser','Do not be too shaken by what lies before your eyes now. This is nothing...',''),(4020,'Kaiser','Now and then I get the urge to leave everything behind and go somewhere.',''),(4021,'Kaiser','When I watch the sun rise in the morning, I think: I am alive another day...',''),(4030,'Kaiser','Hm... there is nothing detailed enough to pass on to you yet. Only that there is a strong chance the other monsters, the "Ousters", are more than a tale told in legend. And you must bear in mind that they may pose a threat to us. Detailed information about them depends, I think, on how diligently you carry out this operation.','Yes, understood.'),(4031,'Kaiser','Legend says the Ousters were victims of vampire bites. Before they could turn into vampires they sought the help of Carissas, a famous shaman of the time, and tried to keep their minds from being taken by the blood. But they cannot be called human. They live forever, have no need to drink blood, and are unaffected by the sun. Personally I find them rather ideal beings. What remains a mystery is why so many of them appeared all at once.','Thank you. That was a fascinating account.'),(4032,'Kaiser','I have no more information that would help you. Go and find Hannibal on the third floor of the priest guild... he can help you. Good fortune go with you.','Yes, understood.'),(4033,'Kaiser','I regret to say I have grave doubts about whether you can carry out this Ousters operation properly. If you recognise the gravity of it yourself, I trust you will understand. So, will you take the operation aptitude test?','Of course. I am confident.'),(4034,'Kaiser','Now I will trust you and assign you the formal task. According to the advance party\'s report, two residents claim to have seen something that did not appear to be a vampire yet was too strange to be called human. The advance party only learned that such witnesses exist; they have made no direct contact. You are to find the witnesses and bring back what they know. Can you carry out this task?','Of course. Leave it to me.'),(4035,'Kaiser','The next task will come through Hannibal. Go to the third floor of the priest guild and you will find him. Good fortune go with you.','Yes, thank you.'),(4036,'Kaiser','I have no further tasks for you. I understood Hannibal on the third floor of the priest guild was giving out the tasks. Was I wrong?','Excuse me. There seems to have been a mistake.'),(4037,'Kaiser','You did better than expected, recruit. But passing the test does not oblige you to carry out the operation. Sitting the test alone earns you a full reward from E.V.E. Taking on the formal task is entirely your choice. So, will you take the reward, or carry out the formal task? I trust you will judge wisely.','I would like to carry on with the task.\n**The formal task feels too much for me. I would like the reward.'),(4038,'Kaiser','The information you brought was extremely important. I am truly proud of you. So, can you carry out the next task as well? As before, you are not obliged to take it on. Completing this task alone earns you a full reward from E.V.E. The next task will be more dangerous and more difficult. Taking it on is entirely your choice. So, will you take the reward, or carry out the next task? I trust your courage.','Assign me any task at all.\n**Frankly, this task was almost too much for me as well. I would like the reward.'),(4039,'Kaiser','The task you took on was not one I gave you, was it? Go and check again.','Excuse me.'),(4040,'Kaiser','You would need to have completed some task before you could expect a reward...','Ah, I do beg your pardon.'),(4041,'Kaiser','To come back without completing even a task like this... you disappoint me greatly, recruit. Do you really mean to give up?','I am sorry to disappoint you, but this task is too much for me.\n**No. I only came to give an interim report.'),(4042,'Kaiser','Did I assign you a task? Have I lost my mind, or have you got something wrong?','Is that so? There seems to have been some mistake.'),(4043,'Kaiser','What are you talking about? You have already completed the task splendidly. I do not care for jokes. Go and take your reward.','Ah, my apologies.'),(4044,'Kaiser','You already have a quest in progress... is there some problem?','No. Excuse me.'),(4045,'Kaiser','It seems you carried out the task safely. In that case, why not settle the reward before taking on the next one?','So it is. I had not thought of that.'),(4046,'Kaiser','I regret to say I have grave doubts about whether you can carry out this operation properly. That is because command judges only the wise can see it through. If you recognise the gravity of it yourself, I trust you will understand. So, will you take the operation aptitude test?','Of course. I am confident.\n\t\t**Give me time to think it over.'),(4047,'Kaiser','There is no time for a long explanation. We urgently need a pendulum that can sense magical force, and to use it we must have a dowsing rod made of a particular mineral. Can you find ten pieces of this mineral?','Of course. Leave it to me.\n\t\t**I will come back once I have checked my equipment.\n\t\t'),(4048,'Kaiser','Thanks to your efforts we have mineral fragments enough. But refining them requires a substance called refinium, which is said to be obtainable only from a certain mine in south-western Eslania. The place is guarded against intruders by invisible walls and traps, so particular care is needed. Well? Can you do it?','Of course. Leave it to me.\n\t\t**I will come back once I have checked my equipment.\n\t\t'),(4049,'Kaiser','Our survey with the pendulum and the dowsing rod has located the clay figure that will reveal where the grimoire holding the key to breaking the Ousters\' barrier lies. The clay figure is said to be broken into pieces scattered across the regions of Eslania. Can you gather every fragment and put it back together?','Of course. Leave it to me.\n\t\t**I will come back once I have checked my equipment.\n\t\t'),(4050,'Kaiser','Fortunately we succeeded in finding the grimoire. But to read it we must find five kinds of magic stone and assemble a code table. To complete the table correctly you must combine the spells inscribed on the stones, avoiding the spells of the stones adjacent above, below, left and right. Study the table and it should be plain enough, so given the time I will say no more. Can you see it through to the end? Then take the code table.','Of course. Leave it to me.\n\t\t**I will come back once I have checked my equipment.\n\t\t'),(4051,'Kaiser','You already have a quest in progress... is there some problem?','No. Excuse me.\n\t\t'),(4052,'Kaiser','It seems you carried out the task safely. In that case, why not settle the reward before taking on the next one?','So it is. I had not thought of that.\n\t\t'),(4053,'Kaiser','You did better than expected, recruit. But passing the test does not oblige you to carry out the operation. Sitting the test alone earns you a full reward from E.V.E. Taking on the formal task is entirely your choice. So, will you take the reward, or carry out the formal task? I trust you will judge wisely.','I would like to carry on with the task.\n\t\t**The formal task feels too much for me. I would like the reward.\n\t\t'),(4054,'Kaiser','Oh... is this the mineral fragment? Well done indeed. So, can you carry out the next task as well? As before, you are not obliged to take it on. Completing this task alone earns you a full reward from E.V.E. The next task will be more dangerous and more difficult. Taking it on is entirely your choice. So, will you take the reward, or carry out the next task? I trust your courage.','Assign me any task at all.\n\t\t**Frankly, this task was almost too much for me as well. I would like the reward.\n\t\t'),(4055,'Kaiser','Well done. I am truly proud of you. So, can you carry out the next task as well? As before, you are not obliged to take it on. Completing this task alone earns you a full reward from E.V.E. The next task will be more dangerous and more difficult. Taking it on is entirely your choice. So, will you take the reward, or carry out the next task? I trust your courage.','Assign me any task at all.\n\t\t**Frankly, this task was almost too much for me as well. I would like the reward.\n\t\t'),(4056,'Kaiser','Well done. I am truly proud of you. So, can you carry out the next task as well? As before, you are not obliged to take it on. Completing this task alone earns you a full reward from E.V.E. The next task will be more dangerous and more difficult. Taking it on is entirely your choice. So, will you take the reward, or carry out the next task? I trust your courage.','Assign me any task at all.\n\t\t**Frankly, this task was almost too much for me as well. I would like the reward.\n\t\t'),(4058,'Kaiser','You have completed the code table already? Remarkable. I promise the reward for your achievement will not be ungenerous. With this we have everything we need to break the Ousters\' barrier and go in. It would be no exaggeration at all to call you a hero.','You are too kind.\n\t\t'),(4059,'Kaiser','You would need to have completed some task before you could expect a reward...','Ah, I do beg your pardon.\n\t\t'),(4060,'Kaiser','What is this? Do you mean to abandon the next task?','I want to forget the whole business of tasks. I would like the reward for the previous quest.\n\t\t**No. I was only saying it.\n\t\t'),(4061,'Kaiser','To come back without completing even a task like this... you disappoint me greatly, recruit. Do you really mean to give up?','The task is a little too much. I will take it on again later.\n\t\t**No. I only came to give an interim report.\n\t\t'),(4062,'Kaiser','To come back without completing even a task like this... you disappoint me greatly, recruit. Do you really mean to give up?','The task is a little too much. I will take it on again later.\n\t\t**I want to forget the whole business of tasks. I would like the reward for the previous quest.\n\t\t**No. I only came to give an interim report.\n\t\t'),(4063,'Kaiser','If that is truly how it is, there is nothing for it. But let me advise you, not as your superior but as someone who has been at this longer: think it over once more.','I believe I did all I could. I would rather just take the reward.\n\t\t**If that is your advice, I will think it over once more.\n\t\t'),(4064,'Kaiser','Did I assign you a task? Have I lost my mind, or have you got something wrong?','Is that so? There seems to have been some mistake.\n\t\t'),(4065,'Kaiser','What are you talking about? You have already completed the task splendidly. I do not care for jokes. Go and take your reward.','Ah, my apologies.\n\t\t'),(4070,'Kaiser','Then go to %(QuestZone) and find 8 %(Target).','Understood.'),(4071,'Kaiser','Gather every fragment of the clay figure at %(QuestZone) and put it back together.','Understood.'),(4101,'Jacques','Vampires are dead bodies to begin with, so of course you know they can regenerate from most gunshots and blade wounds, recruit! That is the one principle you must never forget. More than a few have turned their backs on a vampire they failed to destroy completely and died for it. This instructor nearly died the same way. Well. You have the look of someone with a question. Anything to ask?','There is something I would like to know.\n**Yes. Explain the difference between a sword and a blade.\n**Ah... what exactly do AR, SMG, SG and SR mean?\n**How does a cross differ from a mace?\n**What weapons can I choose from?\n**I came to learn skills related to firearms. Teach me.\n**I would like to exchange an instructor\'s notebook.\n**Understood. Keep up the good work, Mister Jacques.'),(4102,'Jacques','Not knowing the difference between a sword and a blade. A raw recruit through and through. Well, it happens... a sword is comparatively light and edged on both sides, so it can cut and thrust. But do not imagine thrusting works on a vampire. The body is already dead and feels no pain. Unless you run the heart through and kill it outright, you will not get the sword back out and the attacker is the one in danger. So whether you carry a light sword or a heavy blade, the safest thing is to swing with everything you have and cut it in two, reducing its attack or its movement. A blade is edged on one side only and is heavier and slower to swing than a sword, but it can cut a vampire in half in a single stroke. Understood?','I would like to know the difference between AR, SMG, SG and SR.\r\n**A cross and a mace look much the same to me... how do they differ?\r\n**Understood. I will choose a weapon, then.\r\n**Understood. Keep up the good work.'),(4103,'Jacques','AR is the assault rifle. When people say "gun" they generally mean a rifle, and the rifle is the ordinary weapon, with reasonable firepower and reasonable accuracy. It is also the weapon most slayers use. Next. SMG is the sub-machine gun, a compact weapon used by counter-terrorist and special forces units. It is light and easy to carry, but its firepower is a little weaker. SG is the shotgun, which as you know fires shot. At close range it will tear a vampire to ribbons in an instant. SR stands for sniper rifle, and as the name says, it is for taking a vampire\'s head or heart off from a distance. Next?','Jacques... could you explain swords and blades to me?\r\n**Crosses and maces... what sort of weapons are these? This is hardly the Middle Ages...\r\n**Let me choose a weapon.\r\n**Ha ha... you hardly need a weapon to kill vampires. Keep up the good work, then.'),(4104,'Jacques','Crosses and maces... frankly, not my field. They are weapons used mostly by slayers who came out of the Vatican priesthood. The priests who carry a cross generally have powerful treatment and healing abilities, and I gather the mace goes to those who use blessing magic. These weapons are made specially by the Holy See, and they are said to do lethal damage to a vampire. For the details, ask one of the other recruits who came from the Vatican. Next?','Explain the difference between a sword and a blade.\r\n**What exactly do AR, SMG, SG and SR mean?\r\n**What weapons can I choose from?\r\n**Thank you for the explanation, Mister Jacques. Until next time.'),(4105,'Jacques','Decided? You can switch to another weapon later, so there is no need to agonise over it. Right. Which will it be? Hm... do you know how to equip and use the weapon you are issued? A soldier going into battle who cannot equip or use his weapon makes no sense. Watch my demonstration closely and make no mistakes in the field. Your issued weapon is in the inventory, which opens with the TAB key. Bring up the inventory and the gear window that holds equipment with CTRL + TAB, then drag each item from the inventory onto the matching slot in the gear window. If an equipped item shows in red, that is because your stats fall short of what the item requires. Remember that to use an item properly you must raise your stats. A weapon is fired with a left mouse click. You are still a novice, so train hard, check your level with Ctrl + K, and at level 5 you can learn skills from the instructors on the third floor of each guild in Eslanian City.','I will take the sword, light and quick.\r\n**I will take the blade, heavy but high in damage.\r\n**I will take the assault rifle (AR).\r\n**I will take the sub-machine gun (SMG).\r\n**I will take the shotgun (SG).\r\n**I will take the sniper rifle (SR).\r\n**I will take the cross.\r\n**I will take the mace.\r\n**Ha ha... you hardly need a weapon to kill vampires. Keep up the good work, then.\r\n**Forgive me, Jacques. Could you explain that once more?'),(4106,'Jacques','Hm. This intake has a great many questions. Well then, recruit? What is it you want to know so badly?','Mister Jacques. Explain the difference between a sword and a blade.\r\n**What do AR, SMG, SG and SR stand for?\r\n**How does a cross differ from a mace?\r\n**Ah. I see now. Let me choose a weapon, then.\r\n**Understood. Keep up the good work, Mister Jacques.\r\n**I see ampoules in my inventory as well as the weapon... what are they for?'),(4107,'Jacques','Eh? The record says you already drew a weapon... does it not? Are you playing games with me!','My apologies, Mister Jacques. Forgive me.'),(4108,'Jacques','For detailed information on the weapons, go to Tanya and you can search it easily on the computer. Be sure to stop by. Good luck to you.','Thank you, Jacques.'),(4109,'Jacques','What is it you want to know, recruit?','Who are you?\r\n**What did you do before you came to E.V.E.?\r\n**I hear you served as a mercenary. I would like to know about it.\r\n**Yes. Explain the difference between a sword and a blade.\r\n**Ah... what exactly do AR, SMG, SG and SR mean?\r\n**How does a cross differ from a mace?\r\n**What weapons can I choose from?\r\n**Understood. Keep up the good work, Mister Jacques.'),(4110,'Jacques','My name is Jacques Vermeulen. Here at headquarters I issue you your weapons and a little money. Anything else?','What did you do before you came to E.V.E.?\r\n**I hear you served as a mercenary. I would like to know about it.\r\n**Yes. Explain the difference between a sword and a blade.\r\n**Ah... what exactly do AR, SMG, SG and SR mean?\r\n**How does a cross differ from a mace?\r\n**What weapons can I choose from?\r\n**Understood. Keep up the good work, Mister Jacques.'),(4111,'Jacques','The moment I enlisted I was sent to Vietnam, and after that I ranged over most of the battlefields in the world. I finished my mercenary days in the French Foreign Legion and went into seclusion, until Commander Kaiser, whom I had served with before, urged me to come here recently. Anything more?','Who are you?\r\n**I hear you served as a mercenary. I would like to know about it.\r\n**Yes. Explain the difference between a sword and a blade.\r\n**Ah... what exactly do AR, SMG, SG and SR mean?\r\n**How does a cross differ from a mace?\r\n**What weapons can I choose from?\r\n**Understood. Keep up the good work, Mister Jacques.'),(4112,'Jacques','A mercenary is a soldier who serves in return for pay. The drawbacks are a shortage of loyalty and of men of real quality, but the practice has been common since ancient times, to protect a nation\'s own people or to make up a shortfall in troops. Beyond loyalty and quality, a mercenary is hired for money and will change sides between friend and foe as pay and other terms dictate. Mercenaries are mostly foreigners, so living alongside a nation\'s own soldiers or running joint operations often causes friction. Today, besides the Holy See\'s guard, the French Foreign Legion is the best known mercenary force. Understood, recruit?','Who are you?\r\n**What did you do before you came to E.V.E.?\r\n**Yes. Explain the difference between a sword and a blade.\r\n**Ah... what exactly do AR, SMG, SG and SR mean?\r\n**How does a cross differ from a mace?\r\n**What weapons can I choose from?\r\n**Understood. Keep up the good work, Mister Jacques.'),(4113,'Jacques','There are two kinds of ampoule. The red healing ampoule and the blue mana ampoule. Watch the two bars, health and mana, at the top left of the interface and use the ampoules accordingly. Without a belt, you use an ampoule by opening the inventory and right-clicking it. Ampoules can also be assigned to shortcuts for convenience: buy a belt item from a shop and drag ampoules onto the belt. Depending on the number of pockets you can assign them from F1 up to F8 and use them as shortcuts. Inject a healing ampoule when you feel you are in danger and it will restore your health; use the blue mana ampoule to replenish the magic power your skills consume.','Understood. I will not forget it in the field.'),(4114,'Jacques','When you meet a vampire, shatter the heart first and then take the head off. Understood?',''),(4115,'Jacques','In the end a gun, like a sword or a blade, must become as familiar to you as a part of your own body.',''),(4116,'Jacques','When you address me, always call me Mister Jacques.',''),(4117,'Jacques','Recruits are to come to me, state their rank and name, and draw their weapon.',''),(4118,'Jacques','Keep silence when Commander Kaiser gives his briefing.',''),(4119,'Jacques','Handling a gun like that. What do you expect to achieve with an attitude like yours, recruit!',''),(4120,'Jacques','If it were not for Commander Kaiser I would be a wreck by now. I owe that man everything...',''),(4121,'Jacques','With my own hands, those creatures...',''),(4122,'Jacques','I have ranged over every corner of the world, but I have never seen them run as free as they do here.',''),(4123,'Jacques','If you want to know more, go and see Tanya. You can search for the weapon information you want yourself.',''),(4124,'Jacques','Do not treat this as a game. Bear in mind at all times that this is the real thing!',''),(4200,'Cain','Do you know what a vampire truly is? Then again, you are still young, so perhaps it is only right that you do not know their true nature. Fighting them with gun and blade matters, of course, but there are moments when approaching the secret of those immortals through the intellect matters more. They are immortal not only as individuals but as a species. You could burn one or two of them, but to wipe out the whole of them... hm... ah... forgive me. Something else to research just occurred to me. Read the books here and you will learn a little about the vampires you must fight. Well then...','One moment. Who are you, to know the vampires in such detail?\r\n**Would you recommend some books worth reading?'),(4201,'Cain','Did I not introduce myself? My apologies. Just call me Cain. Now I must get back to my research.','Understood. I will look through the books here for a while, then.\r\n**Thank you. I will be on my way.'),(4202,'Cain','I am not bound to E.V.E. here. I am only a visiting researcher.',''),(4203,'Cain','Gather information from a range of sources and you begin to see how full of conspiracy the world is.',''),(4204,'Cain','Our findings show that most of the world\'s organisations have some connection to the vampires.',''),(4205,'Cain','Read the books here carefully and you will learn a fair amount about the vampires.',''),(4206,'Cain','I should love a daughter like Tanya. Pretty. Clever. So why has she still no sweetheart?',''),(4207,'Cain','If you come across any old books while on a task, be sure to bring them to me.',''),(4301,'Tanya','Tanya Serrano. What can I do for you?','There is something I would like to ask you.\r\n**I would like to take part in the virtual training system.\r\n**I want to search for weapon information. Could you help me?\r\n**It was good to meet you, Tanya.\r\n**I came to learn a skill.'),(4302,'Tanya','What is it... you want to know?','Tanya, what is your work here?\r\n**How did you come to be at E.V.E.?\r\n**I want to search for weapon information. Could you help me?\r\n**It was good to meet you, Tanya.'),(4303,'Tanya','I handle information strategy within E.V.E. At present I am at this temporary headquarters, helping the slayers search for weapon information. Have you heard about the situation here in Eslanian? Go to Commander Kaiser and he will give you a detailed briefing.','How did you come to be at E.V.E.?\r\n**I want to search for weapon information. Could you help me?\r\n**It was good to meet you, Tanya.'),(4304,'Tanya','I once hacked a CIA computer by chance and happened to read a document marked as a state secret. The secret in it was quite extraordinary. It covered the CIA agents\' involvement with the vampires. Several agents had been handling business for vampires who cannot easily move during daylight. There were transcripts of calls, ledgers, piles of documents. Every click was a genuine thrill. I was so caught up in the thought that I had stumbled into something like this that I read on... and was traced, and my location exposed. A mistake. A government agency came for me and bargained over what I had seen and over me. They dug up a drugs charge from two years earlier and threatened me with a life sentence. They set joining E.V.E. as the condition... so I had no choice but to accept it, and here I am.','Tanya, what is your work here?\r\n**I want to search for weapon information. Could you help me?\r\n**It was good to meet you, Tanya.'),(4305,'Tanya','To draw a weapon, go and see Mister Jacques. He knows as much about weapons as any computer... go to him and you will learn a great deal. Oh, and to see how an item you are carrying is used, press TAB to bring up the inventory and click the magnifier button at the bottom. Then click the item you want to know about and a brief description of its use will appear. Keep that in mind. Well... good luck to you.','Goodbye.'),(4306,'Tanya','Will you learn the heal line, or the enchant line?','I will learn the heal line.\r\n**I will learn the enchant line.\r\n**Rather than skills, I would like to know what you do here.\r\n**I will learn skills later. But... how did you come to be at E.V.E.?\r\n**Rather than training, I want to search for weapon information. Could you help me?\r\n**I will learn skills later. It was good to meet you, Tanya.\r\n'),(4307,'Tanya','Just call me Tanya.',''),(4308,'Tanya','A computer is only a computer. It is the person using it who is truly remarkable.',''),(4309,'Tanya','Then again, there are plenty of people worse than a computer these days. A computer is at least honest.',''),(4310,'Tanya','Use this computer to search for weapon information.',''),(4311,'Tanya','Do not forget to draw your weapon from Mister Jacques. I have seen people set off without one and have to come back a few times now.',''),(4312,'Tanya','You cannot call a script kiddie a hacker.',''),(4313,'Tanya','Tanya, in charge of information strategy.',''),(4314,'Tanya','Ask me anything you do not know. I will give you what information I can.',''),(4315,'Tanya','Have you had the general explanation from Commander Kaiser? Go and see him if you have not. He has a great deal of important things to tell you.',''),(4316,'Tanya','Never forget to stay alert. I have seen more than a few people lose their heads for taking it easy...',''),(4317,'Tanya','When it comes to weapons, Mister Jacques is a match for any computer. If there is more you want to know, going to him will help.',''),(4400,'Matthew','I am Major Matthew Graham, captain of this Sikorsky. Call me Matt if you like, but in the air it is Captain. Where are you headed?','I want to go to the Perona highway.\n\t\t**I want to go to the free duel zone.\n\t\t**I have come to borrow the token of the Blood Bible.\n\t\t**I will return the token of the Blood Bible.\n\t\t**I am only looking around. Sorry to disturb you.'),(4401,'Matthew','Strap in tight. This bird has no doors, so you may well be blown out. Ha ha ha!',''),(4402,'Matthew','Take-off and landing are loud and rough, so press yourself into the seat and cover your ears!',''),(4403,'Matthew','There are no special safety devices here, so look after yourself!',''),(4404,'Matthew','There are parachutes behind the seats. You know how to put one on, I trust?',''),(4405,'Matthew','Bring me your orders and I will drop you where you want within ten minutes.',''),(4406,'Matthew','The free duel zone has "Olt", for duels within your own kind, and "Banatul", where you can duel freely regardless of kind. Choose where you want to go.','I want to go to Olt.\r\n**I want to go to Banatul.\r\n**I will think it over and decide.'),(4407,'Matthew','There are still many around us in need who are waiting for a kind hand. We are collecting donations so that your love can reach them. Would you care to join the collection too, %(UserName)?','I would like to give as an individual.\n\t\t**I would like to give on behalf of my team.'),(4408,'Matthew','Thank you for your warm hand. The amount you have given will be posted on the homepage. The precious donation you have made today, %(UserName), will be put to good use where it is truly needed, where a kind hand is wanted.','I will make a donation.\n\t\t**I will call on you again next time.'),(4409,'Matthew','I am sorry. You are not currently in a team, %(UserName), or you are not yet a full member. If you are not in a team, please give as an individual.','I would like to give as an individual, then.\n\t\t**Yes, understood.'),(4410,'Skip','Ha ha! I am Skip. Captain Skip Bustler. Pilot of this clapped-out Sikorsky. Well? What is it? Do you have flight orders?','Yes, Captain. I need to get to the warrior guild building urgently.\r\n**Captain. Set me down at the priest guild building\'s helipad.\r\n**Captain. I want to go to the Perona highway.\r\n**I want to go to the free duel zone.\r\n**Keep up the good work, Captain Skip.'),(4411,'Skip','Anyone who flies keeps an ear on the forecast. They say it will be windy today.',''),(4412,'Skip','Night flying is genuinely hard work! Your field of view narrows and it gets so much trickier... and the people who come here have no regard for day or night, it drives me mad!',''),(4413,'Skip','Taking off and landing at a field with no proper helipad is when I sweat most. Get it wrong... and the airframe settles onto the ground and you have a serious accident.',''),(4414,'Skip','I do not take responsibility for your life as well. If you fall out of this Sikorsky... what happens after that is no concern of mine!',''),(4415,'Skip','The free duel zone has "Olt", for duels within your own kind, and "Banatul", where you can duel freely regardless of kind. Take your pick.','I want to go to Olt.\r\n**I want to go to Banatul.\r\n**I will think it over and decide.'),(4417,'Matthew','There are so many people around us in need.',''),(4418,'Matthew','May those less fortunate than us receive a warmer hand...',''),(4419,'Matthew','Thank you. As a member of %(GuildName), you are donating in the name of %(GuildName), %(UserName). The amount you have given will be posted on the homepage under the team\'s name. Posted amounts are shown as a running total. The precious donations gathered in the name of %(GuildName) will be put to good use where they are truly needed, where a kind hand is wanted.','I am making a donation.\n\t\t**I will call on you again next time.'),(4420,'Gary','Good day. I am Gary Austin, captain of this Super Stallion. Where to this time?','The warrior guild building.\r\n**The soldier guild building.\r\n**The Perona highway.\r\n**The free duel zone.\r\n**Ah. Never mind. Excuse me.'),(4521,'Gary','Take care to strap in, or you may fall out.',''),(4522,'Gary','I service the engine every day. Otherwise there is no telling when she will give trouble.',''),(4523,'Gary','Weather like today\'s is good flying weather. On days of rain or thunder there is no telling when something will go wrong, so I fly carefully.',''),(4524,'Gary','Here in Eslania, taking the helicopter is less dangerous than travelling on foot.',''),(4525,'Gary','The free duel zone has "Olt", for duels within your own kind, and "Banatul", where you can duel freely regardless of kind. Please choose.','I want to go to Olt.\r\n**I want to go to Banatul.\r\n**I will think it over and decide.'),(4600,'Erzsebet Bathory','Who is this? Who enters my domain without leave?','Great master, I have come to become your servant.\r\n**Forgive me, master. I will leave this place at once.'),(4601,'Erzsebet Bathory','And who are you? Vlad\'s dog, for all I know... I must test whether you are fit to be my loyal servant. Offer me your blood!','Understood. If even my filthy blood is what you desire...\r\n**I came only on Vrykolakas\' orders, to see to Lady Erzsebet Bathory\'s wellbeing.\r\n**Forgive me, master, but must I offer my blood before you will trust me?\r\n'),(4602,'Erzsebet Bathory','Vrykolakas sent you? Did he? And how does Vrykolakas fare these days?','Lord Vrykolakas thinks of nothing but you, master. He is gathering the fresh blood of every young maiden in Eslania.'),(4603,'Erzsebet Bathory','I see... if only for Vrykolakas\' sake, I must build my strength quickly. Go at once and gather fresh blood yourself.','Yes, master!'),(4604,'Erzsebet Bathory','Now I see your heart. You have become my faithful servant, so I will set you a task. Your work is to gather blood so that my power may grow, and to bring me the Blood Bible that Vlad holds. Whoever brings me these two shall have my reward.','Understood. I will obey at once.'),(4605,'Erzsebet Bathory','You will not offer me your worthless blood? Then death it is. Choose! Give me your blood, or choose death.','I will offer my blood.\r\n**I choose death.'),(4606,'Erzsebet Bathory','Your tongue is as cunning as a serpent\'s. You are lower than a worm. Get out of here this instant.','I will withdraw, master.'),(4607,'Erzsebet Bathory','I will not soil my hands. Get out!','Farewell.'),(4609,'Erzsebet Bathory','Now that I am reduced to this, I must take in more blood still. Go and bring me fresh blood!',''),(4610,'Erzsebet Bathory','More women must be taken to replenish my blood.',''),(4611,'Erzsebet Bathory','Is there nobody out there? I need fresh blood! Bring it at once!',''),(4612,'Erzsebet Bathory','Whoever brings me the Blood Bible that Vlad holds shall have my reward.',''),(4613,'Erzsebet Bathory','Is that the best you can do? Bring me more women!',''),(4614,'Erzsebet Bathory','Feeble creatures... I cannot stand the sight of you! Get out!',''),(4615,'Erzsebet Bathory','Take every woman in Eslania. Search every corner of every house and leave not one!',''),(4616,'Erzsebet Bathory','My loyal servants! Go and bring me Vlad\'s head.',''),(4617,'Erzsebet Bathory','If that is the limit of your loyalty... so be it. I shall have to kill you all myself...',''),(4618,'Erzsebet Bathory','Whichever of my loyal servants brings me Vlad\'s head shall be rewarded in full measure.',''),(4619,'Erzsebet Bathory','Vrykolakas was my master in magic. There is nobody alive to match him. Not even I...',''),(4620,'Erzsebet Bathory','With the Blood Bible... I become the strongest of all. And on the day the others\' copies fall into my hands, the world is mine.',''),(4621,'Erzsebet Bathory','I am still formidable. Small fry like you I could make vanish in an instant.',''),(4622,'Erzsebet Bathory','There are servants loyal to me still, and for their sake I must rise again quickly.',''),(4623,'Erzsebet Bathory','On the day I rise again, Vlad will be sent to the next world.',''),(4624,'Erzsebet Bathory','Bring me Vlad\'s head and I shall drink his blood where I stand!',''),(4625,'Erzsebet Bathory','Several of my servants turned traitor and went over to Vlad\'s camp. The day I rise will be the day of their funeral.',''),(4626,'Erzsebet Bathory','With one more Blood Bible the other masters will come to me in a rather more cooperative frame of mind. And then those who laughed at me... I shall hunt them down and make them lick my feet.',''),(4701,'Rebecca','The master has changed. Whatever can have happened... and even so, to have me standing among these tradespeople... hm? Did you say something to me just now?','Yes, there is something I came to ask.\n\t**Rebecca, I would like my alignment adjusted.\n\t**I would like to see the weapons and beads. Will you show me?\n\t**I would like to take on the Sealing of the Barrier quest.\n\t**I would like the reward for the Sealing of the Barrier quest.\n\t**I would like to abandon the Sealing of the Barrier quest.\n\t**I would like to trade a Full Moon Card for an item.\n\t**I would like to trade a New Moon Card for an item.\n\t**I have come to trade a Lucky Pouch for an item.\n\t**I would like to exchange the blood stones I have gathered.\n\t**No, I was only passing through.'),(4702,'Rebecca','Very well. But you know full well I cannot give you long to talk.','Understood, Rebecca. Ahem, so... how did you come to meet the master?\n\t**Understood. Until next time...'),(4703,'Rebecca','Ho ho ho ho... all you wanted to know was how I came to meet Lady Bathory? A strange question, but if you want to know I had better answer. I first saw the master some forty years ago. I was newly born a vampire and adrift, and she took me in and taught me a great deal.','In that case, do you know anything about the Blood Bible?\n\t**So you have the master\'s favour. Did she teach you magic herself?\n\t**Yes, understood. I have talked too much. I will be on my way.'),(4704,'Rebecca','The Blood Bible is what we call "the scripture". With it alone this world could be ours. But beyond that even I do not know much.','I had best be on my way. Farewell, then...'),(4705,'Rebecca','She taught me, of course. Wanting nothing but for me to grow strong. If I regret one thing, it is that I have not yet been taught Lord Vrykolakas\' magic. He is the one who taught the master her magic, the strongest of vampires, and I count the days until he passes his magic on to me.','I was taught magic by him directly, so it is rather surprising that you have not been, Rebecca.\n\t**Forgive me for taking up so much of your time. I will be on my way.'),(4707,'Rebecca','Yes, sadly I have not been taught his magic. I want to learn his powerful black magic just as you did. And even if he will not teach me, I mean to be taught it one way or another.','Naturally. I have taken up much of your time, so I will be on my way...'),(4708,'Rebecca','A vampire of ill repute... has come at last. Make a small donation and I will adjust your alignment. Note that the effect varies with the amount.','Here are 10,000 geld as a donation.\n\t**Here are 50,000 geld as a donation.\n\t**Here are 100,000 geld as a donation.\n\t**Here are 500,000 geld as a donation.\n\t**Here are 1,000,000 geld as a donation.\n\t**My purse will not stretch to that. I will gather some money and come back.'),(4710,'Rebecca','Why has the master\'s mood turned... could I have done something wrong...',''),(4711,'Rebecca','What is that sound carrying all the way here from inside the lair? Is Lady Bathory all right?',''),(4712,'Rebecca','They say the Ousters\' barrier was raised by that witch Carissas.',''),(4713,'Rebecca','I hear that Vlad has been showing suspicious signs lately...',''),(4714,'Rebecca','Should anyone threaten the master\'s person, I will drain them of blood myself.',''),(4715,'Rebecca','If it were not for that thoroughly tiresome barrier, we could have held a grand feast on the Ousters\' blood long ago.',''),(4716,'Rebecca','How much longer must I stay in a place like this?',''),(4717,'Rebecca','Nobody who falls out of the master\'s favour ends up wanting anything but death.',''),(4718,'Rebecca','Every creature fawning at Vlad\'s feet can expect to be stirred into Lady Bathory\'s bath.',''),(4719,'Rebecca','The weapons and beads are rather late, are they not? I tried to be quick, but they were hard to come by.',''),(4720,'Rebecca','Well... I doubt you would understand even if I told you. There is a strong chance that the "Ousters", the half-vampires handed down in legend, are more than an invented tale. And they are said to bear us a grudge. We have an investigation into them under way, so you had best work hard at it.','Yes, so that is how it is.'),(4721,'Rebecca','Legend says the Ousters were victims of vampire bites. Before they could turn into vampires they sought the help of Carissas, a famous shaman of the time, and tried to become human. But they are half-vampires and nothing more. They live forever, cannot drink blood, and are said to be unaffected by the sun. What remains a mystery is why so many of them appeared all at once.','Thank you. That was a fascinating account.'),(4722,'Rebecca','I have no more information. Go and find Larva, in the south-east of Limbo Castle. A thoroughly filthy creature... why Lady Bathory entrusted work to the likes of him...','Yes, understood.'),(4723,'Rebecca','It is fortunate that you are interested in the Ousters. But I have some doubt as to whether you can carry this out properly. Perhaps we had better put you through a light test.','Of course. Just tell me what it is.\n**I will come back once I have replenished my magic.'),(4724,'Rebecca','Now I can trust you. According to the report from the comrades who began the investigation, there is a resident who found something that did not appear to be a vampire yet was too strange to be called human. They only learned that a witness exists; they have made no direct contact. You are to find that witness and bring back what they know. Can you carry out this task?','Of course. Leave it to me.\n**I will come back once I have replenished my magic.'),(4725,'Rebecca','Go and find Larva. He is in the south-east of Limbo Castle. Be careful. You must never let his words beguile you.','Yes, I will be careful.'),(4726,'Rebecca','I have no further tasks for you. Did Larva not give you one?','Excuse me. There seems to have been a mistake.'),(4727,'Rebecca','What became of the work you were doing? Why not finish that first?','I see. Understood.'),(4728,'Rebecca','So you have completed the task. Then why not take the reward first?','So it is. I had not thought of that.'),(4729,'Rebecca','Splendid. Lady Bathory will be reassured. But taking the test does not oblige you to carry out the task. Sitting the test alone earns you a full reward from Lady Bathory. Taking on the formal task is entirely your choice. So, will you take the reward, or obey Lady Bathory\'s command and carry out the formal task?','I would like to carry on with the task.\n**The formal task feels too much for me. I would like the reward.'),(4730,'Rebecca','The information you brought was very useful. So you can carry out the next task as well, I take it. As before, you are not obliged to. Completing this task alone will please Lady Bathory and earn you a reward. The next task will be more dangerous and more difficult. Obeying this command is entirely your choice. So, will you take the reward, or carry out the next task? I should like to see your loyalty.','Anything Lady Bathory commands is welcome.\n**Frankly, this task was almost too much for me as well. I would like the reward.'),(4731,'Rebecca','From the sound of it, this was not a task I gave you.','Is that so? Excuse me.'),(4732,'Rebecca','A reward? Should you not be going to find Larva?','Yes, there seems to have been a mistake.'),(4733,'Rebecca','Lady Bathory greatly dislikes lies. Wait until you have completed the task before you ask for a reward.','I, I am sorry.'),(4734,'Rebecca','Hm... to fall over at nothing more than this... I begin to doubt your loyalty. Do you really mean to give up?','I am sorry to disappoint you, but this task is too much for me.\n**No. Give me one more chance to show my loyalty.'),(4735,'Rebecca','Did I assign you a task?','Ah, there seems to have been some mistake.'),(4736,'Rebecca','What? You have already completed the task splendidly, so why speak of giving up? Go and take your reward.','Ah, that came out wrong.'),(4740,'Rebecca','It is fortunate that you have the will to break the Ousters\' barrier. But I have some doubt as to whether you can carry this out properly. Perhaps we had better put you through a light test of your wits.','Of course. Just tell me what it is.\n\t**Give me time to think it over.'),(4741,'Rebecca','I will give you only the essentials. We urgently need a pendulum that can sense magical force. But to use it we must have a dowsing rod made of a particular mineral. Can you find ten pieces of this mineral?','Of course. Leave it to me.\n\t**I will come back once I have replenished my magic.'),(4742,'Rebecca','Thanks to all of you we have mineral fragments enough. But refining them requires a substance called refinium. It is said to be obtainable only from a certain mine to the north-east of Limbo Castle. The place is guarded against intruders by invisible walls and traps, so please take particular care. Well?','Of course. Leave it to me.\n\t**I will come back once I have replenished my magic.'),(4743,'Rebecca','Our survey with the pendulum and the dowsing rod has located the clay figure that will reveal where the grimoire holding the key to breaking the Ousters\' barrier lies. The clay figure is said to be broken into pieces scattered across the regions of Eslania. Can you gather every fragment and put it back together?','Of course. Leave it to me.\n\t**I will come back once I have replenished my magic.'),(4744,'Rebecca','Fortunately we succeeded in finding the grimoire. But to read it we must find five kinds of magic stone and complete a code table. To complete the table correctly you must combine the spells inscribed on the stones, fitting them in so as to avoid the spells of the stones adjacent above, below, left and right. Study the table and I think it will be plain enough. Please give everything you have, to the very end, for Lady Bathory. Well? If you are willing, take the code table.','Of course. Leave it to me.\n\t**I will come back once I have replenished my magic.'),(4745,'Rebecca','What became of the work you were doing? Why not finish that first?','I see. Understood.'),(4746,'Rebecca','So you have completed the task. Then why not take the reward first?','So it is. I had not thought of that.'),(4747,'Rebecca','Splendid. Lady Bathory will be reassured. But taking the test does not oblige you to carry out the task. Sitting the test alone earns you a full reward from Lady Bathory. Taking on the formal task is entirely your choice. So, will you take the reward, or obey Lady Bathory\'s command and carry out the formal task?','I would like to carry on with the task.\n\t**The formal task feels too much for me. I would like the reward.'),(4748,'Rebecca','Oh... is this the mineral fragment? Well done indeed. So you can carry out the next task as well, I take it. As before, you are not obliged to. Completing this task alone will please Lady Bathory and earn you a reward. The next task will be more dangerous and more difficult. Obeying this command is entirely your choice. So, will you take the reward, or carry out the next task? I should like to see your loyalty.','Anything Lady Bathory commands is welcome.\n\t**Frankly, this task was almost too much for me as well. I would like the reward.'),(4749,'Rebecca','Remarkable. Astonishing. Well done indeed. So you can carry out the next task as well, I take it. As before, you are not obliged to. Completing this task alone will please Lady Bathory and earn you a reward. The next task will be more dangerous and more difficult. Obeying this command is entirely your choice. So, will you take the reward, or carry out the next task? I should like to see your loyalty.','Assign me any task at all.\n\t**Frankly, this task was almost too much for me as well. I would like the reward.'),(4750,'Rebecca','Remarkable. Astonishing. Well done indeed. So you can carry out the next task as well, I take it. As before, you are not obliged to. Completing this task alone will please Lady Bathory and earn you a reward. The next task will be more dangerous and more difficult. Obeying this command is entirely your choice. So, will you take the reward, or carry out the next task? I should like to see your loyalty.','Assign me any task at all.\n\t**Frankly, this task was almost too much for me as well. I would like the reward.'),(4751,'Rebecca','You have completed the code table already? Astonishing. I promise the reward for what you have achieved for our kind will be nothing short of generous. With this we have everything we need to break the Ousters\' barrier and go in. I will arrange for you to have an audience with Lady Bathory herself.','I am honoured.'),(4752,'Rebecca','Lady Bathory greatly dislikes lies. Wait until you have completed the task before you ask for a reward.','I, I am sorry.'),(4753,'Rebecca','What is this? Do you mean to abandon the next task?','I want to forget the whole business of tasks. I would like the reward for the previous quest.\n\t**No. I was only saying it.'),(4754,'Rebecca','Hm... to fall over at nothing more than this... I begin to doubt your loyalty. Do you really mean to give up?','It is not for want of loyalty. I will prepare further and carry it out later.\n\t**No. Give me one more chance to show my loyalty.'),(4755,'Rebecca','Hm... to fall over at nothing more than this... I begin to doubt your loyalty. Do you really mean to give up?','It is not for want of loyalty. I will prepare further and carry it out later.\n\t**I want to forget all this talk of loyalty. I would like the reward for the previous quest.\n\t**No. Give me one more chance to show my loyalty.'),(4756,'Rebecca','I am greatly disappointed. If you would rather not disappoint me, why not think it over once more?','I believe I did all I could. I would rather just take the reward.\n\t**I will think it over once more.'),(4757,'Rebecca','Did I assign you a task?','Ah, there seems to have been some mistake.'),(4758,'Rebecca','What? You have already completed the task splendidly, so why speak of giving up? Go and take your reward.','Ah, that came out wrong.'),(4760,'Rebecca','Can you find 8 %(Target) at %(QuestZone)?','Understood.'),(4761,'Rebecca','Gather every fragment of the clay figure at %(QuestZone) and put it back together.','Understood.'),(4800,'Barun','To trespass here so carelessly... declare yourself!',''),(4801,'Barun','Come one step closer and bear in mind that your head may leave your shoulders!',''),(4802,'Barun','The master has no time for worthless creatures like you! Get out!',''),(4803,'Barun','If your footsteps have disturbed the master, I will send you to your death this instant!',''),(4804,'Barun','Set foot here once more and your life will not be left whole!',''),(4900,'Hunt','How did you get in? This is no place for the likes of you to wander into!',''),(4901,'Hunt','Where do you think you are, you lowly wretch, to come barging in! Get out!',''),(4902,'Hunt','This is where the master rests. Get out of here!',''),(4903,'Hunt','If you want to feel your bones crushed, keep running your mouth!',''),(4904,'Hunt','Silence! You will anger the master!',''),(4905,'Hunt','Who goes there?',''),(5000,'Dennis','To walk into a place as rough as this of your own accord... do you want to rot here in the prime of your life? If it were me I would turn back this instant! So... what brings you to me?','I am injured. Treat me, please.\r\n**I want to return to the field headquarters.\r\n**I want to buy treatment ampoules and ammunition.\r\n**I want to sell the monster heads I am carrying. Will you give me a good price?\r\n**Could you repair this item?\r\n**It seems I have no business here after all.'),(5001,'Dennis','Have you no regard for your own life? At your age I would not set foot in a place like this.',''),(5002,'Dennis','I have not been working here long. This place taught me to value life all over again.',''),(5003,'Dennis','I have never been outside the temporary headquarters. That there are terrible things down in that forest... I have only heard from the people who come in for treatment.',''),(5004,'Dennis','My real job is researcher at a certain pharmaceutical company. I never dreamed I would be posted somewhere like this.',''),(5005,'Dennis','I went to Eslanian City briefly once. A truly beautiful place. No one who saw it would ever take it for a devil\'s den.',''),(5100,'Yamamoto','What brings you here? If there is anything I can do, tell me. If it is within my power... I will gladly help.','I was attacked by a vampire in combat. Treat this wound, please.\r\n**I want to return to the field headquarters.\r\n**I want to buy treatment ampoules or ammunition.\r\n**Will you buy the monster heads I have collected?\r\n**I would like to repair this item...\r\n**I must hurry back and help with the fighting. Farewell.\r\n'),(5101,'Yamamoto','I never dreamed such a place existed. I hear there are a great many vampires inside Eslanian City itself.',''),(5102,'Yamamoto','They say the vampires are gathering in Eslania and their numbers are steadily growing.',''),(5103,'Yamamoto','The ruined house down there is crawling with vampires, and most people avoid going near it. Take care when you pass by.',''),(5104,'Yamamoto','I hear a vampire master has taken control of several areas. The people there moved to shelters in advance, which kept the vampire numbers down... small mercy, at least.',''),(5201,'Mark','This is the temporary headquarters.',''),(5202,'Mark','It will help you to take a short briefing from Commander Kaiser before you go into combat.',''),(5203,'Mark','Bear in mind that what you face is not human.',''),(5204,'Mark','Vampires burn in the blazing daylight, so they are mostly active at night.',''),(5205,'Mark','Do not be shocked by this much. You are going to see far worse.',''),(5301,'John','The press is sealed off completely, so outsiders will know nothing of what happens here.',''),(5302,'John','E.V.E. is a kind of special forces unit, formed by the special forces of many nations joining together to fight the vampires.',''),(5303,'John','I volunteered to come here myself... but I had no idea it would be like this.',''),(5304,'John','At first, while I was settling in, the desperate screaming every night... I could not sleep for it.',''),(5305,'John','Do what you can to keep those creatures from ruling this world.',''),(5401,'Lisa','This place, you know, is rougher than my time in the desert. I almost miss life out there.',''),(5402,'Lisa','You have to look after yourself at all times. There is no time here to worry about anything but yourself.',''),(5403,'Lisa','Fret over things like that... and it is you who ends up in the next world.',''),(5404,'Lisa','Which is why... a lot of our people... die out there.',''),(5405,'Lisa','You be careful too! Do not underestimate those things... don\'t!',''),(5501,'Kiki','Nancy and I... we are twin sisters. Do we... really look alike?',''),(5502,'Kiki','Nancy came here first. From what she told me... it sounded like another world... so I volunteered.',''),(5503,'Kiki','It really did... take some getting used to at first... how was it for you?',''),(5504,'Kiki','Of the twenty in my intake, about five of us are left. Counting me.',''),(5505,'Kiki','The woods out towards the city limits are vampire territory. Take special care when you pass through!',''),(5600,'Terry','I am Terry, in charge of boots, gloves and shields. If you fight with a blade, a shield is essential. You can buy basic items from Nancy and Paul beside me too, so do look around. Will you buy something?','Yes, show me.\r\n**Would you buy what I am carrying?\r\n**No, thank you. I will buy another time.'),(5601,'Terry','Go to Tanya and search the weapon information. It will help you handle your weapon.',''),(5602,'Terry','When I came here I had my gun and rounds modified. They are a little different, after all, from what you use on people.',''),(5603,'Terry','Oh, and where weapons are concerned... go and see Mister Jacques. I learned a great deal from him myself.',''),(5604,'Terry','Silver weapons can do a vampire mortal harm. I had my rounds silver-plated too.',''),(5605,'Terry','I miss my family so much. I worry whether they are... all right...',''),(5700,'Nancy','I am Nancy, in charge of Slayer clothing. Before any battle you must have the basic gear; rush out to fight without it and you will end up a corpse. Oh, I have some fine things here... Would you like to take a look?','Yes, show me.\r\n**Would you buy what I am carrying?\r\n**No, thank you. I will buy another time.'),(5701,'Nancy','We handled some extraordinary things where I came from... but next to this place... it was nothing.',''),(5702,'Nancy','Defusing explosives brings me out in a cold sweat. Not knowing when it will go off... it keeps you on edge.',''),(5703,'Nancy','Have you drawn your weapon from Mister Jacques? If not, go quickly. He may run out.',''),(5704,'Nancy','There are a great many vampires down in that forest. They lie in wait... for people to come.',''),(5705,'Nancy','One may be creeping up behind you right now, going for your throat. Be careful!',''),(5801,'Fabian','The situation is worse than I had heard. We have to stop it before it turns to the worst.',''),(5802,'Fabian','Bear in mind that if we do not stop them soon, things could grow far more serious. And when that day comes, nobody will have any way to stop it...',''),(5803,'Fabian','They will always be going for your throat. Be careful.',''),(5804,'Fabian','They are sensitive to the smell of blood. If you are hurt, go to a hospital nearby and get treatment. I do not want to lose you too.',''),(5805,'Fabian','Night fighting is harder on us. The other slayers avoid the evening hours wherever they can.',''),(5901,'Jeff','I was beaten down by some bad people and left lying there, and Mark helped me. I came here hoping my skills might be of some small help to him in return.',''),(5902,'Jeff','This really is a rough place. I can see why nobody lives here.',''),(5903,'Jeff','You will get used to it too... after a while here... I was just like you at first... ha ha.',''),(5904,'Jeff','Here, you see... all manner of things happen. It is another world, and even I am startled now and then.',''),(5905,'Jeff','They say the vampires in that forest are comparatively easy to handle... next to the ones elsewhere.',''),(6001,'Ed','I served in an underwater special forces unit. Some of our people have been posted here.',''),(6002,'Ed','Only bear in mind that what you see now is not all of it. Nobody knows when or how the situation will develop.',''),(6003,'Ed','You will have heard about the present situation... what matters is understanding your task and acting on it.',''),(6004,'Ed','If you have not been issued a weapon... go and see Mister Jacques. He handles the weapons.',''),(6005,'Ed','I was taught that killing is not to be desired, but the war here is not only about killing... protecting ourselves comes first, I think.',''),(6101,'Branda','Do you know why vampires grow stronger only at night? From what I have researched, they are greatly affected by moonlight. So... on the evening of a full moon they are stronger than usual.',''),(6102,'Branda','Western legend has it that one of the things vampires cannot abide is garlic. And apparently such stories are not without foundation.',''),(6103,'Branda','In films and books, works are often modelled on Vlad Tepes, the impaler prince of Romania.',''),(6104,'Branda','I always thought of it as a story remote from reality, but seeing it for myself... there is far more cruelty to it, and far more hidden away. It makes me want to research it further.',''),(6105,'Branda','Tools and weapons made of silver will help you when you face a vampire.',''),(6201,'Yoko','Did you know vampires are quick? Their movements are genuinely fast. They close the distance in an instant and bite through your throat.',''),(6202,'Yoko','Right now the vampires in that forest are watching this way, eyes glinting.',''),(6203,'Yoko','Keep your wits about you and stay alert.',''),(6204,'Yoko','When I first came here the howling of wolves woke me many a night... I am well used to it now.',''),(6205,'Yoko','Be careful, always! There is no telling where they are waiting...',''),(6301,'Ralph','Living here will be quite hard on you too. From the look of you... you were raised in comfort...',''),(6302,'Ralph','Spend two weeks here and you will understand what sort of place your own judgement has brought you to.',''),(6303,'Ralph','If you want to improve, you must shoot a great deal... strike a great deal... and cut a great deal.',''),(6304,'Ralph','Cut off a great many vampire heads and bring them back. Do that and you will see your ability growing.',''),(6305,'Ralph','The sniping I mostly use means aiming for the vampire\'s head or chest and putting a single silver round into it.',''),(6401,'Jonathan','I came here at the Lord\'s bidding. Take up the Lord\'s will yourself and cut down that wicked host.',''),(6402,'Jonathan','I will pray for you always. The Lord\'s angels will watch over you.',''),(6403,'Jonathan','Lord, who watches over us always... keep us all safe through this day too.',''),(6404,'Jonathan','The Lord is with you. Do not worry, go out and fight.',''),(6405,'Jonathan','By the power of the Father, the Son and the Holy Spirit, amen...',''),(6500,'Paul','I am Paul, in charge of accessories. You can buy clothing from Nancy and boots and gloves from Terry. Will you buy an accessory?','Yes, show me.\r\n**Would you buy what I am carrying?\r\n**No, thank you. I will buy another time.'),(6501,'Paul','A soldier does not fight for himself. He must fight bravely in battle for everyone!',''),(6502,'Paul','Once you come here, cast off the self! From this moment on there is no "I".',''),(6503,'Paul','Go forward, no matter what, and fight! We will cover you from behind, so do not worry!',''),(6504,'Paul','Have your weapons silver-plated, all of you! You will see rather better results.',''),(6505,'Paul','To face those creatures, aim for the head and the chest!',''),(6601,'Ken','You will have heard roughly how things stand here? Absurd, is it not? That what we took for something out of a film should be real?',''),(6602,'Ken','Coming here taught me a great deal. Above all it made me realise again how precious life is.',''),(6603,'Ken','Because of them, a great many people have died. It broke my heart.',''),(6604,'Ken','I could not feel the grief of those who had lost the ones they loved... but I could feel their pain.',''),(6605,'Ken','You be careful too! So that nobody who loves you has to grieve over you.',''),(6701,'Carol','The Lord will protect you always. Go forth and fight bravely!',''),(6702,'Carol','Do not forget to pray before you go into battle. God will give you the strength to win.',''),(6703,'Carol','Thank you, God. For letting this day pass quietly too...',''),(6704,'Carol','Let us sing his praise gladly. So that the vampires lose heart at the sound of it and flee far away...',''),(6705,'Carol','Lord, who loves us, grant them the strength of angels and the wisdom of King Solomon.',''),(6801,'Natalie','Welcome. This is the temporary headquarters, in the northern district outside Eslania City.',''),(6802,'Natalie','Keep your wits about you and listen carefully. I do not say things twice.',''),(6803,'Natalie','First go to Commander Kaiser for a short briefing. It will help you before you go into combat.',''),(6804,'Natalie','Go to Miss Tanya, get some basic information on the weapon you intend to use, and choose carefully.',''),(6805,'Natalie','After that, go to Mister Jacques and draw your weapon, and the issue is complete.',''),(6901,'Tristan','This is dead ground already. The only way to bring it back is to sweep those vampires out.',''),(6902,'Tristan','To bring this place back to life... you must fight hard.',''),(6903,'Tristan','Take out the master... and those creatures become a rabble. You must destroy the master!',''),(6904,'Tristan','Command still has not established what those creatures want. We need to find out quickly...',''),(6905,'Tristan','Do you know your task well? If not, get the full briefing from Commander Kaiser at the field headquarters before you set out.',''),(7001,'Ellen','I came here because of a project on the vampires. But... it is not an easy place to settle into.',''),(7002,'Ellen','I have not been here long and I already miss people. I miss a big city bustling with crowds.',''),(7003,'Ellen','Follow that river down and you will come to Eslanian village. There is a temporary base there.',''),(7004,'Ellen','Do not go into the dark parts of that forest. It is dangerous.',''),(7005,'Ellen','If you are hurt... go and see Mister Yamamoto. He will patch you up painlessly.',''),(7101,'Patricia','The sounds you hear here every night are truly harrowing. Hear it once and it never leaves your ears.',''),(7102,'Patricia','Someone crying for help... crying out right over there... and I am too afraid to go to them. I often feel pathetic for it.',''),(7103,'Patricia','I may not be able to do much, but I will help to the end, so that you can be treated safely here.',''),(7104,'Patricia','Without the nerve to put fear aside, you would not survive a single day in this place.',''),(7105,'Patricia','Pray every day and lean on it when things are hard. The Lord will not forsake you; he will watch over you.',''),(7201,'Caim','Welcome. Who is it they hold greatest over on Bathory\'s side? Vrykolakas? There is little to learn from one who cannot reach my ankles. I will teach you what no book can. But... you are confident, I trust?','I came because there is something I would like to ask you.\n\t\t **Teach me the great magic you know.\n\t\t **I would like to see the weapons and beads.\n\t\t **I would like information about the master lairs.\n\t\t **Set resurrection point\n\t\t **I want to go to the Perona highway.\n\t\t **I want to go to the free duel zone.\n\t\t **I would like to receive the test server gift.\n\t\t **I will come again once I have practised more. Take me as your disciple then.'),(7202,'Caim','You are still short of blood. Go and drink more. A great deal more... heh heh heh.','Understood. Farewell, then.'),(7203,'Caim','Something you want to know? Well then, let us hear this curiosity of yours.','I hear you were a rabbi. What does the word rabbi refer to?\n**I would like to hear about the battle with Bathory.\n**Why did you become a vampire, and how did you meet Lord Vlad?\n**Ah! I hope I have not disturbed your valuable time. I will be on my way.'),(7204,'Caim','Rabbi is Hebrew for "my teacher", and is also rendered rabboni. Anyone who would be a rabbi must study the Old Testament and the Talmud deeply. A rabbi generally presides over Jewish religious observances and rites and takes a broad part in education. He is also involved in relief and service work for the community and supports various communal undertakings. I too, in the past, taught the word of God to others and served as his servant. Hmm... do you understand the rabbi well enough now?','I would like to know what the battle with Bathory was like.\n**Yes... but... why did you become a vampire, and how did you meet Lord Vlad?\n**Caim... I have taken up a great deal of your valuable time. Farewell, then.'),(7205,'Caim','The battle with Bathory... it was grim indeed. On our side, because of that one cunning woman, we lost many fine soldiers. What helped was that a few on Bathory\'s side, the sort who deserve the axe, came crawling over to us and sold us information. We found a short cut and got into the lair quickly. What I regret is this: we should have finished Bathory then. Because she is still alive... and still troubling Lord Vlad. If we had been a little quicker we could have ended it... a shame.','I hear you were a rabbi. What does the word rabbi refer to?\n**Why did you become a vampire, and how did you meet Lord Vlad?\n**Caim... I will be on my way. There are more of Bathory\'s lot to destroy. Keep up the good work.\n'),(7206,'Caim','From childhood I studied scripture hard to become a rabbi, memorising over and over what my teacher taught me. Then one day the phrase "atonement by blood" struck me strangely. That would have been at about fifteen. All I knew then was that we are atoned for by the grace of the Almighty. But once I fixed on that word, blood... there was no conclusion to be had. So from then on I wandered from place to place, researching what true redemption through atonement was. One day I met Lord Vlad, and as we spoke of blood... every word of his went straight to my heart. When he had finished... he vanished before my eyes. I searched for him for ten years. I came before him, knelt, and begged him to take me as his disciple. He alone was my salvation...','I see. But... what does the word rabbi refer to?\n**I would like to know what the battle with Bathory was like.\n**I will be on my way. Thank you for telling me.\n'),(7207,'Caim','Today too... put your strength to work for the great Lord Vlad... heh heh.','Understood. Keep up the good work.'),(7211,'Caim','If we had moved a little sooner... we could have finished Bathory off.',''),(7212,'Caim','Be careful of Aiman. There is no telling when he may strike from behind.',''),(7213,'Caim','For the great Lord Vlad... today too we must turn a great many humans into our kind.',''),(7214,'Caim','Is red blood not beautiful? Everything can be made pure by blood.',''),(7215,'Caim','Bathory\'s lot must be destroyed. Their line must be wiped out!',''),(7216,'Caim','However strong you think you are now, using weapons and beads will let you bring far greater power to bear.',''),(7220,'Caim','The free duel zone has "Oltenia", for duels within your own kind, and "Banatul", where you can duel freely regardless of kind. Take your pick.','I want to go to Oltenia.\r\n**I want to go to Banatul.\r\n**I will think it over and decide.'),(7301,'Priya','Eternal, immortal beings. Come here. Under Lord Vlad\'s grace... you will never know misery again, and you will live a life of splendour. The goods I carry were given to me by Lord Vlad himself. They are of the very highest quality. Now, will you take a look?','Priya... there is something I would like to ask you. Will you hear me out?\n\t\t **Is that so? Then... let us have a look.\n\t\t **The goods I carry... I gathered them on my travels to many places. Please take a look at mine as well.\n\t\t **I have come about couple registration.\n\t\t **Hmm... I have no... business here after all. Well then... good day to you.'),(7302,'Priya','Something you want to ask me? Ho ho. What is it you wish to know? Shall I look into my crystal ball and see what you are about to ask? Let us see... the ball says... you have a great many questions for me. Ho ho.','Priya. You must have travelled to many places... I wonder which of them was the most beautiful.\r\n**How did you become a vampire, and how did you meet Lord Vlad?\r\n**Could you show me my future?\r\n**Forgive me. I should be going. Keep up the good work.'),(7303,'Priya','Beautiful places... the quiet places in the country are far more beautiful than the cities. Crossing a country field I would always stop the carriage and take in the view. Ho ho. A carriage road in spring is truly... so splendid that it seems a shame to simply pass through. Ho ho. Well... there are so many beautiful places that it is hard to pick just one.','How did you become a vampire, and how did you meet Lord Vlad?\r\n**Could you show me my future?\r\n**Forgive me. I should be going. Keep up the good work.'),(7304,'Priya','I met Lord Vlad when I was wandering as a gypsy. One night I was driving the carriage past a country riverbank. He stood there in the darkness, in a thick-lying mist. How he shone... thinking of it still stirs me. He was a man who shone even in such darkness. That is how much I wanted to live as his servant. So I climbed down from the carriage at once, ran to him, and begged him to take me as his servant. From that day on I have been at his side.','Priya. How did you become a vampire?\r\n**Could you show me my future?\r\n**Forgive me. I should be going. Keep up the good work.'),(7305,'Priya','Let us see... I do not know whether the ball will read your future. It is particular about people. There, my dear. Will you show me this one\'s future? Ho ho. Hmm... from what has appeared in the ball... your future is not clear, but there seems to be a somewhat bright one worth hoping for. Hm... but do not forget this one thing. That your future rests with you. Ho ho ho.','Priya. How did you become a vampire?\r\n**How did you meet Lord Vlad?\r\n**Thank you for telling me. I should be going. Keep up the good work.'),(7306,'Priya','Yes... may today too be spent... with fresh blood...','Goodbye.'),(7311,'Priya','The ball never lies. Which is why it is an old friend of mine.',''),(7312,'Priya','However high and fast one may fly... I can see it all as plainly as if it lay in the palm of my hand.',''),(7313,'Priya','Our sovereign will be eternal. Even should Bathory recover her strength.',''),(7314,'Priya','We who have been granted eternal life must never forget that we owe Lord Vlad an equal measure of loyalty.',''),(7315,'Priya','A new road linking the holy grounds is showing in my ball. It is not far from here.',''),(7316,'Priya','Some think these accessories expensive, but every one of them is worth what it costs. Trust me.',''),(7317,'Priya','What I sell will help you turn your abilities into effective tactics.',''),(7318,'Priya','Do not travel far for Blue Drops. Come to me.',''),(7319,'Priya','Being true to one another is the most important thing there is between lovers.',''),(7320,'Priya','And if a wrong choice should part you, do not lose heart. Anyone can make a mistake.',''),(7350,'Priya','Love takes up a great part of a life. To find someone you can trust and share it with is a great blessing. Sometimes a wrong choice leaves you both wounded and you part. For your own sake, and for the one you love, choose carefully. ','I have found someone I love. I would like to register as a couple.\n\t\t**I accept the couple registration.\n\t\t**There is no meaning left in our relationship. I want to break it off.\n\t\t**I agree to the separation.\n\t\t**I have forgotten my partner\'s name. Would you tell me?\n\t\t**I would like to ask you something else.'),(7351,'Priya','If you wish to part, there are two ways. A separation by mutual agreement, and a one-sided separation without it. Bear in mind that if you choose the one-sided separation, your alignment will drop.','I will separate by mutual agreement.\n\t\t**I will separate one-sidedly, without agreement.'),(7401,'Agnes','What do you need? You have only to say. If nothing I have is what you want, I will get it for you.','Agnes... there is something I would like to ask you.\n\t\t **Might I see the coats you have?\n\t\t **I was thinking of selling some of the things I am carrying...\n\t\t **Excuse me. I had better be going.'),(7402,'Agnes','Something you want to ask me? If it is personal, I would rather not...','Agnes... I would like to know about your time as a human. Tell me about it.\r\n**You do not look like someone who belongs in a place like this... how did you come to be here?\r\n**I hear you once learned magic from Caim. What magic did you learn?\r\n**Ah, dear me. My body is signalling that I am short of blood. I must go and drink something fresh.'),(7403,'Agnes','I would rather not tell my personal story to someone I have only just met. It is not a happy one, either. But if you want to know... do you know what poverty is? Those who live in it, who have nothing... their lives are one long suffering. Mine was such a life. Still more so for the eldest of eight children, who must support the family. So at fifteen I left home for the back streets. It was agony, but I was trying to feed a family at that age... and yet it was nowhere near enough for even one meal each. Every time one of my younger brothers and sisters died... I wanted to deny it. To say they had not died... oh... forgive me. Showing you all this when we have only just met...','Do not grieve, Agnes. Your family will be in a good place. But... how did you come to be here?\r\n**I hear you once learned magic from Caim. What magic did you learn?\r\n**Ah, dear me. My body is signalling that I am short of blood. I must go and drink something fresh.'),(7404,'Agnes','I would rather not speak of it... but somehow you feel familiar to me. I came here following Lord Vlad. My family had all gone, and when even my last remaining brother died, I lost my mind. He was the last of my family... I truly could not believe such a thing had happened to me. So I went mad... and lay there half-senseless, and the one who took me in was Lord Vlad. So I was promised eternity by my saviour, and placed my life in his hands.','So that is your story. And when you were human... how did you live?\r\n**I hear you once learned magic from Caim. What magic did you learn?\r\n**My whole body is signalling for fresh blood. Ha ha. Farewell, then.'),(7405,'Agnes','I learned the black magic that draws out an opponent\'s soul. At first... it truly frightened me. I had never dreamed magic could hold such power. I do not use it often... but I use it when someone comes at me with ill intent. For this I am genuinely grateful to Lord Caim. Without him I could not have survived in a place as harsh as this. If you learn magic from Lord Caim, he will have a great deal of good counsel for you. He influenced me greatly too.','Agnes... I would like to know about your time as a human. Tell me about it.\r\n**You do not look like someone who belongs in a place like this... how did you come to be here?\r\n**Ah, I seem to have taken up your precious time. Thank you for telling me.'),(7406,'Agnes','For eternal life... keep up the good work today too.','I will be going. Until next time...'),(7411,'Agnes','If nothing here is what you want, tell me. I will get it for you soon.',''),(7412,'Agnes','To learn magic... go and see Lord Caim. You can learn powerful magic from him.',''),(7413,'Agnes','I owe Lord Vlad a great debt. For him I would give my life.',''),(7414,'Agnes','Beautiful garments bring you all the more joy. I have better things here than you will find elsewhere.',''),(7415,'Agnes','However strong you think you are now, using weapons and beads will let you bring far greater power to bear.',''),(7416,'Agnes','If you want a special accessory, go and see Priya. She will have what you are after.',''),(7501,'Aiman','Today too... how many humans have you brought to their knees at Lord Vlad\'s feet? Before Lord Vlad sees them... I will inspect your harvest first. If the number is not enough... you will die by my hand!','Lord Aiman. I have come because there is something I would like to ask you. Forgive me if I am intruding, but would you satisfy my curiosity?\n\t\t**I would like to buy some blood essence and seals.\n\t\t**I have come about a clan.\n\t\t**Lord Aiman. Would you store my belongings for me?\n\t\t**I have come to have something repaired. Repair this, please.\n\t\t**I will go and take some humans. Well then...'),(7502,'Aiman','What is it? This thing you wish to know... what is it? Speak!','What did you do when you were human?\n\t**Lord Aiman. How did you come to be here?\n\t**Why are you and Caim on such bad terms?\n\t**Forgive me for troubling you, Lord Aiman. I will withdraw.'),(7503,'Aiman','My time as a human... it was not long ago, so the memory is vivid. You can tell from the look of me. Yes. I was a battle commander of the Al-Jihad. It would be no exaggeration to call me the author of many wars and countless deaths. And even now... heh heh... I am still killing humans. For every extra enemy I destroyed, I lost that many of my own men. Of the comrades left to me then, not one is alive today. Because with my own hands... I offered their blood to Lord Vlad. Once I had offered up those I thought of as family, my mind grew far easier. Hmm... and even now I mean to offer him the blood of more and more humans. Heh heh...','Lord Aiman. How did you come to be here?\n\t**Why are you and Caim on such bad terms?\n\t**Forgive me for troubling you, Lord Aiman. I will withdraw.'),(7504,'Aiman','You want to know how I came to be here? You seem to want to know all manner of things. I came here by the grace of the great Lord Vlad. Four years ago, when my army was drawn into a conflict in the Middle East, I first saw Lord Vlad in the operational zone. That day... I felt in him the calm that follows battle, and his fierce presence shook my mind and my spirit. What woke me from that daze was the sight of my own men dying in front of me. The sight of him drinking their blood struck me powerfully. So from that road onward... I followed him. And so I came here.','Lord Aiman. What did you do when you were human?\n\t**Why are you and Caim on such bad terms?\n\t**Forgive me for troubling you again.'),(7505,'Aiman','It seems everyone already knows about the bad blood between Caim and me. To my mind... it is because he and I serve the same lord. When I spoke with him I understood. That his passion for Lord Vlad is no less than mine... and that he claws desperately for Lord Vlad\'s favour. Tch! I must be rid of him quickly! If he did not use magic... he would fall in a single stroke. A pity. Tsk.','What did you do when you were human?\n\t**Lord Aiman. How did you come to be here?\n\t**Forgive me for troubling you, Lord Aiman. I will withdraw.'),(7506,'Aiman','Good. Go out today too... and destroy at least one more of Bathory\'s lot! I... will be watching you!','Yes, sir! Understood. I will be off.'),(7507,'Aiman','About a clan... what exactly is it you want?','I have come to register a clan.\n\t**I would like to view the pending clan list.\n\t**I would like to view the clan list.\n\t**I would like to leave my clan.\n\t**It seems I have no business here.'),(7508,'Aiman','Leaving your clan, you say? If you have thought it over carefully, so be it. I accept your withdrawal. But understand this. Leaving here does not mean you can go straight to another clan. You broke the oath with your own hands, so even to go elsewhere a full week of real time must pass. It will not be easy.','Understood, but I would like to leave.\n\t**In that case I will think it over again.'),(7509,'Aiman','I am afraid the gifts cannot be handed out to everyone. This one was made especially for the players who enjoyed the game on the premium service. If you are not entitled to one, my apologies, but you had best be on your way.','I am entitled to a gift.\n\t\t**Yes, understood. I will be on my way.'),(7510,'Aiman','The gift is a necklace, a bracelet or a ring, a rare accessory carrying two options. Remember that the higher your level, the better the grade and the options you will get. And the gift is handed out once only.','Yes, understood. Give me the gift.\n\t\t**I will come back another time.'),(7511,'Aiman','With Lord Vlad... always... anywhere... there is nothing to fear!',''),(7512,'Aiman','Lord Vlad is my saviour. Speak ill of him carelessly... and I will not stand for it.',''),(7513,'Aiman','For Lord Vlad, who grants us his grace... go out... drink the blood of many humans and bring them over to our side!',''),(7514,'Aiman','Caim, the thorn in my eye... one day I will deal with him.',''),(7515,'Aiman','You will need blood at the front. Be sure to stop by me and prepare before you go into a hard fight.',''),(7516,'Aiman','If you could not find the accessory you wanted from Priya, go to Limbo Castle or Perona.',''),(7601,'Tepes','Who is it that troubles my ears! Show me your face.','This lowly one... has come to pay his respects to the master.\r\n**Forgive me. I will withdraw quietly so as not to disturb the master.\r\n'),(7602,'Tepes','Who are you? To have dealt with those at the door... you seem to have some skill. Well then... will you serve under me?','I should like to face a few of those outside. Judge me then, master.\r\n**Thank you, master. I will go and bring back human heads for you.\r\n**Master, I came only at the summons of two who call themselves your faithful servants.\r\n**I am grateful for the offer. But I serve under nobody. My apologies.\r\n'),(7603,'Tepes','Good! At least the will to be my servant is commendable. I accept your heart. So! You are my servant now. Go and bring me that Bathory woman\'s head.','Understood. I will go and bring Bathory\'s head now, master.'),(7604,'Tepes','Take a great many human heads and mount them where I can see them from my table. The sight of heads full of fresh blood should bring my appetite back... heh heh heh...','Understood, master! I will be off.'),(7605,'Tepes','Those two tremble at the thought of what may become of me. Should anything go badly for me... they are the sort who would abandon me and leave. Such creatures are not to be trusted! Destroy them! That is my first order to you.','Understood. I will get rid of those who trouble the master.'),(7606,'Tepes','Oh? That is what I liked about you. Whatever I want, I take. But... if you keep this up... I shall have no choice but to kill you.','I will withdraw quietly, master. Overlook it this once.'),(7607,'Tepes','If you do not want to be hurt... you had best stop working that filthy mouth. Get out!','I will be off, master.'),(7611,'Tepes','Whoever defies my word will be drained of every drop of blood... and lose his head.',''),(7612,'Tepes','Whoever brings me Bathory\'s head shall have my reward.',''),(7613,'Tepes','I should have destroyed her then... I underestimated her badly.',''),(7614,'Tepes','Bathory is probably searching for the Blood Bible right now. We must get our hands on it first.',''),(7615,'Tepes','All who stand against me will be killed. Bathory has little time left either.',''),(7701,'Larva','Welcome. You want to become human? Have you the resolve to cast off everything you hold? The blood you have been drinking will taste rank to you, and the magic in your body will vanish entirely. Even so, will you do it?','Yes. I want to become human.\n\t**You could tell me about this thing called "advancement", I imagine?\n\t**Could you exchange an advancement item for me?\n\t**No. Hearing you speak, the thought of living a changed life frightens me.'),(7702,'Larva','Become human and from that moment you are the enemy. An enemy to our kind, and the few who know your circumstances will be your enemies too. From then on you are everyone\'s target. Hm. Think it over carefully before you decide.','Even so, I want to become human.\n\t**Hearing you speak, it seems better to stay as I am.'),(7703,'Larva','Hm... in that case there is something to note. Once you turn human, coming back to being a vampire will not be easy. Once you have returned to being human, even if a vampire drinks your blood the magic left in your body will break it down. So...','Even so, I want to return to being human.'),(7704,'Larva','Well... if that is truly your mind, there is nothing for it. I will make you human.','Thank you.'),(7705,'Larva','Hm... yes. Your thinking is probably right. Off you go.','Understood. Until next time, then.'),(7706,'Larva','Hm, so that is how it was. Your efforts have brought a great deal to light. I have long been studying the legends of the Ousters. If they were to return, it would certainly be no good thing for our kind. They are no more than a primitive people who worship nature, yet it is said they drew a fearsome power from the spirits.','So that is how it was.'),(7707,'Larva','Should you ever run into those creatures, take care upon care. The hatred they carry is nothing to what humans bear. And yet I too should like to speak with them just once. Not easily done, of course, without being prepared to stake your life to some degree. With your courage I think you could attempt it. What is amusing is that they are not so fond of humans either.','I find I want to meet them too.'),(7708,'Larva','The Ousters were creatures that could not exist without the vampires. Yet somehow they are said to have succeeded in breeding. The second-generation Ousters born that way have no sex, but they lay something like eggs, called germen. Hm... whether to call it an egg or a half-formed infant... in any case, I hear that if you lay a germen and place it beside another, it becomes an Ouster child.','An astonishing story.'),(7709,'Larva','Hm... you had better hear about them from Rebecca first. To my eye she is no more than one of Bathory\'s insignificant handmaids, but she seems to have picked up a thing or two.','I see. Understood.'),(7711,'Larva','Hm... was it so? Yes... studying the legend of the relics the Ousters left behind, it seems they lie scattered through a certain underground cavern. You need only gather the fragments of the ancient texts they left and bring them back as one. It should not be so hard. Will you try?','Of course. Just tell me exactly where.\n\t**I will need a little preparation. I will be back shortly.'),(7712,'Larva','Then make your way to %(QuestZone). The monsters romping about inside may already have taken it. Good luck to you.','Thank you.'),(7716,'Larva','I see. Yes, deciphering the ancient texts you brought us confirmed that a map exists marking the site of the village where they once lived. The Ousters did not want such a map left behind, of course. But some idiot of a human explorer seems to have completed it. He met a rather painful death, by the look of it. But the accepted account is that the map alone survived somewhere and was handed on. Can you find this map?','Something like that is hardly difficult. Rather a let-down, if anything.\n\t**I will need a little preparation. I will be back shortly.'),(7717,'Larva','It will not be quite so simple. The map is known to have passed into the keeping of a monster of great power... but they are very black in colour, so finding them should not be too hard. Recover the map from the black %(QuestMonster) near %(QuestZone).','So it was not so easy after all. No matter.'),(7721,'Larva','Yes, yes... very well. According to that map, the western pass connecting from north-west Drobeta is thought to have been the entrance to the Ousters\' village. I would like you to fly there quickly and investigate. The last secret of the Ousters is right before us. I am counting on you.','Yes, thank you.'),(7726,'Larva','Later... come later. I have urgent business just now. Ah, why not go to Rebecca first?','You mean Lady Rebecca. Understood.'),(7731,'Larva','Foolish talk. Go and finish what you were doing first.','So I do. I got ahead of myself.'),(7736,'Larva','Remarkable. Splendid. But would it not be best to settle the reward before taking on the next task?','Understood. That would be the order of things.'),(7741,'Larva','Ah, was it so? Yes, yes... to gather every fragment of the ancient text so quickly. It seems I underestimated you. So, will you take the reward for the task, or press on to the next one? Either suits me. Nothing you will come to regret either way...','My instinct whispers that I should choose the task.\n\t**I need some rest. I would like the reward.'),(7746,'Larva','Oh... oh... so this is the ancient Ouster map I have only ever heard of. Yes... so this is where they were hiding... it is a wonder it went undiscovered until now. Ah, forgive me. I was quite carried away... yes, you must have your reward. But before that there is something I would ask of you. Now that even the Ousters\' location has been found, would you not want to go on investigating them? What do you say, take the reward and end it here, or hear my request first?','It would be improper to refuse a request from you, Larva.\n\t**I have had no reward at all so far, and now a personal favour... I am afraid not. The reward, please.'),(7751,'Larva','What on earth are these meant to signify? I really cannot say.','There seems to have been a mistake. My apologies.'),(7756,'Larva','What reward would that be? A strange fellow.','What did I just say?'),(7761,'Larva','Come back once you have properly finished what you are doing.','So it is. My head is all over the place these days.'),(7771,'Larva','Ah, yes, yes... hm? What was that? Did you say you were giving up the task? Surely you are joking.','I am quite serious. It is simply too much.\n\t**Ha ha... jokes do not work on you, Larva. I was only saying it.'),(7772,'Larva','What task am I supposed to have given you?','No. Come to think of it, I was mistaken.'),(7773,'Larva','The one who completed the task so splendidly now wants to give up what, exactly? I cannot make out what you are saying.','I was only saying it.'),(7780,'Larva','I cannot tell you too much, but...\n\tapart from the masters, every vampire has a limit to their ability. They were born borrowing a human body, so it is only natural. But that limit can be pushed back a little. Everything has its trigger, and pushing past that limit needs one too. Finding it is your part. Pass the limit and you break free of the restraints that bound you, your ability rises, and stronger magic and techniques become learnable. The masters will hardly welcome it, of course... heh heh heh heh.','So that is how it works. Understood.'),(7801,'Raven','Welcome. Here you will find the finest goods, the sort the masters of every clan covet. Let us see... here is an outfit that suits you exactly. Would you care to look?','I will see the goods first.\r\n**I will sell the monster heads I have taken.\r\n**I will call by another time. Good trading to you.'),(8000,'Carmen','Welcome. What can I do for you?','I am injured. Treat me, please.\n\t**There is something I need. Show me what you have.\n\t**I would like to sell some of what I am carrying. Will you give me a good price?\n\t**I want to go to the field headquarters.\n\t**I want to go to the free duel zone.\n\t**Set evacuation point\n\t**I have come to borrow the token of the Blood Bible.\n\t**I will return the token of the Blood Bible.\n\t**I will call again another time. I have no business here just now.'),(8001,'Carmen','Be careful. This place is always dangerous.',''),(8002,'Carmen','I will pray you make it back from here alive.',''),(8003,'Carmen','Leave a wound from combat untreated and there is a strong chance of turning into a vampire, so get it seen to quickly.',''),(8004,'Carmen','I keep what you need in stock. Just tell me what it is.',''),(8005,'Carmen','A great many people are badly wounded. They must be moved and treated quickly.',''),(8006,'Carmen','Did you know? The Blue Drop has another name: "Adam\'s Tears".',''),(8007,'Carmen','There are so many people around us in need.',''),(8008,'Carmen','May those less fortunate than us receive a warmer hand...',''),(8010,'Carmen','The free duel zone has "Olt", for duels within your own kind, and "Banatul", where you can duel freely regardless of kind. Please choose.','I want to go to Olt.\n\t**I want to go to Banatul.\n\t**I will think it over and decide.'),(8020,'Carmen','There are still many around us in need who are waiting for a kind hand. We are collecting donations so that your love can reach them. Would you care to join the collection too, %(UserName)?','I would like to give as an individual.\n\t\t**I would like to give on behalf of my team.'),(8021,'Carmen','Thank you for your warm hand. The amount you have given will be posted on the homepage. The precious donation you have made today, %(UserName), will be put to good use where it is truly needed, where a kind hand is wanted.','I am making a donation.\n\t\t**I will call on you again next time.'),(8022,'Carmen','I am sorry. You are not currently in a team, %(UserName), or you are not yet a full member. If you are not in a team, please give as an individual.','I would like to give as an individual, then.\n\t\t**Yes, understood.'),(8023,'Carmen','Thank you. As a member of %(GuildName), you are donating in the name of %(GuildName), %(UserName). The amount you have given will be posted on the homepage under the team\'s name. Posted amounts are shown as a running total. The precious donations gathered in the name of %(GuildName) will be put to good use where they are truly needed, where a kind hand is wanted.','I am making a donation.\n\t\t**I will call on you again next time.'),(8100,'Robin','How did you get all the way here? If you came along that road, you have some skill. There are terrible things spread all over it. So what brings you to me?','I want to store some things. Would you give me a storage box?\n\t\t **I would like to see whether my things are all in order.\n\t\t **There is an accessory I need. Show me.\n\t\t **These wretched things are giving trouble. Could you repair them?\n\t\t **I would like to collect the motorcycle I left with you.\n\t\t **I would like to see my pet storage.\n\t\t **Ah, I have come to the wrong place. Well then...'),(8101,'Robin','Be careful. This is not somewhere easy enough to wander about with your mind elsewhere!',''),(8102,'Robin','However skilled you are, a sudden vampire attack can take you out of this world in a moment.',''),(8103,'Robin','You look heavily loaded. I will hold it for you; put your mind on the fighting.',''),(8104,'Robin','Do not forget that your life matters as much as anyone else\'s. Be careful, always!',''),(8105,'Robin','If you have something to repair, bring it over. I will put it right.',''),(8106,'Robin','The accessories sold here are special. They are things you rarely see in other shops.',''),(8200,'Murphy','Ho ho, what brings you all the way out here?','I came to see whether you have anything worth having. May I see your goods?\n\t\t **I would like to get rid of some things.\n\t\t **I want to go inside Limbo Castle.\n\t\t **I want to go inside Rasen Castle.\n\t\t **I want to go to the free duel zone.\n\t\t **Set resurrection point\n\t\t **I was passing and stopped in to say hello. Well then...'),(8201,'Murphy','Sweep the slayers away for me. The sight of them keeps making me uneasy.',''),(8202,'Murphy','If there is an accessory you need, tell me. I will get it for you.',''),(8203,'Murphy','I hear there are still a few humans left here. Turn them all into our kind.',''),(8204,'Murphy','That way we should have the advantage in numbers. Ha ha.',''),(8205,'Murphy','If you have a special power in you, the Blue Drop will make you stronger still.',''),(8206,'Murphy','What I have is as splendid and as remarkable as anything you will find. It took me a very long time to gather it.',''),(8207,'Murphy','Besides me there are others selling special items in Limbo Castle and Rasen Castle. Go and see them if you are interested.',''),(8210,'Murphy','The free duel zone has "Oltenia", for duels within your own kind, and "Banatul", where you can duel freely regardless of kind. Take your pick.','I want to go to Oltenia.\n\t**I want to go to Banatul.\n\t**I will think it over and decide.'),(8300,'Griffith','Hello. How did you get all the way here? Watch out for that dreadful road the slayers come down. There is no telling when they will wipe us all out. Hm, so what brings you?','I want to buy some serum and seals and the like.\n\t\t**I want to store something. Would you give me a storage box?\n\t\t**I want to check that the things I stored before are all right. Show me.\n\t\t**Griffith, would you repair this for me?\n\t\t**I want to see my pet storage.\n\t\t**Would you lend me the token of the Blood Bible?\n\t\t**I will return the token of the Blood Bible.\n\t\t**I was passing and stopped in to see how you were.'),(8301,'Griffith','Heavy things are a nuisance to carry around. I will look after them for you.',''),(8302,'Griffith','It is fun here, being able to take on humans without a care. Ho ho.',''),(8303,'Griffith','If you have something worth repairing, bring it over. I will make it like new.',''),(8304,'Griffith','Do use them a little more carefully. You must not bring them to me beyond repairing.',''),(8305,'Griffith','My favourite colour is red. Such a delicious-looking colour.',''),(8306,'Griffith','If the fighting looks like getting hard, be sure to get serum and transformation items from me before you go. They will help at least a little.',''),(8307,'Griffith','The things Mister Murphy has are all fine ones, the sort you rarely see in a shop. Wherever does he find them?',''),(8308,'Griffith','There are so many people around us in need.',''),(8309,'Griffith','May those less fortunate than us receive a warmer hand...',''),(8310,'Griffith','There are still many around us in need who are waiting for a kind hand. We are collecting donations so that your love can reach them. Would you care to join the collection too, %(UserName)?','I will give as an individual.\n\t\t**I will give on behalf of my clan.'),(8311,'Griffith','Thank you for your warm hand. The amount you have given will be posted on the homepage. The precious donation you have made today, %(UserName), will be put to good use where it is truly needed, where a kind hand is wanted.','I will make a donation.\n\t\t**I will see you again next time.'),(8312,'Griffith','I am sorry. You are not currently in a clan, %(UserName), or you are not yet a full member. If you are not in a clan, please give as an individual.','I will give as an individual, then.\n\t\t**I will see you again next time.'),(8313,'Griffith','Thank you. As a member of %(GuildName), you are donating in the name of %(GuildName), %(UserName). The amount you have given will be posted on the homepage under the clan\'s name. Posted amounts are shown as a running total. The precious donations gathered in the name of %(GuildName) will be put to good use where they are truly needed, where a kind hand is wanted.','I will make a donation.\n\t\t**I will see you again next time.'),(8400,'Conan','You are someone who knows a thing or two. Yes... more than a few people have died at their hands. Master-class vampires stake out their own territory and are forever at each other\'s throats given half a chance. Just as things seemed to quieten down, they say the creatures have started moving again. They use the power of jewels imbued with magic to control their own strength. Each master carries a necklace made of those jewels, and it is over these that they go so wild.','Tell me more.\n**Understood. I will be on my way.'),(8401,'Conan','The necklace, you see, is made up of a pendant and bijous. Each of the jewels holds great magical force, but the pendant is the very essence of it. The necklace is worth a fortune as jewellery alone, but it could also serve as important research material for wiping the vampires out. It may reveal the source of their power... I only wish I could see it with my own eyes while I still live.','I would like to know more about what the necklace is worth.\n**Understood. I will be on my way.'),(8407,'Conan','Ho ho. If you have such a necklace, I will trade you some very valuable items for it. The value will differ, of course, depending on whether it is the pendant or a bijou. What do you say?','I will trade my pendant for an item.\n**I will trade my bijou for an item.\n**Forgive me, but I will think it over.'),(8410,'Vrykolakas','Are you prepared to stake your life for Bathory? Then I will tell you. The masters of our kind each carry a necklace that stands as their emblem. That necklace is made up of a pendant and bijous, and the jewels that compose it hold powerful magic. With it a master can control and use their strength freely.','Tell me more.\n**Understood. I will be on my way.'),(8411,'Vrykolakas','The pendant part of this necklace in particular is the crystallised form of that magic. However powerful a master may be, lose the pendant and they can no longer control themselves and are left helpless. If you truly wish to destroy Tepes, you must take not only his head but the necklace. It has been a very long time since I last saw one with my own eyes.','I would like to know what a master\'s necklace is worth.\n**I see. I hope you get to see one.'),(8412,'Vrykolakas','There are said to be twelve vampire masters in all, like the Lady Bathory we serve. They too are scheming for a chance to seize the Blood Bible and the power of eternal life. As far as we have established, we have located the hiding places of two masters: Tepes, who has slipped into Rasen Castle, and Gilles de Rais, south of Lake Timore. The masters of our vampire line each carry a necklace that stands as their emblem. That necklace is made up of a pendant and bijous, and the jewels that compose it hold powerful magic. With it a master can control and use their strength freely.','Tell me more.\n**Understood. I will be on my way.'),(8417,'Vrykolakas','Its worth... is too important to put in merely material terms. If you have the pendant or a bijou from that necklace, I will trade you something rare, quite unlike ordinary goods. There will be a difference between pendant and bijou, of course. Will you?','\n\t\tYes, I will trade Tepes\' pendant.\n\t\t**Yes, I will trade Tepes\' bijou.\n\t\t**Yes, I will trade Gilles de Rais\' pendant.\n\t\t**Yes, I will trade Gilles de Rais\' bijou.\n\t\t**No. Forgive me, but I cannot trade. I will be on my way.'),(8420,'Caim','You are Lord Vlad\'s faithful servant after all. Go and cut off that cunning Bathory woman\'s head. Ah! I nearly forgot something important. Do you know of the necklaces that are the masters\' emblems? The masters, the representatives of their kind, each carry a necklace of pendant and bijou that can both control and amplify their magical power.','Tell me more.\n**Understood. I will be on my way.'),(8421,'Caim','The pendant and the bijou are both a kind of jewel. They hold considerable magical force. Both are powerful, but the pendant is the heart of the necklace, since it plays the central role in controlling that force. A master who loses it can no longer control their power and destroys themselves. To take that woman you must not simply kill her. You must take the necklace along with her.','I would like to know what that necklace is worth.\n**I see. Understood.'),(8422,'Caim','There are two who stand against our Lord Vlad: Bathory and Gilles de Rais. They too are vampire masters, cunning beyond measure, watching for their chance at the Blood Bible and the power of eternal life. Ah! I nearly forgot something important. Do you know of the necklaces that are the masters\' emblems? The masters, the representatives of their kind, each carry a necklace of pendant and bijou that can both control and amplify their magical power.','Tell me more.\n**Understood. I will be on my way.'),(8427,'Caim','Reckoned in material terms it is worth a great deal, but to us it is worth far more than that, is it not? It is as good as that woman\'s life. Ha ha. If you have the pendant or the bijou from that necklace, I will trade you something finer than anything else I hold. As you will know, the pendant is the rarer of the two. The difference between pendant and bijou aside, are you minded to trade?','\n\t\tYes, I will trade Bathory\'s pendant.\n\t\t**Yes, I will trade Bathory\'s bijou.\n\t\t**Yes, I will trade Gilles de Rais\' pendant.\n\t\t**Yes, I will trade Gilles de Rais\' bijou.\n\t\t**No. Forgive me, but I would rather not trade. I will be on my way.'),(8500,'Eileen','Well, what brings you to me?','I am injured.\n\t**I would like to buy consumable items.\n\t**I would like to sell what I am carrying.\n\t**I would like to reset my rank skills.\n\t**I will stop by again when I get the chance.'),(8501,'Eileen','However I look at it, coming here was a rash decision. I have earned plenty of money, but it is far too dangerous.',''),(8502,'Eileen','Treat a light wound yourself, why not. Let me be clear: I am not a doctor, I am a biologist. I would rather you did not interrupt my research.',''),(8503,'Eileen','When will Adam\'s holy ground open, I wonder? Research material must be lying all over the place there...',''),(8504,'Eileen','Whatever you do, you must concentrate. Willpower is the boundless force that turns the impossible into the possible.',''),(8511,'Eileen','If the rank skill you have chosen does not suit you, donate a certain sum and I will delete it for you. Each tier of rank skill can be deleted only once, and after deletion you may choose and use whichever skill you wish. Please select the rank you want deleted.','Servant : 500,000 lei\n\t**Fiscel : 2,000,000 lei\n\t**Litena : 10,000,000 lei\n\t**Cainal : 50,000,000 lei\n\t**No. I will think it over further.'),(8600,'Allen','If there is a weapon you need, just say the word and I will get you anything. Provided your purse can stand it, that is. Now then, what brings you to me?','Recommend me a good weapon.\n\t**I would like to sell the items I have.\n\t**I would like to take part in the war.\n\t**I have come to the wrong place. Until next time.'),(8601,'Allen','Everyone says the same thing. That I am mad for money.',''),(8602,'Allen','Let them say what they like. I could not have gone on living without throwing myself into something like this...',''),(8603,'Allen','You could hardly understand a wretchedness like this, of course. Nobody could.',''),(8604,'Allen','Watch out for the terrible things outside the castle. There is no telling when they will tear your throat out.',''),(8605,'Allen','Let the fine folk go off and hunt... this lowly wretch will make a bit of money out of it... heh heh... heh heh heh.',''),(8610,'Allen','A war application is a contest between guilds of the same kind, the aim being to take each other\'s castle. What war business brings you here?','I would like to apply for a guild war to take a castle.\n\t**I would like to apply for the siege on the defenders\' side.\n\t**I would like to see the guilds that applied to fight on the defending side.\n\t**I would like to view the war waiting list.\n\t**I would like to apply to take part in the race war.\n\t**I would like to travel to the siege area.\n\t**No. I will be on my way.'),(8611,'Allen','Team %(GuildName) has applied to fight on the defending side. Will you accept?','Accept\n\t**Refuse\n\t**Cancel'),(8612,'Allen','No guild has applied to fight on the defending side.','I will be on my way.'),(8700,'Simone','Hello. May you come through today safely. What brings you to me?','Repair my item, please.\n\t**I would like to buy a storage box.\n\t**I would like to see my storage.\n\t**I would like to travel to the Perona highway.\n\t**I have come about the team\'s takings.\n\t**I would like to change the castle\'s tax rate.\n\t**Set evacuation point inside the castle ( fee: %(CastleResurrectFee) / use )\n\t**Set evacuation point outside the castle\n\t**No. I have come to the wrong place.'),(8701,'Simone','The situation is worse than I had heard. We have to stop it before it turns to the worst.',''),(8702,'Simone','Bear in mind that if we do not stop them soon, things could grow far more serious.',''),(8703,'Simone','If they take control of this place... nobody will have any way to stop it...',''),(8704,'Simone','They will always be after you. Be careful.',''),(8705,'Simone','The endless fighting here wears us down all the more. Conserve your strength wherever you can. The final battle is not far off.',''),(8800,'Marie','Marie the maid. Hello, master. What would you have me do today?','Bring me a decent accessory if you have one.\n\t**I will sell the items I have.\n\t**Bring me the war application form.\n\t**No, I only stopped by. Keep up the good work.'),(8801,'Marie','What has become of the masters? To be gone so long... could something terrible have happened?',''),(8802,'Marie','Have you seen her? The maid Amy in Quartus is my twin sister.',''),(8803,'Marie','An irritating girl who knows nothing but hypocrisy and pretence.',''),(8804,'Marie','The thought that the same blood runs in her makes me hate it enough to want to die.',''),(8805,'Marie','How can I finish off that wretched girl Amy? Her face alone sickens me.',''),(8810,'Marie','A war application is a contest between guilds of the same kind, the aim being to take each other\'s castle. What war business brings you here?','I will apply for a guild war to take a castle.\n\t**I will apply for the siege on the defenders\' side.\n\t**Has any guild applied to fight on the defending side?\n\t**Bring me the war waiting list.\n\t**I will apply to take part in the race war.\n\t**I will travel to the siege area.\n\t**I had better think it over. I will be on my way.'),(8811,'Marie','Clan %(GuildName) has applied to fight on the defending side. Will you accept?','Accept\n\t**Refuse\n\t**Cancel'),(8812,'Marie','No guild has applied to fight on the defending side.','I will be on my way.'),(8900,'Beatrix','...............what is it?','I am injured.\n\t**There is an item I need. Show me.\n\t**Will you buy my things?\n\t**I would like to reset my rank skills.\n\t**Forgive me. I have come to the wrong place.'),(8901,'Beatrix','...................Lilith.............Adam.............',''),(8902,'Beatrix','.............they all went and left me behind.............',''),(8903,'Beatrix','....but they will be back soon.',''),(8904,'Beatrix','I am still waiting.....for them.....for me......',''),(8911,'Beatrix','If the rank skill you have chosen does not suit you, pay a certain sum and I will wipe it for you. Each tier of rank skill can be deleted only once, and after deletion you can choose and learn whichever skill you want. Which will it be? Pick the rank you want.','Reichsritter : 500,000 geld\n\t**Baronet : 2,000,000 geld\n\t**Freiherr : 10,000,000 geld\n\t**Graf : 50,000,000 geld\n\t**No. I will think it over further.'),(9200,'Hunt','You have business with me. Let us hear what it is.','Would you repair my things?\n\t**I would like to buy a storage box.\n\t**I would like to see my storage.\n\t**Set resurrection point inside the castle ( fee: %(CastleResurrectFee) / use )\n\t**Set resurrection point outside the castle.\n\t**I have come about the clan\'s takings.\n\t**I would like to change the castle\'s tax rate.\n\t**I would like to travel to the Perona highway.\n\t**I have come to the wrong place. Excuse me.'),(9201,'Hunt','No word of Lady Bathory reaches us. I shall have to go and look myself...',''),(9202,'Hunt','If only Lady Bathory had not ordered me to wait here...',''),(9203,'Hunt','Have you heard any news of Lady Bathory?',''),(9204,'Hunt','Golems are generally dull-witted, true. But treat me as one of them and I will read out everything in your head, including what you would rather forget.',''),(9205,'Hunt','Heh heh... mind reading, you see, is unmatched for finding an opponent\'s weakness.',''),(9300,'Amy','Master, I trust you are well today. What do you call me for?','Bring me armour that would suit me.\n\t**I will sell the things I have.\n\t**Bring me the war application form.\n\t**You work hard as always. Keep it up.'),(9301,'Amy','This is a very dangerous area. Everyone take care.',''),(9302,'Amy','I am fond of my sister, but she dislikes me. Still, I believe she will understand how I feel one day.',''),(9303,'Amy','I think that if you want something dearly enough in your heart, it will surely come to pass.',''),(9304,'Amy','I pray the masters return safely soon.',''),(9310,'Amy','A war application is a contest between guilds of the same kind, the aim being to take each other\'s castle. What war business brings you here?','I will apply for a guild war to take a castle.\n\t**I will apply for the siege on the defenders\' side.\n\t**I will see the guilds that applied to fight on the defending side.\n\t**Bring me the war waiting list.\n\t**I will apply to take part in the race war.\n\t**I will travel to the siege area.\n\t**I had better think it over. I will be on my way.'),(9311,'Amy','Clan %(GuildName) has applied to fight on the defending side. Will you accept?','Accept\n\t**Refuse\n\t**Cancel'),(9312,'Amy','No guild has applied to fight on the defending side.','I will be on my way.'),(9400,'Moloch','Welcome, master. What do you call me for? I will do everything I can to help.','Bring me the goods I need.\n\t**I want to sell my things. Give me a hand.\n\t**I want to reset my rank skills. Will you help?\n\t**You work hard. I am always grateful to you.'),(9401,'Moloch','The masters will return before long.',''),(9402,'Moloch','I am not much, but I will help you all for the time being.',''),(9403,'Moloch','Tell me if you have any questions or need anything.',''),(9404,'Moloch','Things outside are very dangerous just now. Please take care, all of you.',''),(9411,'Moloch','If the rank skill you have chosen does not suit you, pay a certain sum and I will delete it for you. After deletion you may choose and use whichever skill you wish.','Reichsritter : 500,000 geld\n\t**Baronet : 2,000,000 geld\n\t**Freiherr : 10,000,000 geld\n\t**Graf : 50,000,000 geld\n\t**No. I will think it over and come back.'),(9500,'Barun','What are you! What do you want with me?','I would like my item repaired.\n\t**I would like to buy a storage box.\n\t**I would like to see my storage.\n\t**Set resurrection point inside the castle ( fee: %(CastleResurrectFee) / use )\n\t**Set resurrection point outside the castle.\n\t**I have come about the clan\'s takings.\n\t**I would like to change the castle\'s tax rate.\n\t**I would like to travel to the Perona highway.\n\t**Forgive me. I have come to the wrong place.'),(9501,'Barun','We do not even know what has become of Lady Bathory... and here I am mending things in a place like this...',''),(9502,'Barun','Here! If you want your things mended properly, go out and bring me news of Lady Bathory...',''),(9503,'Barun','Damn those masters... harm so much as a hair of Lady Bathory\'s and I will crush their skulls while they live.',''),(9504,'Barun','You lot, stop treating your things so roughly! Try being the one who has to mend them... damn it.',''),(9600,'Judith','Hi! Hi! What brings you here? Is it something I can help with?','I am injured.\n\t**I would like to buy consumable items.\n\t**I would like to sell my items.\n\t**I would like to travel to the Perona highway.\n\t**Set evacuation point inside the castle ( fee: %(CastleResurrectFee) / use )\n\t**Set evacuation point outside the castle\n\t**Forgive me. I have come to the wrong place.'),(9601,'Judith','Bombs and bullets and the like, you mean? I am rather good at making those.',''),(9602,'Judith','I failed a great deal at first, though. I burned through more than a few sets of clothes and got a real telling-off from my mother.',''),(9603,'Judith','Everyone looks worn out lately... keep your spirits up, all of you!',''),(9604,'Judith','~(-_-~)~(-_-)~(~-_-)~ Everybody wiggle-wiggle dance!',''),(9605,'Judith','I want to get out there and fight too... fight hard for my share as well!',''),(9700,'Harold','Living a decent life today, I trust? If not you had best brace yourself. This fist will not stay still. So what brings you to me?','Repair this item, please.\n\t**Recommend me some good armour.\n\t**I want to sell some items. Will you buy my things?\n\t**I would like to reset my rank skills.\n\t**I have come to the wrong place. Until next time.'),(9701,'Harold','Here! Live decently. Decently!',''),(9702,'Harold','I have never seen anyone prosper who made others weep tears of blood...',''),(9703,'Harold','This holy ground, you know, there are faces here I have not seen before... shall we go hunting together when the work is done? I will show you what I can do!',''),(9704,'Harold','A person really should do the work they want to do. On that score I am quite at ease these days, and life is a pleasure.',''),(9705,'Harold','When did I last watch pro wrestling... one of life\'s pleasures gone. Ah well...',''),(9711,'Harold','If the rank skill you have chosen does not suit you, donate a certain sum and I will delete it for you. Each tier of rank skill can be deleted only once, and after deletion you can choose and use whichever skill you want. Pick the rank you want deleted.','Servant : 500,000 lei\n\t**Fiscel : 2,000,000 lei\n\t**Litena : 10,000,000 lei\n\t**Cainal : 50,000,000 lei\n\t**No. I will think it over further.'),(9800,'Brenda','I will give you prompt information. What brings you to me?','I would like to buy a storage box.\n\t**I would like to see my storage.\n\t**I would like to take part in the war.\n\t**I have come about the team\'s takings.\n\t**I would like to change the castle\'s tax rate.\n\t**I have come to the wrong place. Until next time.'),(9801,'Brenda','They are greatly affected by moonlight, I hear. So in the darkness of a full moon they are stronger than usual.',''),(9802,'Brenda','I have lost a great deal since coming here. But I think it is not so foolish to try something once, if it is something you want badly enough to stake your life on.',''),(9803,'Brenda','Dangerous creatures often appear around Adam\'s holy ground. We must strike there first.',''),(9804,'Brenda','I always thought of it as a story out of the imagination. So it makes me want to research their cruelty and their hidden secrets further.',''),(9810,'Brenda','A siege is a contest between teams of the same kind, the aim being to take each other\'s castle. What war business brings you here?','I would like to apply for a siege to take a castle.\n\t**I would like to apply for the siege on the defenders\' side.\n\t**I would like to see the guilds that applied to fight on the defending side.\n\t**I would like to view the war waiting list.\n\t**I would like to take part in the race war.\n\t**I would like to travel to the siege area.\n\t**No. I will be on my way.'),(9811,'Brenda','Team %(GuildName) has applied to fight on the defending side. Will you accept?','Accept\n\t**Refuse\n\t**Cancel'),(9812,'Brenda','No guild has applied to fight on the defending side.','I will be on my way.'),(9900,'Praoros','This is %(CastleName) Castle, held by %(CastleOwner). Will you enter? ( entrance fee: %(EntranceFee) )','Yes\n\t**No'),(9901,'Praoros','The magic of this holy ground, gathered over long ages, called me here.',''),(9902,'Praoros','I am part of the holy ground, and the holy ground is part of me. I will forgive nobody who defiles this place.',''),(9903,'Praoros','You who belong to my castle, come under these wings. Then no magic shall harm you.',''),(9904,'Praoros','If you wish to enter the castle, you must either belong to me or pay the price.',''),(9905,'Praoros','Many have asked whether I am a leopard or a bird. Humans are forever unsettled by what they cannot fit into their own categories.',''),(9906,'Praoros','No creature has eyes as convenient as a human\'s. To be free to see only what you wish to see, what a curious breed.',''),(10000,'Immortality','This is %(CastleName) Castle, held by %(CastleOwner). Will you enter? ( entrance fee: %(EntranceFee) )','Yes\n\t**No'),(10001,'Immortality','What is it you want of me? Do you too desire eternal life?',''),(10002,'Immortality','I cannot grant eternal life to all of you. Only the chosen may be given my power.',''),(10003,'Immortality','If you desire my power, come to the castle. I will share it with you.',''),(10004,'Immortality','Those who desire eternal life are ignorant. That the endless time won by their own greed will drive them to ruin, they do not know...',''),(10005,'Immortality','I can give eternal life to others, yet my own life is not eternal. In the great universe it is no more than an instant.',''),(10006,'Immortality','Within this holy ground the passing of time became power. The strong magic that dwells in every creature here is the crystallised will to live through long ages.',''),(10100,'Fafnir','This is %(CastleName) Castle, held by %(CastleOwner). Will you enter? ( entrance fee: %(EntranceFee) )','Yes\n\t**No'),(10101,'Fafnir','Some of you may think there is an antidote to poison, but know that for mine no such thing exists.',''),(10102,'Fafnir','My poison is strong, and it takes hold slowly. However well you may feel, well enough to think yourself cured, before long you will see yourself dying.',''),(10103,'Fafnir','If you wish to escape this poison, you must all kneel to me and to those who belong to my castle.',''),(10104,'Fafnir','What is precious to you? Are you prepared to stake your life for it?',''),(10105,'Fafnir','Some humans think it foolish to stake a life on what is precious to them. But with passion of that order, would there be any regret?',''),(10106,'Fafnir','If there is something you want, you had best try anything at all towards it. Otherwise the poison called regret will spread through your heart.',''),(10200,'Arioch','This is %(CastleName) Castle, held by %(CastleOwner). Will you enter? ( entrance fee: %(EntranceFee) )','Yes\n\t**No'),(10201,'Arioch','If you wish it, I will take any revenge on your behalf. But bear in mind that you too must pay the price it demands.',''),(10202,'Arioch','All who belong to this castle are under my protection. To move against them carelessly I will take as a challenge to me.',''),(10203,'Arioch','Some resent paying a price to enter the castle, but know that inside it you are granted rights worth as much.',''),(10204,'Arioch','The source of my power is this holy ground. Magic gathered over long ages works upon every living thing here.',''),(10205,'Arioch','If you too wish to receive the holy ground\'s power, first find the will to overcome yourself.',''),(10206,'Arioch','What do you think is the hardest thing in the world? Never forget that it is surpassing yourself.',''),(10300,'Old Woman','What was that? Strange people? Oh yes, there are. There are ever so many young folk going about in odd clothes these days. Why they wear things caked in bits of metal, uncomfortable as it must be. Fashion or whatever it is, they are out of their minds... what, not that? Ah... yes, yes... those strange people you mean... over towards Drobeta, was it, or south of Limbo Castle, perhaps... my memory is so hazy... anyway, they carried a staff giving off a strange light, and it looked expensive. But speak to them and they gave no answer at all. I took offence and simply walked on. Thinking about it afterwards, though, I do not believe they were people. The woman who runs the coffee shop said she saw them too...','Understood, grandmother. Thank you.'),(10301,'Old Woman','Yes, yes... that is how it goes.',''),(10302,'Old Woman','My grandchild seems fond of unusual things.',''),(10303,'Old Woman','The woman at the coffee shop saw them too, not just me.',''),(10304,'Old Woman','When you get old you keep forgetting things. Though sometimes it seems to help.',''),(10305,'Old Woman','What was that? Ah, speak up a bit.',''),(10306,'Old Woman','When will the stench of blood soaked into this ground ever go away...',''),(10307,'Old Woman','I can see nothing any more. What is there left to live for.',''),(10308,'Old Woman','The nights here teach you what fear really is.',''),(10310,'Old Woman','Eh? What was that? I cannot hear you well.',''),(10400,'Coffee Shop Owner','What is it... this is our land. Who are you, to tell us to leave? We are not moving. If we were going to, we would have gone long ago. Spare us your concern. We have been seeing vampires far longer than you have...','No, I only came to ask something. The old woman over there told me to come.\n\t\t**Dear, dear... a very difficult person to deal with.'),(10401,'Coffee Shop Owner','I have nothing to say to you. Please go.','Dear, dear... a very difficult person to deal with.'),(10402,'Coffee Shop Owner','Hm... is that so? It must be about those strange creatures I saw. But why should I have to tell you about that? I dislike you people very, very much.','If you will not cooperate, I could place you under arrest right now.\n\t\t**I understand how you feel. But it was a measure taken for your own sake.'),(10403,'Coffee Shop Owner','Hah, showing your true colours straight away. Do you think threats like that will work? If that were enough to rattle me I would have left this place long ago.','All right, all right. But those creatures are very likely dangerous. If you want things here to go back to how they were, do cooperate.\n\t\t**You take E.V.E. far too lightly. We have the right to detain anyone in this country who obstructs military operations.'),(10404,'Coffee Shop Owner','Hah, you have no interest whatsoever in what becomes of our lives. We cannot live anywhere but here. And all you do is string together fine-sounding words. I have nothing more to say to you. Please go.','Yes, I understand. But if you change your mind, do get in touch.'),(10405,'Coffee Shop Owner','There is nothing for it. You win. But please just leave us as we are. That is my condition. Then I will tell you. It would have been about a month ago. Some 20 km south-west of Eslania. It was the middle of the night, but I could see clearly. They gave off a strange light. They looked like very tall women, and I could tell at a glance they were not human. They seemed exhausted, as if they needed help, but I was too frightened to stop the car.','I see. That was a great help. And I will report to my superiors on your rights.'),(10406,'Coffee Shop Owner','It is you who takes us too lightly. Go ahead and do it if you can. I am not frightened in the least... more vicious than the vampires, the lot of you...','Ah... no. Tch, there is nothing for it. I will give you a moment to think. It would be better for you to cooperate with us. Think it over once more.'),(10411,'Coffee Shop Owner','Do not ask my name. The woman who runs the coffee shop is quite enough.',''),(10412,'Coffee Shop Owner','You never had any right to make us leave this country in the first place.',''),(10413,'Coffee Shop Owner','The monsters\' grotesque howling, the tearing sound of shells. I am sick of all of it.',''),(10414,'Coffee Shop Owner','Hah, vampires and slayers, they are all exactly the same.',''),(10415,'Coffee Shop Owner','What were those tall women... should I have helped them...',''),(10416,'Coffee Shop Owner','Those strange women... the old woman next door says she saw them too...',''),(10417,'Coffee Shop Owner','You are always like this. I would like a little quiet now.',''),(10418,'Coffee Shop Owner','It seems there are more and more strange creatures about.',''),(10500,'Ripati Sylphid','Well met. I have been waiting for you, as Carissas foretold. I am one of the Ousters, the very beings you have been searching for. You will have a great deal you want to ask, I imagine.','I would like to know more about you.\n\t\t**Is there anything I can do to help you?\n\t\t**I have gathered the spirit stones. Please take a look.\n\t\t**I did not receive the reward for the Ousters quest earlier.\n\t\t**The Ousters quest feels too much for me.\n\t\t**I understand well enough now. Until we meet again...'),(10501,'Ripati Sylphid','Our ancestors lived far to the north of here, in the land of Radkia. It is not in the histories, but five hundred years ago a terrible war between humans and vampires was fought there. Our ancestors were born then, by Carissas\' hand. When the war ended, the few survivors came down here and kept Adam\'s holy ground from falling into vampire hands. But when Carissas passed away, our village fell asleep with her.','So that is how it was.'),(10502,'Ripati Sylphid','I am truly grateful that you offered before I asked. As it happens, there is something I would ask of you. We need a certain kind of spirit stone. It is the key to waking our sleeping people. I would do it myself, but standing here talking with you is already almost more than I can manage. Could you find them for us? If you do, in return I will help you find the hidden thirteenth Blood Bible.','That is no great difficulty. I will help you.\n\t\t**That is no easy matter. Give me a moment to think.'),(10503,'Ripati Sylphid','Please deal with what I asked you first. It pains me to say it, but it is disappointing that you have not found even one.','I am trying. I will work hard at it.'),(10504,'Ripati Sylphid','What you are carrying looks like a spirit stone. I would rather you showed me that.','Ah, of course.'),(10505,'Ripati Sylphid','I know well what the earlier request cost you. Take your reward first and then we will talk again.','Let us do that.'),(10506,'Ripati Sylphid','You have done very well. Now show me the spirit stones. Let us hope the right one is among them.','Here they are. Take them.\n\t\t**I fear this may not be enough. I will go and gather more.'),(10507,'Ripati Sylphid','Where would that be... I see nothing.','Ha ha, I was only saying it.'),(10508,'Ripati Sylphid','What? What reward would that be...','Ah, I do beg your pardon.'),(10509,'Ripati Sylphid','What? Did I ask anything of you?','No. I seem to have got something wrong.'),(10510,'Ripati Sylphid','I know very well it was no easy request. I asked too much of you. But for the sake of our people, please think it over once more.','It is beyond my ability; I simply cannot. I will find you another comrade instead.\n\t\t**I took it too lightly. Let me try once more.'),(10511,'Ripati Sylphid','What do you mean... have you not already helped us splendidly?','My mind was elsewhere for a moment. That came out wrong.'),(10512,'Ripati Sylphid','Thank you truly. Carissas\' prophecy was not mistaken. She said a hero would appear to help us. There are ten kinds of spirit stone in all. Even I do not know which of them is the true one. The more kinds you can find, the better. They are said to be held by the %(QuestMonsters). I leave it to you.','Wait a little. I will do my best.'),(10513,'Ripati Sylphid','Where would that be... I see nothing.','Ha ha, I was only saying it.'),(10514,'Ripati Sylphid','This is it. Now we can wake from our long sleep. It is all thanks to you. First, please accept this small gift from us.','I did not do it for anything like this, but I accept it gratefully.'),(10515,'Ripati Sylphid','I know what your efforts cost, but the spirit stone we wanted was not among these. It seems the kind we need has changed as a result. A great pity.','The fault is in my own efforts.'),(10601,'Thug','Where is this? Why does it go on and on with no end in sight?',''),(10602,'Thug','Surely that is not the Limbo Castle everyone talks about...',''),(10603,'Thug','...... just a rat going past, was it? Phew... gave me a fright.',''),(10604,'Thug','They would hardly come after me just for lifting a few things off those idiots at E.V.E.',''),(10605,'Thug','What were those tall women... could have been a decent score, that.',''),(10606,'Thug','Those strange women... the fishmonger says he saw them too, so I clearly was not imagining it.',''),(10607,'Thug','Well, it hardly matters now. Everyone dies sooner or later anyway...',''),(10608,'Thug','Shameful lot... all in the same clothes, only the colours differ...',''),(10611,'Thug','Ah, p... please... spare my life. I only lost my way. I do not want to be a vampire. No... no, I mean, not that vampires are... I am simply not ready for any of this. Please just leave me alone.','All you have to do is answer my questions. A grown man, in tears...\n\t\t **Dear, dear... not someone I care to deal with.'),(10612,'Thug','What is it you want to ask? Is it about those strange women that time? No, no... I am sorry. I saw nothing at all. Please let me go.','Be quiet, you idiot. If you do not want to die, shut up and listen to what I ask.\n\t\t **I am not going to harm you. I have no appetite for filthy blood like yours. Just stand still and answer the question.'),(10613,'Thug','I told you. I do not want to be a vampire... ah, look, there are flames going up over Limbo Castle!!','What, where? ...damn, taken in. Just let me catch you again and I will not let it pass...'),(10614,'Thug','You mean to ask whether I want to be a vampire, do you not? No, I do not. I am fine. May I go now?','Honestly, pull yourself together... I want to hear about those women you say you saw. That is all. I am quite full enough as it is...\n\t\t **No, that is not what I want to ask. Listen to me carefully.'),(10615,'Thug','Really? You promise? All right. Then I will tell you. It would have been about a month ago. Some 20 km south-west of Eslania. It was the middle of the night, but I could see clearly. They gave off a strange light. They looked like very tall women, and I could tell at a glance they were not human. They seemed exhausted, as if they needed help, but I was too frightened to stop the bike.','I see. No chance a coward like you would have stopped. Fine, off you go.'),(10616,'Thug','I, I do not know. I know nothing at all... well then... goodbye!!','Stop right there!! Oh, damn... got away, did he? Quick enough when he runs, that one.'),(10617,'Thug','I... I have nothing to say to you. Aaaaargh...','Dear, dear... not someone I care to deal with.'),(10701,'Fishmonger','The smell of fish is still a great deal better than the stench of blood.',''),(10702,'Fishmonger','I deal in more than fish. Nothing you could put before the law, of course...',''),(10703,'Fishmonger','That thug says he saw them too... what on earth were those women?',''),(10704,'Fishmonger','I am not afraid of vampires. I even have a few friends I do business with.',''),(10705,'Fishmonger','Nothing can frighten me.',''),(10706,'Fishmonger','This heavy cleaver would take the head off most monsters in one go...',''),(10707,'Fishmonger','Trade is getting harder and harder all the same.',''),(10708,'Fishmonger','Damn it... if I could just get inside that castle once, I would make a real fortune...',''),(10711,'Fishmonger','I am not afraid of vampires. Clear off. Why am I seeing so many strange creatures lately? Those odd women a while back, for one. What? You want to hear about them? That is easy enough. Right, what I saw that day. Over towards Drobeta, was it, or south of Limbo Castle, perhaps... somewhere thereabouts. Anyway, they carried a staff giving off a strange light, and it looked like it would fetch a fair bit. But speak to them and they gave no answer at all. Insolent, I thought, but I walked on. Thinking about it afterwards, though, I do not believe they were people. That thug says he saw them too, not just me...','Insolent wretch. The stink of fish puts me off your blood, so I will let you go. Damn...'),(10712,'Fishmonger','Do not talk to me. It is a nuisance. You do not frighten me in the least.',''),(11000,'Amata Selion','Well met. I have been waiting for you, as Carissas foretold. I am one of the Ousters, the very beings you have been searching for. Unlike the generations above us, we have no cause to bear you ill will. So you may be at ease. If there is anything you wish to ask, do not hesitate.','Hm, what exactly are you lot?\n\t\t**If there is anything I can help with, feel free to say so.\n\t\t**I brought the spirit stones you spoke of. Will you take a look?\n\t\t**I did not receive the reward for the Ousters quest earlier.\n\t\t**The Ousters quest turned out to be a real nuisance.\n\t\t**Fine, fine. I think I understand well enough. Until next time...'),(11001,'Amata Selion','Our ancestors lived far to the north of here, in the land of Radkia. It is not in the histories, but five hundred years ago a terrible war between humans and vampires was fought there. Our ancestors were born then, by Carissas\' hand. When the war ended, the few survivors came down here and kept Adam\'s holy ground from falling into vampire hands. But when Carissas passed away, our village fell asleep with her.','I see. So that is how it was.'),(11002,'Amata Selion','I am truly grateful that you offered before I asked. As it happens, there is something I would ask of you. We need a certain kind of spirit stone. It is the key to waking our sleeping people. I would do it myself, but standing here talking with you is already almost more than I can manage. Could you find them for us? If you do, in return I will help you find the hidden thirteenth Blood Bible.','Oh? In that case, fine. I will gladly help.\n\t\t**A real nuisance. Let me think for a moment...'),(11003,'Amata Selion','Thank you truly. Carissas\' prophecy was not mistaken. She said someone kind would appear to help us. There are ten kinds of spirit stone in all. Even I do not know which of them is the true one. The more kinds you can find, the better. They are said to be held by the %(QuestMonsters). I leave it to you.','Wait a little. I will do my best.'),(11004,'Amata Selion','Please deal with what I asked you first. It pains me to say it, but it is disappointing that you have not found even one.','Hah, listen to your cheek. Wait a little.'),(11005,'Amata Selion','What you are carrying looks like a spirit stone. I would rather you showed me that.','Ah, was that so.'),(11006,'Amata Selion','I know well what the earlier request cost you. Take your reward first and then we will talk again.','Let us do that.'),(11007,'Amata Selion','You have done very well. Now show me the spirit stones. Let us hope the right one is among them.','This should be enough, no?\n\t\t**This does not look like enough. I will gather some more.'),(11008,'Amata Selion','This is it. Now we can wake from our long sleep. It is all thanks to you. First, please accept this small gift from us.','I did not do it for anything like this, but I will take it gratefully.'),(11009,'Amata Selion','I know what your efforts cost, but the spirit stone we wanted was not among these. It seems the kind we need has changed as a result. A great pity.','Tch, a fussy business.'),(11010,'Amata Selion','Where would that be... I see nothing.','Eh? Did I drop them all on the way?'),(11011,'Amata Selion','What? What reward would that be...','No, well... I was only saying it.'),(11012,'Amata Selion','I know very well it was no easy request. I asked too much of you. But for the sake of our people, please think it over once more.','I cannot stand a nuisance. I want to drop it.\n\t\t**Is that so... fine, I will put my back into it once more.'),(11013,'Amata Selion','What do you mean... have you not already helped us splendidly?','I see. My mind must have been elsewhere.'),(11014,'Amata Selion','What? Did I ask anything of you?','No, it is nothing.'),(11015,'Amata Selion','I cannot speak with you. But I have a feeling we will meet again some day.',''),(12101,'Lavinia','The Lord of Wisdom, the source of life and goodness, grants to the wise and the righteous the highest teaching, known only to true leaders. You may become one of the Lord\'s people only through wisdom and purity of thought. The light is seen only by those who seek it themselves. I will always be your guide until you reach it. How may I help you?','I would like to know about the lair masters.\n\t\t**Set resurrection point\n\t\t**I would like to adjust my skill levels.\n\t\t**I would like to take on the Sealing of the Barrier quest.\n\t\t**I would like the reward for the Sealing of the Barrier quest.\n\t\t**I would like to abandon the Sealing of the Barrier quest.\n\t\t**I will trade my gemstone for an item.\n\t\t**I would like to trade a Full Moon Card for an item.\n\t\t**I would like to trade a New Moon Card for an item.\n\t\t**I have come to trade a Lucky Pouch for an item.\n\t\t**I have brought the wing of guidance.\n\t\t**I will withdraw. Peace be with you always.'),(12102,'Lavinia','We know well what the hosts of evil, who serve evil, have done in the past and will do in the future. It falls to us to judge their deeds, and the time to act has come. The vampire masters Bathory and Tepes have begun their evil work again for their own greed. They use the power of jewels imbued with magic to control their own strength. Each master carries a necklace made of those jewels, and over these they wage a futile blood feud, threatening even each other\'s lives.','I would like to hear more.\n\t\t**I have heard you well. Thank you for telling me.'),(12103,'Lavinia','Their necklaces are made up of a pendant and bijous. Each of the jewels holds great magical force, but the pendant is the very essence of it. The necklace is a rare magic stone in itself, but it could also serve in the important work of building our strength against the vampires. It may reveal the source of their power.','I would like to know more about what the necklace is worth.\n\t\t**Yes. I will always remember it. I will be on my way.'),(12104,'Lavinia','If anyone were to have such a necklace, we would have to trade them very valuable items for it. The value will differ, of course, depending on whether it is the pendant or a bijou.','I would like to trade my pendant for an item.\n\t\t**I would like to trade my bijou for an item.\n\t\t**Thank you for speaking with me so long.'),(12105,'Lavinia','What came to be in him was life, and that life was the light of all people.',''),(12106,'Lavinia','The light shines in the darkness, and the darkness has not overcome it.',''),(12107,'Lavinia','If you wish it, I will give you more teaching. Trust me and stay with me always.',''),(12108,'Lavinia','The name of my soul is "Carissas". At present I am borrowing Lavinia\'s body.',''),(12109,'Lavinia','Lavinia. I am always grateful to her, and always sorry.',''),(12110,'Lavinia','If you wish to adjust your skill levels, I will help you, so do not hesitate.',''),(12111,'Lavinia','The barrier raised beyond Castalo is as good as the life of our people. We need your wisdom.',''),(12112,'Lavinia','Our people\'s future rests in your hands. Please lend me your strength.',''),(12120,'Lavinia','You wish to turn the magical power you have acquired in another direction. Understood. I think I can be of some small help. But there are those who would abuse this for their own ends, so I ask a price to match. Shall we adjust your skill levels, then?','Yes, please.\n\t\t**Forgive me. I do not think I can pay the price.'),(12130,'Lavinia','I understand well your wish to protect our precious barrier. But there are things that strength and courage alone cannot achieve. Perhaps we had better put you through a light test of your wisdom.','Of course. Just tell me what it is.\n\t\t**Give me time to think it over.'),(12131,'Lavinia','There is no time for a long explanation. A wicked host means to harm our precious home. We urgently need a pendulum to sense magical force. But to use it we must have a dowsing rod made of a particular mineral. Can you find ten fragments of this mineral?','Of course. Leave it to me.\n\t\t**That is no easy matter. I will think it over.'),(12132,'Lavinia','Thanks to all of you we have mineral fragments enough. But refining them requires a substance called refinium. It is said to be obtainable only from a certain mine to the north-east of Castalo. The place is guarded against intruders by invisible walls and traps, so please take particular care. Well?','Of course. Leave it to me.\n\t\t**That is no easy matter. I will think it over.'),(12133,'Lavinia','Our survey with the pendulum and the dowsing rod has located the clay figure that will reveal where the grimoire holding the key to protecting the barrier lies. The clay figure is said to be broken into pieces scattered across the regions of Eslania. Can you gather every fragment and put it back together?','Of course. Leave it to me.\n\t\t**That is no easy matter. I will think it over.'),(12134,'Lavinia','Fortunately we succeeded in finding the grimoire. But to read it we must find five kinds of magic stone and complete a code table. To complete the table correctly you must combine the spells inscribed on the stones, fitting them in so as to avoid the spells of the stones adjacent above, below, left and right. Study the table and I think it will be plain enough. Please give everything you have, to the very end, for the wellbeing of our people. Well? If you are willing, take the code table.','Of course. Leave it to me.\n\t\t**That is no easy matter. I will think it over.'),(12135,'Lavinia','What do you mean to do about the task in progress... our people\'s survival depends on it.','So it is. I had not thought of that.'),(12136,'Lavinia','It seems you carried out the task safely. In that case, why not settle the reward for it before taking on the next one?','I will do as you say.'),(12137,'Lavinia','Splendid. I failed to recognise a sage. But taking the test does not oblige you to carry out the task. Sitting the test alone makes you fully deserving of a reward. Taking on the formal task is entirely your choice. So, will you take the reward, or carry out the formal task?','I would like to carry on with the task.\n\t\t**The formal task feels too much for me. I would like the reward.'),(12138,'Lavinia','Why, is this the mineral fragment? Well done indeed. So you can carry out the next task as well, I take it. As before, you are not obliged to. Completing this task alone makes you fully deserving of a reward. The next task will be more dangerous and more difficult. It is entirely your choice. So, will you take the reward, or carry out the next task? Please think of our people\'s future.','I am already resolved to give everything for our people.\n\t\t**Frankly, this task was almost too much for me as well. I would like the reward.'),(12139,'Lavinia','Remarkable. Astonishing. Well done indeed. So you can carry out the next task as well, I take it. As before, you are not obliged to. Completing this task alone makes you fully deserving of a reward. The next task will be more dangerous and more difficult. It is entirely your choice. So, will you take the reward, or carry out the next task? Please think of our people\'s future.','I am already resolved to give everything for our people.\n\t\t**Frankly, this task was almost too much for me as well. I would like the reward.'),(12140,'Lavinia','Remarkable. Astonishing. Well done indeed. So you can carry out the next task as well, I take it. As before, you are not obliged to. Completing this task alone makes you fully deserving of a reward. The next task will be more dangerous and more difficult. It is entirely your choice. So, will you take the reward, or carry out the next task? Please think of our people\'s future.','I am already resolved to give everything for our people.\n\t\t**Frankly, this task was almost too much for me as well. I would like the reward.'),(12141,'Lavinia','You have completed the code table already? Astonishing. I promise the reward for what you have achieved for our people will be nothing short of generous. With this we should be able to protect the barrier with an easy mind. It would be no exaggeration at all to call you the hero who saved our people.','I only did what anyone would.'),(12142,'Lavinia','I did not think you were doing this for a reward. This is disappointing. And you have not even completed the task.','I, I am sorry.'),(12143,'Lavinia','What is this? Do you mean to abandon the next task?','I want to forget the whole business of tasks. I would like the reward for the previous quest.\n\t\t**No. I was only saying it.'),(12144,'Lavinia','If you truly say it is too hard, there is nothing for it. But our people\'s future has grown darker for it. Do you really mean to stop?','I need more preparation. I will certainly try again later.\n\t\t**No. I was simply thinking wrongly for a moment.'),(12145,'Lavinia','If you truly say it is too hard, there is nothing for it. But our people\'s future has grown darker for it. Do you really mean to stop?','I need more preparation. I will certainly try again later.\n\t\t**It is too much for me. I would like the reward for the previous quest.\n\t\t**No. I was simply thinking wrongly for a moment.'),(12146,'Lavinia','If you go so far as to say that, there is nothing for it. But for my sake, why not think it over once more?','I believe I did all I could. I would rather just take the reward.\n\t\t**I will think it over once more.'),(12147,'Lavinia','Did I assign you a task?','Ah, there seems to have been some mistake.'),(12148,'Lavinia','What? Have you not already completed the task splendidly? Go and take your reward.','Ah, was that so.'),(12150,'Lavinia','Please find 8 %(Target) at %(QuestZone).','Understood.'),(12151,'Lavinia','Gather every fragment of the clay figure at %(QuestZone) and put it back together.','Understood.'),(12201,'Amata','O fire, son of Selaim, though I am a lowly thing, let me dwell from now and forever in your holy light, in your perfect happiness and abundant blessing. Let my soul win a fitting reward, a fair name and everlasting joy. Hello. I am Amata, and I will take charge of your belongings. How may I help you?','I would like to buy a storage box.\n\t\t**I would like to see the things I have stored.\n\t\t**I would like to see the accessories I need.\n\t\t**I would like to sell my things.\n\t\t**I would like to see my pet storage.\n\t\t**I have come about the Pixie (pet) quest.\n\t\t**What is the monster hunting quest?\n\t\t**I have completed the monster hunting quest. I would like my reward.\n\t\t**This is too hard. I will give up part way.\n\t\t**I will be on my way, then.'),(12202,'Amata','Nemese-te atarsh Seraimu hudao majishta yajita',''),(12203,'Amata','It means: "O fire of Selaim, most great protector of souls, overflowing with mercy."',''),(12204,'Amata','My memory is not very good, I am afraid. If there is something you asked of me, do ask me again often.',''),(12205,'Amata','The happiness you seek will be given only through the fire and righteousness of your spirit.',''),(12206,'Amata','I am no more than a conduit for the will of Selaim, the spirit of fire. I fall far short, but please bear with me kindly.',''),(12210,'Amata','Pixies are always beside you. But to receive their help you must bring strong faith with you. If I am not mistaken, I believe you too hold a firm faith.','What is the Pixie (pet) quest?\n\t\t**I have completed the Pixie quest. My reward?'),(12211,'Amata','Congratulations on reaching the required level. As you know, of all the spirits who help us the pixies are the most timid. They are the greatest help in punishing those who stain the holy ground with blood, but in danger they shrink away to nothing. They want to be sure of you, who would be their master. If they can trust you absolutely, they will make very good friends. Can you show them your ability? %(MonsterName) suits your level. Bring down 80 of them within one hour and they will be sure of you. Show them what you can do.','I will do it.\n\t\t**No, I will come back later.'),(12212,'Amata','Every monster you have hunted so far will be forfeited. Do you really want to abandon the quest?','Yes, it is too much for me.\n\t\t**I have changed my mind. I will try again.'),(12213,'Amata','How strange. Your name is not on the list of quest applicants.','Goodbye, then.'),(12214,'Amata','There is nothing for it. Come and try again whenever you like.','Goodbye, then.'),(12301,'Ripati','Sylphid of the wind, make your holy design known to me, that I may grasp the truth, and let this teaching that has taken hold of my spirit be revealed to all the world. I am Ripati, and I have the power to heal. If you have a troublesome wound, come to me. If it is something I can treat, I will help.','I would like my wound healed.\n\t\t**I would like to buy summoning stones and recovery items.\n\t\t**I would like to sell my things.\n\t\t**I would like to go to the beginner hunting ground (the Temerie holy ground).\n\t\t**I would like to go to the Caligo Dungeon (the level-based war zone).\n\t\t**You work hard as always. I will be on my way.'),(12302,'Ripati','In thought, teaching, will, belief, language and inner form, we have nothing in common; we are wholly separate beings.',''),(12303,'Ripati','A physical wound to the body is easily treated. But a wound to the soul does not heal so readily.',''),(12304,'Ripati','All I can do is treat wounds to the flesh.',''),(12305,'Ripati','Remember that there are people who take a wound to the soul from even the smallest thing you do.',''),(12306,'Ripati','Growing up as a half-blood of the spirit folk was hard, but I never resented my parents.',''),(12307,'Ripati','They raised me with the very best they were able to give.',''),(12401,'Hora','Elaim of the water. Whatever you may do, you who are the emblem of truth and righteousness, we will serve you with a pure heart. Let all who dwell in your quiet land come to maturity through a pure heart. Water is the mirror of the soul that cleanses you. Always remember this. How may I help you?','I would like to buy some new clothes.\n\t\t**I would like to sell my things.\n\t\t**I have come to collect what I bought in the Darden Market. Please show me my basket.\n\t\t**I will be on my way, then.'),(12402,'Hora','Everyone reveals their own faith, whether false or true, whether bright or dark.',''),(12403,'Hora','And when doubt rises in the heart, faith and devotion will guide that soul wherever it is.',''),(12404,'Hora','My companions are sealed in the frozen Lake Timore even now.',''),(12405,'Hora','I must find a way to save them as soon as I can, but with my strength as it is...',''),(12406,'Hora','The spirits of each element have their own ranks. Undine at the lowest, Undain in the middle...',''),(12407,'Hora','Endiron above them, Elestra highest of all, and the king of the water spirits is called Elaim.',''),(12410,'Hora','Anything you buy in the Darden Market or receive as a gift is held in this basket. You collect those from me too. Did you know? Unlike storage, the basket only holds gifts and purchases for you; it will not keep your own belongings the way storage does. And if not everything you bought is showing in the basket, it has not been lost. It will appear once you collect what is in there now, so do not be concerned. Shall we take a look at your basket, then?','Yes, I would like to check my basket.\n\t\t**No. I will check it another time.'),(12501,'Sioram','Noas of the earth, teach me precious words and noble deeds, that I may worship you with clean thought and a pure heart. O earth, let me live a new life overflowing with truth by your power. Good day. I am Sioram, the spirit of earth. What business have you with me?','I would like to repair my item.\n\t\t**I have come about a guild.\n\t\t**I want to go to the free duel zone.\n\t\t**I would like to make the pact for using the horns of the earth spirit.\n\t\t**I would like to borrow the token of the Blood Bible.\n\t\t**I will return the token of the Blood Bible.\n\t\t**I will be on my way, then.'),(12502,'Sioram','The free duel zone has "Banatul", where you can duel regardless of kind.','I want to go to Banatul.\n\t\t**I will think it over and decide.'),(12509,'Sioram','About a guild... what exactly is it you want?','I have come to register a guild.\n\t\t**I would like to view the pending guild list.\n\t\t**I would like to view the guild list.\n\t\t**I would like to leave my guild.\n\t\t**It seems I have no business here.'),(12510,'Sioram','Leaving your guild, you say? If you have thought it over carefully, so be it. I accept your withdrawal. But understand this. Leaving here does not mean you can go straight to another guild. You broke the oath with your own hands, so even to go elsewhere a full week of real time must pass. It will not be easy.','Understood, but I would like to leave.\n\t\t**In that case I will think it over again.'),(12511,'Sioram','Accept the pact with the earth spirit and you may travel freely between the places where the horns of the earth spirit stand. Each use costs a price to match, of course. The earth fairies who govern them are greedy beyond measure. And they set the sum by the look of whoever asks. Well? Shall we make the pact with the earth spirit?','Yes, I would place my small soul under the earth spirit\'s protection.\n\t\t**I will think it over.'),(12512,'Sioram','Have you not already made the pact? Use it freely and do not worry.','I see. Excuse me.'),(12520,'Sioram','Those who follow righteousness and purity will hold the light of paradise as their eternal rest.',''),(12521,'Sioram','But those who do not find the light will remain forever in the darkness of lament and unease.',''),(12522,'Sioram','I love to travel. And you? New lands, new people, new cultures too. All of it is the true charm of travel.',''),(12523,'Sioram','Do enjoy travelling if you get the chance. There is much to learn from it.',''),(12524,'Sioram','Travel is a pleasure, but this life alongside you is my greatest joy just now.',''),(12525,'Sioram','If anything troubles you, come to me without hesitation.',''),(12526,'Sioram','If you wish to use the horns of the earth spirit, make the pact through me.',''),(12527,'Sioram','There are so many people around us in need.',''),(12528,'Sioram','May those less fortunate than us receive a warmer hand...',''),(12550,'Sioram','There are still many around us in need who are waiting for a kind hand. We are collecting donations so that your love can reach them. Would you care to join the collection too, %(UserName)?','I would like to give as an individual.\n\t\t**I would like to give on behalf of my guild.'),(12551,'Sioram','Thank you for your warm hand. The amount you have given will be posted on the homepage. The precious donation you have made today, %(UserName), will be put to good use where it is truly needed, where a kind hand is wanted.','I am making a donation.\n\t\t**I will call on you again next time.'),(12552,'Sioram','I am sorry. You are not currently in a guild, %(UserName), or you are not yet a full member. If you are not in a guild, please give as an individual.','I would like to give as an individual, then.\n\t\t**Yes, understood.'),(12553,'Sioram','Thank you. As a member of %(GuildName), you are donating in the name of %(GuildName), %(UserName). The amount you have given will be posted on the homepage under the guild\'s name. Posted amounts are shown as a running total. The precious donations gathered in the name of %(GuildName) will be put to good use where they are truly needed, where a kind hand is wanted.','I am making a donation.\n\t\t**I will call on you again next time.'),(12601,'Manescu','Carissas, where is the faithful believer who knows your precious teaching? Though hardship and distress befall me, I will not leave you, and I will spread your teaching far and wide. My Carissas, I acknowledge you alone. Be therefore my only rest and my only saviour. I am Manescu, aide to Lady Lavinia. What is your business?','I would like to buy a new weapon.\n\t\t**I would like to sell my things.\n\t\t**I would like my alignment adjusted.\n\t\t**Would you tell me about "advancement"?\n\t\t**I have come because I need an advancement item.\n\t\t**I will be on my way, then.'),(12602,'Manescu','To have gone against Carissas\' will... this is not a matter that ends simply. But since we are at war, let us settle it in a way that profits us both. Make a donation and I will adjust your alignment. Remember that the effect varies with the size of the donation, of course. What will you do?','I will donate 10,000 zad.\n\t\t**I will donate 50,000 zad.\n\t\t**I will donate 100,000 zad.\n\t\t**I will donate 500,000 zad.\n\t\t**I will donate 1,000,000 zad.\n\t\t**That sum is a heavy burden for me. I will call on you another time.'),(12603,'Manescu','Make us your faithful servants, who renew the world.',''),(12604,'Manescu','The one I serve is Carissas, not you. Settle what you can settle yourself.',''),(12605,'Manescu','I long always for your perfect resurrection, Carissas. Cast off this unstable flesh and show us your perfect form once more.',''),(12606,'Manescu','The reason I exist is Carissas. She is the one who gave me a reason to live.',''),(12607,'Manescu','Carissas, I ask you: speak to me. How, through truth and righteousness, am I to rein in the ten horses called the senses, which run wherever thought leads?',''),(12610,'Manescu','I doubt you are worthy of it, but since you ask I will tell you.\n\t\tOur power is boundless. We have only held it back until now, so that no meaningless violence be done. But we can no longer stand by while outside forces grow ever stronger. The time has come to release that power. To be reborn as a warrior of greater ability. Being recognised is not easy, of course. Earning the right to use forbidden techniques and equipment demands at least that much effort, does it not?','Thank you for explaining.'),(13000,'Minescence','This is %(CastleName) Castle, held by %(CastleOwner). Will you enter? ( entrance fee: %(EntranceFee) )','Yes\n\t\t**No'),(13001,'Minescence','For a spirit caller, what matters above all is not summoning the spirit kings or pursuing great power, but a heart that loves and cherishes nature.',''),(13002,'Minescence','I hear it is even possible to call forth the spirit kings of all four elements.',''),(13003,'Minescence','Adam\'s holy ground here must be protected by us Ousters.',''),(13004,'Minescence','Guarding the Blood Bible is the very mission of the Ousters.',''),(13005,'Minescence','Even I, once called the greatest of spirit callers, can do no more than guard this entrance. ',''),(13006,'Minescence','Summoning a spirit king is a thing of dreams for an ordinary spirit caller.',''),(13100,'Piscate','This is %(CastleName) Castle, held by %(CastleOwner). Will you enter? ( entrance fee: %(EntranceFee) )','Yes\n\t\t**No'),(13101,'Piscate','However strong a body you may have, leave it untrained and you will end up a feeble thing.',''),(13102,'Piscate','The chakram is the true weapon. The slayers\' clumsy contrivances, made in the name of science, and the vampires\' claws are helpless against our chakrams.',''),(13103,'Piscate','We differ from the Ousters who use magic in the spirits we summon...',''),(13104,'Piscate','We warrior Ousters receive the help and protection of the spirits of mind and emotion and many others. Breathing that power into a chakram is no easy matter...',''),(13105,'Piscate','I, who was revered as the strongest warrior of our people, guard this place. Anyone who dares defile this land had best be ready to die.',''),(13200,'Elunia','Hello, Ouster. Is there anything I can help you with?','I would like to see a decent accessory if you have one.\n\t\t**I would like to sell the items I have.\n\t\t**I would like to see the war application form.\n\t\t**No, I only stopped by. Keep up the good work, Elunia.'),(13201,'Elunia','A war application is a contest between guilds of the same kind, the aim being to take each other\'s castle. What war business brings you here?','I would like to apply for a guild war to take a castle.\n\t\t**I would like to apply for the siege on the defenders\' side.\n\t\t**I would like to see the guilds that applied to fight on the defending side.\n\t\t**I would like to see the war waiting list.\n\t\t**I will apply to take part in the race war.\n\t\t**I would like to travel to the siege area.\n\t\t**I had better think it over. I will be on my way.'),(13202,'Elunia','So the Ousters have woken from their deep sleep at last.',''),(13203,'Elunia','Is Lady Lavinia in the village keeping well?',''),(13204,'Elunia','I remember the terrible war between slayers, vampires and Ousters.',''),(13205,'Elunia','As an Ouster I want to fight for our people too.',''),(13206,'Elunia','Trade is poor these days, which is a real worry.',''),(13211,'Elunia','Team %(GuildName) has applied to fight on the defending side. Will you accept?','Accept\n\t**Refuse\n\t**Cancel'),(13212,'Elunia','No guild has applied to fight on the defending side.','I will be on my way.'),(13300,'Naishas','Welcome. Do you need my help?','I am injured.\n\t\t**There is an item I need. Show me.\n\t\t**Will you buy my things?\n\t\t**I would like to reset my rank skills.\n\t\t**No, thank you. Keep up the good work.'),(13301,'Naishas','If the rank skill you have chosen does not suit you, pay a certain sum and I will wipe it for you. Each tier of rank skill can be deleted only once, and after deletion you can choose and learn whichever skill you want. Which will it be? Tell me the rank you want.','Yesod : 500,000 zad\n\t\t**Hod : 2,000,000 zad\n\t\t**Netzach : 10,000,000 zad\n\t\t**Tiferet : 50,000,000 zad\n\t\t**No. I will think it over further.'),(13302,'Naishas','Ah... one look at the ledgers and my head aches...',''),(13303,'Naishas','Guarding Adam\'s holy ground is our work.',''),(13304,'Naishas','I find myself missing Lady Lavinia.',''),(13305,'Naishas','There are a great many strong monsters in Adam\'s holy ground.',''),(13400,'Ignium','You have business with me. Let us hear what it is.','Would you repair my things?\n\t\t**I would like to buy a storage box.\n\t\t**I would like to see my storage.\n\t\t**Set resurrection point inside the castle ( fee: %(CastleResurrectFee) / use )\n\t\t**Set resurrection point outside the castle.\n\t\t**I have come about the guild\'s takings.\n\t\t**I would like to change the castle\'s tax rate.\n\t\t**I would like to travel to the Ousters\' village.\n\t\t**No, it is nothing. Keep up the good work.'),(13401,'Ignium','No word of Lady Lavinia reaches us. I shall have to go and look myself...',''),(13402,'Ignium','I would go out and fight this very moment, but...',''),(13403,'Ignium','Have you heard any news of Lady Lavinia?',''),(13404,'Ignium','Vampire or slayer, the moment I appear they are all too busy running. Ha ha ha.',''),(13405,'Ignium','Heh heh... with you here I am past it now. Ha ha.',''),(13500,'Nitrisha','Oh, hello. What do you call me for?','I would like to see armour that would suit me.\n\t\t**Would you buy the things I have?\n\t\t**I would like to see the war application form.\n\t\t**You work hard. I only stopped by to say hello. Until next time...'),(13501,'Nitrisha','A war application is a contest between guilds of the same kind, the aim being to take each other\'s castle. What war business brings you here?','I would like to apply for a guild war to take a castle.\n\t\t**I would like to apply for the siege on the defenders\' side.\n\t\t**I would like to see the guilds that applied to fight on the defending side.\n\t\t**I would like to see the war waiting list.\n\t\t**I would like to apply to take part in the race war.\n\t\t**I would like to travel to the siege area.\n\t\t**I had better think it over. I will be on my way.'),(13502,'Nitrisha','This is a very dangerous area. Everyone take care.',''),(13503,'Nitrisha','Everyone seems to be on their guard since we Ousters returned.',''),(13504,'Nitrisha','I pray Adam\'s holy ground returns to what it once was.',''),(13505,'Nitrisha','Wicked vampires and greedy slayers are defiling the holy ground.',''),(13511,'Nitrisha','Team %(GuildName) has applied to fight on the defending side. Will you accept?','Accept\n\t**Refuse\n\t**Cancel'),(13512,'Nitrisha','No guild has applied to fight on the defending side.','I will be on my way.'),(13600,'Lepri','Welcome. What do you call me for? I will do everything I can to help.','I am injured. Treat me, please.\n\t\t**Would you have any goods that might help me?\n\t\t**I want to sell my things. Would you help?\n\t\t**I want to reset my rank skills. Would you help?\n\t\t**You work hard. I am always grateful to you. Until next time.'),(13601,'Lepri','If the rank skill you have chosen does not suit you, pay a certain sum and I will delete it for you. Each tier of rank skill can be deleted only once, and after deletion you may choose and use whichever skill you wish.','Yesod : 500,000 zad\n\t\t**Hod : 2,000,000 zad\n\t\t**Netzach : 10,000,000 zad\n\t\t**Tiferet : 50,000,000 zad\n\t\t**No. I will think it over and come back.'),(13602,'Lepri','I am glad I can be here.',''),(13603,'Lepri','I am not much, but I will help you all for the time being.',''),(13604,'Lepri','Tell me if you have any questions or need anything.',''),(13605,'Lepri','Things outside are very dangerous just now. Please take care, all of you.',''),(13700,'Rowa','Is there anything I can help with? Say the word and I will help.','I would like my item repaired.\n\t\t**I would like to buy a storage box.\n\t\t**I would like to see my storage.\n\t\t**Set resurrection point inside the castle ( fee: %(CastleResurrectFee) / use )\n\t\t**Set resurrection point outside the castle.\n\t\t**I have come about the guild\'s takings.\n\t\t**I would like to change the castle\'s tax rate.\n\t\t**I would like to travel to the Ousters\' village.\n\t\t**Thank you. I will ask you again next time.'),(13701,'Rowa','How Lady Lavinia is faring just now... it worries me always...',''),(13702,'Rowa','I met a vampire once. How frightening it was...',''),(13703,'Rowa','There is so much in storage that keeping it in order is quite a task.',''),(13704,'Rowa','I am truly glad I can help you all here.',''),(14000,'Assistant','Welcome. How may I help you?','I would like to buy consumable items.\n\t\t**I would like to bring in allies to take part in the war.\n\t\t**I will be on my way.'),(15000,'Frederick','Put your firearms licence away... I have no way of checking it anyway. Not that I am an illegal arms dealer. I would have been arrested long ago if I were. Well, there is no need to know too much about me. Easier to think of me as a somewhat unusual trader. So, what business do you have with me?','Do you happen to know about this thing called "advancement"?\n\t\t**There is a rumour you exchange advancement items...\n\t\t**I will come back later.'),(15001,'Frederick','I cannot tell you the details, but I will give you a little.\n\t\tEveryone has a limit to how far they can grow, they say. But it is possible to pass that limit given the right trigger. What the trigger is I do not know, but it will not come easily. I never had any intention of challenging my own limits, of course... ha ha ha.\n\t\tIn any case, pass that limit and you break free of the restraints that bound you and your ability rises. Naturally, stronger combat techniques become learnable too. The most important part is that there is then nothing wrong with getting equipment from someone like me, unattached to any "organisation". Well, one way or another you become a transcendent.','Ah, I see. Understood.');

